<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="GEN" style="id">- YAO BIBLE VERSION</book>
  <para style="h">Ndandililo</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ndandililo</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ndandililo</para>
  <para style="toc3">Nda</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ndandililo</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ndandililo</para>
  <para style="imt">Chilongolelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Achi chitabu chaandanda cha Lilangano lyakalakala chikuŵilanjikwa “Ndandililo.” Malembelo gandanda ga Chiebulania ga chitabu chi nombe gatandite ni maloŵe gagakuti “Kundanda ko.” Chitabu chi chikulosya kwaikopochele indu yose ni Akunnungu iŵatandite kwapanganyichisya ŵandu indu yakupisyangana. Ŵasyomile agano moŵa gano akwete nganisyo syakupisyangana nkati ŵandu ŵalembile achi chitabu cha ndandililo, ni katema chi chalembekwe chitabu chi. Apali ŵandu ŵakuganisya kuti chitabu chi chalembekwe kutyochela mu malembelo gachiikala pa yaka ya 500 mpaka yaka ya 600 akanaŵe kupagwa Kilisto. Ŵandu ŵane akugakunda masyoŵelelo gagakukundikwa pasikati ja ŵandu achajinji ŵakuti che Musa ni juŵalembile chitabu cha Ndandililo, ni itabu ine chisemu Kutyoka, ni indu yapanganyisye Ŵalawi ni Kuŵalanga ni chikumbuchisyo cha Malajisyo, pasikati ja yaka ya 1300 mpaka 1400 akanaŵe kupagwa Kilisto.</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu cha ndandililo chigumbele ngani muhimu syakwakamuchisya Ŵakilisto kugamanyilila malembelo gane gagasigalile gagali mu Bibilia gaŵe gagali mu Lilangano Lyakalakala pane mu Lilangano Lyasambano. Chitabu cha Ndandililo chikutulosya sambi isyatite pakwinjila pachilambo ni ŵandu wose yakuti pakunsaka Jwakuwombola. Chitabu chi chikuunukula ukotopasyo wa Akunnungu wakwawombola ŵandu. Chindu chi chikukomboleka kumanyika kutyochela ni ulondole waandanda waukulondola nkati che Yesu (Ndandililo 3:15), ni chilanga cha Akunnungu ku che Ibulahimu cha kwapa upile ŵandu ŵa ilambo yose yaili pachilambo (Ndandililo 12:3).</para>
  <para style="iot">Yaili mwelemo</para>
  <para style="io">Akunnungu ŵachigumbile chilambo ni sooni ŵaagumbile che Adamu ni che Hawa mpela yaikuti kusalikwa mu sula 1 ni 2</para>
  <para style="io">Ngani si che Adamu ni che Hawa, nkati sambi syao ni iŵelesi yao mu sula ja 3 mpaka ja 5.</para>
  <para style="io">Ngani si che Nuhu ni yankati chikumba meesi chachikulungwa chila, ili mu sula ja 6 mpaka sula ja 9.</para>
  <para style="io">Pakumala yeleyo chitabu cha ndandililo chikusala yankati aila iyakopochele pa katema ka che Nuhu ni katema ka che Ibulahimu pamo ni ngani sya lusonga lwa Babeli mu sula ja 10 mpaka sula ja 11.</para>
  <para style="io">Ngani si che Ibulahimu, wandu wa pannango wakwe pamo ni ndande ja Waisilaeli ili mu sula ja 12 mpaka sula ja 50.</para>
  <para style="io">Umi u che Ibulahimu ni che Sala ŵakwawo ukusalikwa mu sula ja 12 mpaka sula ja 25</para>
  <para style="io">Umi u che Isaka ni che Lebeka ukusalikwa mu sula ja 21 mpaka sula ja 28 ni chiwa chao chikusalikwa mu sula ja 35.</para>
  <para style="io">Umi u che Yakubu ni achiŵanagwe ni ulendo wao kutyochela ku Kanaani kwaula ku Misili ikusalikwa mu sula ja 25 mpaka sula ja 50.</para>
  <para style="io">Ngani si che Yusufu mwanache jwakunonyelwa jwa che Yakubu ni iŵatite pakwatenda kuŵa jwankulu ku chilambo cha ku Misili ili mu sula ja 37 mpaka sula ja 50.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GEN 1" />
  <para style="s">Kugumbikwa kwa chilambo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 1:1" />Kundanda ko, Akunnungu ŵagumbile kwinani ni chilambo. <verse eid="GEN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 1:2" />Chilambo chaliji changali ukotopasyo, ni chaliji changali chindu. Chipi chauniche mwakusokosya mose mwamuli pa chilambo ni Mbumu jwa Akunnungu ŵautamile pa meesi pose. <verse eid="GEN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 1:3" />Akunnungu ŵatite, “Lupagwe lulanga,” ni lulanga lwakopochele. <verse eid="GEN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 1:4" />Akunnungu ŵaluweni lulanga kuti luli lwambone. Nipele Akunnungu ŵaŵisile pakwe pakwe lulanga ni chipi. <verse eid="GEN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 1:5" />Lulanga ŵaluŵilasile, “Muusi,” ni chipi ŵachiŵilasile, “Chilo.” Ligulo lyapite ni kwaiche kundaŵi, lyelelyo lyaliji lyuŵa lyaandanda.<verse eid="GEN 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 1:6" />Nipele Akunnungu ŵatite, “Lipesa lipagwe lilekanganye, meesi ga mwinani ni meesi ga paasi.” <verse eid="GEN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 1:7" />Nipele Akunnungu ŵapangenye lipesa, ŵalekangenye meesi, gane gaŵe mwinani ni gane gaŵe paasi. Yaliji yeleyo. <verse eid="GEN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 1:8" />Akunnungu ŵaliŵilasile lipesa lyo “Mwinani.” Ligulo lyapite ni kwaiche kundaŵi, lyelelyo lyaliji lyuŵa lyaaŵili.<verse eid="GEN 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 1:9" />Nipele Akunnungu ŵatite, “Meesi ga pachilambo gasongangane pamo, kuti papajumu paoneche.” Yaliji yeleyo. <verse eid="GEN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 1:10" />Akunnungu ŵapaŵilasile papajumu, “Lisi” ni meesi gagasongangene pamo ŵagaŵilasile “Bahali.” Nipele Akunnungu ŵaiweni kuti ili yambone. <verse eid="GEN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 1:11" />Nipele Akunnungu ŵatite, “Lisi limele mimela, mimela jijikusogola mbeju ni itela yaikusogola isogosi yaili ni mbeju.” Yaliji yeleyo. <verse eid="GEN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 1:12" />Nipele lisi lyamesisye mimela jajikusogola mbeju sya uwele wakwe ni itela yaikusogola isogosi ya mbeju sya uwele wakwe. Akunnungu ŵaiweni kuti ili yambone. <verse eid="GEN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 1:13" />Ligulo lyapite, ni kwaiche kundaŵi, lyelelyo lyaliji lyuŵa lyaatatu.<verse eid="GEN 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 1:14" />Nipele Akunnungu ŵatite, “Lulanga luŵili lupagwe mwinani, ilekanganye muusi ni chilo, ilosye katema ni ndaŵi ni lyuŵa ni yaka, <verse eid="GEN 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 1:15" />imuliche mwinani ni kulanguchisya chilambo.” Yaliji yeleyo. <verse eid="GEN 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 1:16" />Nipele Akunnungu ŵapanganyisye lulanga luŵili, lulanga lwekulungwa, yaani lyuŵa litawale muusi ni lulanga lwenandi, yaani lwesi lutawale chilo; iyoyo ŵapangenye ni ndondwa. <verse eid="GEN 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 1:17" />Akunnungu ŵasiŵisile lulanga syo mwinani kuti ilanguchisye chilambo, <verse eid="GEN 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 1:18" />ikombole kutawala muusi ni chilo ni kulekanganya lulanga ni chipi. Akunnungu ŵaiweni kuti ili yambone. <verse eid="GEN 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 1:19" />Ligulo lyapite, ni kwaiche kundaŵi, lyelelyo lyaliji lyuŵa lya ncheche.<verse eid="GEN 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 1:20" />Akunnungu ŵatite, “Yepanganyikwe yejinji yaili ni umi igumbale mmeesi ni ijuni nombeyo iguluche mwinani.” <verse eid="GEN 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 1:21" />Kwayele, Akunnungu ŵaipangenye yepanganyikwe yekulungwa ya mu bahali ni yepanganyikwe yaikutama mmesi kwa uwele wakwe, ni ijuni yose kwa uwele wakwe. Akunnungu ŵaiweni kuti ili yambone. <verse eid="GEN 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 1:22" />Akunnungu ŵaipele upile yepanganyikwe yo ni ŵaisalile, “Mmelekane, nkachuluche, nkagumbale mmesi ga mubahali ni ijuni ijonjechekwe mu chilambo.” <verse eid="GEN 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 1:23" />Ligulo lyapite, ni kwaiche kundaŵi, lyelelyo lyaliji lyuŵa lya nsano.<verse eid="GEN 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 1:24" />Nipele Akunnungu ŵatite, “Chilambo chityosye yepanganyikwe yejumi kwa uŵele wakwe: Inyama yakulangwa ni inyama yammatinji kwa uwele wakwe, ni yepanganyikwe yaikukwaŵa kwa uwele wakwe. Yaliji yeleyo.” <verse eid="GEN 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 1:25" />Akunnungu ŵapangenye inyama ya mmatinji kwa uwele wakwe ni inyama yakulangwa kwa uwele wakwe ni yepanganyikwe yaikukwaŵa kwa uwele wakwe. Akunnungu ŵaiweni kuti ili yambone.<verse eid="GEN 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 1:26" />Nipele Akunnungu ŵatite, “Twagumbe ŵandu alandane ni uwe, ni aŵeje mpela uwe. Chatawale somba sya mu bahali ni ijuni ya mwinani ni inyama yose ni chilambo chose ni yepanganyikwe yose yaikukwaŵa.” <verse eid="GEN 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 1:27" />Kwayele Akunnungu ŵaagumbile ŵandu chisau nsyene, elo chisau nsyene ŵaagumbile. Ŵaagumbile jwannume ni jwankongwe. <verse eid="GEN 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 1:28" />Akunnungu ŵapele upile ni kwasalila, “Mmelekane nkachuluche, nkachigumbasye chilambo ni kuchitenda chiŵe chenu. Nkasitawale somba sya mu bahali ni ijuni ya mwinani ni yepanganyikwe yose yaikukwaŵa pa chilambo.” <verse eid="GEN 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 1:29" />Nipele Akunnungu ŵatite, “Mpilikanile, ngumpanga kila mmela pachilambo wauli ni mbeju ni kila chitela chachili ni isogosi yaili ni mbeju, yeleyo ni ichiiŵe yakulya yenu. <verse eid="GEN 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 1:30" />Ni inyama yose ya pachilambo ni ijuni yose ya mwinani ni yepanganyikwe yose yaikukwaŵa pa chilambo, yaani yepanganyikwe yejumi yose, chakulya chao chichiŵe masamba gose ga mimela.” Yaliji yeleyo. <verse eid="GEN 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 1:31" />Akunnungu ŵaiweni kuti kila chindu chaagumbile chaliji chambone nnope. Ligulo lyapite, ni kwaiche kundaŵi, lyelelyo lyaliji lyuŵa lya sita.<verse eid="GEN 1:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GEN 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 2:1" />Yele ni iyatite pakutindimika kugumbikwa kwinani ni chilambo, pamo ni indu yose yaili mwelemo. <verse eid="GEN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 2:2" />Pa lyuŵa lya saba Akunnungu ŵamalisisye masengo gao gose gaŵapanganyaga; Nipele pa lyuwa lya saba ŵapumulile kupanganya masengo gao gose gaŵapanganyaga. <verse eid="GEN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 2:3" />Akunnungu ŵalipele upile lyuŵa lya saba ni kuliŵika pajika kuti liwe lyeswela, pakuŵa pa lyuŵa lyo Akunnungu ŵapumulile pa masengo gao gose ga kugumba.<verse eid="GEN 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngunda wa mwana wa Edeni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 2:4" />Yele ni yaitite pakugumbikwa kwinani ni chilambo, pa lyuŵa liŵagumbile Akunnungu kwinani ni chilambo. <verse eid="GEN 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 2:5" />Nganijipagwa mimela pa chilambo atamuno itela pakuŵa Ambuje Akunnungu nganaatenda jinye ula pa chilambo ni nganaapagwa mundu jwakulima, <verse eid="GEN 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 2:6" />nambo chinyesi chakwesile ni kuchinyoya chilambo chose. <verse eid="GEN 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 2:7" />Nipele Ambuje Akunnungu ŵangumbile jwannume kwa litaka, ni ŵampepele mmbula mbumu ja umi nipele mundu jula jwaliji jwanjumi.<verse eid="GEN 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 2:8" />Nipele Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaupanganyisye ngunda wa mwana kungopochelo lyuŵa ku Edeni ko ni kumelesya mimela, ni ŵambisile ajula mundu juŵangumbile. <verse eid="GEN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 2:9" />Mwelemo Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaimesisye itela yaikusalalila ya kila uwele, yaikusogola isogosi yaikufai kuligwa. Pasikati ngunda wo kwaliji ni chitela cha umi ni chitela chachikwatendekasya ŵandu aumanyilile umbone ni ungalimate.<verse eid="GEN 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 2:10" />Kwaliji ni lusulo lulwajilimaga meesi mu ngunda wa mwana wa Edeni, ni kutyochela pelepo lusulo lo lwagaŵanyiche sulo ncheche. <verse eid="GEN 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 2:11" />Liina lya lusulo lwa ndanda lili Pishoni, nombelo lwasyungwile chilambo chose cha ku Hawila, kwele ni kwasili sahabu. <verse eid="GEN 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 2:12" />Sahabu ja chele chilambo cho jili jambone. Sooni kwana mauta ga kununjila ni maganga ga ndalama jajikulungwa. <verse eid="GEN 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 2:13" />Liina lya lusulo lwa ŵili lili Gihoni, lwelelu lwasyungwile chilambo chose cha Kushi. <verse eid="GEN 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 2:14" />Ni liina lya lusulo lwa tatu lili Tigilisi, lwele lukuilimya meesi kungopochelo lyuŵa kwa chilambo cha ku Ashulu. Ni liina lya lusulo lwa ncheche lili Efulati.<verse eid="GEN 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 2:15" />Nipele Ambuje Akunnungu ŵanjigele jwannume jo ni kummika mu ngunda wa mwana wa Edeni aulime ni kuugosa. <verse eid="GEN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 2:16" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵansalile jwannume jo, “Nkukombola kulya isogosi ya chitela chilichose chachili mu ngunda wa mwana wu, <verse eid="GEN 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 2:17" />nambo nkalya isogosi ya chitela chachikwatendekasya ŵandu aumanyilile umbone ni ungalimate, pakuŵa lyuŵa lichinchilya isogosi ya chele chitela cho, isyene chimmwe.”<verse eid="GEN 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 2:18" />Nipele Ambuje Akunnungu ŵatite, “Ngaŵa yambone jwannume ju atame jika. Chinampanganyichisye mundu, juchalandane nao.” <verse eid="GEN 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 2:19" />Nipele Ambuje Akunnungu ŵajigele litaka mu lisi ŵapanganyisye inyama yose ya mmatinji kutyochela mu litaka lyo ni ijuni yose ya mwinani. Sooni ŵannyichisye jwannume jo kuti alole chiŵape meena chi, ni meena gaŵapele galiji ni meena gao. <verse eid="GEN 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 2:20" />Che Adamu ŵaipele meena inyama yose ya kulangwa ni ya mmatinji ni ijuni yose ya mwinani. Nambo mwa wose wo nganawoneka jwakulandana ni che Adamu.<verse eid="GEN 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 2:21" />Nipele Ambuje Akunnungu ŵangoneche lugono lwakutopela che Adamu jula. Ni paŵagonile, Akunnungu ŵalujigele luŵalati lwa che Adamu ni kupaunichila kwa nnou. <verse eid="GEN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 2:22" />Nipele Ambuje Akunnungu ŵangumbile jwankongwe kwa luŵalati lula ni ŵampeleche kwa che Adamu. <verse eid="GEN 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 2:23" />Ni che Adamu ŵatite,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 2:23">“Sambano aju ali liupa kutyochela mmaupa gangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 2:23">ni nnou kutyochela mu nnou wangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 2:23">Nombejo chaŵilanjikwe jwankongwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 2:23">pakuŵa atyochele mu jwannume.”<verse eid="GEN 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 2:24" />Kwaligongo lyo jwannume chiŵaaleche atati ŵao ni achikulu ŵao ni kulumbikana ni ŵankwawo, nombe ŵaŵili wo akuŵa chiilu chimo.<verse eid="GEN 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 2:25" />Che Adamu ni ŵankwawo, wose ŵaŵili ŵaliji matakope, nambo nganakola soni.<verse eid="GEN 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GEN 3" />
  <para style="s">Ungajitichisya wa mundu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 3:1" />Lijoka lyaliji lyakalamuka kwipunda inyama yose ya mwikonde yaipanganyikwe ni Ambuje Akunnungu. Nipele, lijoka lyammusisye jwankongwe jula, “Ana Ambuje Akunnungu ansalile kuti, nkalya isogosi ya chitela chilichose mu ngunda wa mwana?” <verse eid="GEN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 3:2" />Jwankongwe ŵalijanjile lijoka lila, “Tukukombola kulya isogosi ya chitela chilichose mu ngunda wa mwana, <verse eid="GEN 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 3:3" />nambo Akunnungu ŵatite, ‘Nkalya isogosi ya chitela chachili pasikati pa ngunda wa mwana, atamuno kuchikwaya, mwatendaga yele chinchiwa.’ ” <verse eid="GEN 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 3:4" />Lijoka lyanjanjile jwankongwe, “Kusyene, ngamwa. <verse eid="GEN 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 3:5" />Akunnungu ŵatite yeleyo pakuŵa akuimanyilila kuti lyuŵa lichinchilya isogosi ya chele chitela cho meeso genu chigaunukuche, ni ŵanyamwe chimme mpela Akunnungu, nchimanyililaga yambone ni yangalimate.”<verse eid="GEN 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 3:6" />Jwankongwe jula paiweni kuti isogosi ya chitela chila ili yambone kwa chakulya, nombe isalele mmeeso, ŵaganisisye kuti ili yambone kukola umanyilisi. Nipele ŵakaŵile chisogosi ni kulya, iyoyo peyo ŵampele ŵankwawo juŵaliji pamo nawo, nombejo ŵalile. <verse eid="GEN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 3:7" />Papopo ŵaunukulikwe meeso gao, ŵaimanyilile kuti ŵaliji matakope. Kwayele ŵalitotele masamba ga chitela chachikuŵilanjikwa ntini ni kuliunichila.<verse eid="GEN 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 3:8" />Nipele katema ka ligulo ŵapilikene nsindo wa Ambuje Akunnungu achendaga mu ngunda wa mwana, nombewo ŵalisisile pa itela kuti Ambuje Akunnungu anaawone. <verse eid="GEN 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 3:9" />Nambo Ambuje Akunnungu ŵambilasile che Adamu, ŵatite, “Nli kwapi?” <verse eid="GEN 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 3:10" />Nombejo ŵajanjile, “Nampilikene nli nkwenda mu ngunda wa mwana, najogwepe ni kulisisa pakuŵa ndili matakope.” <verse eid="GEN 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 3:11" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵambusisye, “Ŵaani ŵansalile kuti ndi matakope? Ana ndile isogosi ya chitela chinankanyisye nkalya?” <verse eid="GEN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 3:12" />Mundu jula ŵajanjile, “Jwankongwe jumumbele kuti aŵe pamo ni une ni juŵambele chisogosi cha chitela cho noneji nalile.”<verse eid="GEN 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 3:13" />Pelepo Ambuje Akunnungu ŵambusisye jwankongwe jo, “Kwachichi ntesile yeleyo?” Jwankongwe jo ŵajanjile, “Lijoka linambwisye, noneji ndile.”<verse eid="GEN 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Akunnungu akutangasya ulamusi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 3:14" />Nipele Ambuje Akunnungu ŵalisalile lijoka lyo, “Pakuŵa ntesile yele, nnweseche kupunda inyama yose ya kulangwa ni ya mmatinji. Chinkwaŵe kwa lutumbo lwenu ni kulya luundu moŵa gose ga umi wenu. <verse eid="GEN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 3:15" />Chimiche umagongo pasikati jenu ni jwankongwe, ni pasikati ja uŵelesi wenu ni uŵelesi wa jwankongwe. Nombewo chankase ntwe wenu nomwe chimwalume chindende chao.”<verse eid="GEN 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 3:16" />Nipele ŵansalile jwankongwe jo, “Chinampundisye chilungusi cha kuŵeleka ni chimbeleche ŵanache kwa chilungusi. Chimbe ni lungw'anu lwa ŵankwenu nombewo chantawale.”<verse eid="GEN 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 3:17" />Nipele Ambuje Akunnungu ŵansalile che Adamu, “Pakuŵa mwapikanile ŵankwenu ni kulya chisogosi cha chitela chinankanisye kuti nkalya, kwayele, kwa kuleŵa kwenu, lisi lilweseche. Kwa kupanganya masengo ga kulimba chinkole chakulya, moŵa gose ga umi wenu. <verse eid="GEN 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 3:18" />Litaka chilimele miiŵa ni michongwe, nomwe chindye maponda ga mungunda. <verse eid="GEN 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 3:19" />Kwakupanganya masengo ga kulimba gakunkoposya chitukuta chinkole chakulya mpaka pachimbuje mu litaka munkopochele, pakuŵa nangumbile ni litaka, nomwe chimbujile sooni mu litaka.”<verse eid="GEN 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 3:20" />Che Adamu ŵammilasile ŵankwakwe che Hawa, pakuŵa ŵaliji achikulu ŵa ŵandu wose. <verse eid="GEN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 3:21" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaapanganyichisye che Adamu ni ŵankwakwe iwalo ya lipende ni kwatakusya.<verse eid="GEN 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Adamu ni che Hawa akuŵinjikwa mungunda wa mwana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 3:22" />Nipele Ambuje Akunnungu ŵatite, “Sambano mundu ju aŵele mpela uwe, akuimanyilila yambone ni yangalimate. Akaika kukaŵa chisogosi ya chitela cha umi ni kulya, pakuŵa alyaga chatame moŵa gose pangali mbesi.” <verse eid="GEN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 3:23" />Nipele, Ambuje Akunnungu ŵamminjile che Adamu mu ngunda wa mwana wa Edeni, kuti akalilime litaka muŵagumbikwe. <verse eid="GEN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 3:24" />Pakumala kumminga che Adamu, Ambuje Akunnungu ŵachiŵisile chepanganyikwe chachili ni mapapiko chachikuŵilanjikwa Likelubi ku ngopochelo lyuŵa kwa Edeni lili likamulile lipanga lyalikukolela mooto lyalikugalauka akuno ni akunokuno, kulindilila litala lyalikwaula ku chitela cha umi.<verse eid="GEN 3:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GEN 4" />
  <para style="s">Che Kaini ni che Abeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 4:1" />Nipele Che Adamu ŵagonile ni ŵankwawo che Hawa, ni ŵaliji ni chitumbo, ŵammeleche Kaini. Che Hawa ŵatite, “Ambuje Akunnungu angamwisye meleche mwanache jwa chilume.” <verse eid="GEN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 4:2" />Kanyuma ŵammeleche mwanache jwine jwa chilume, ŵammilasile Abeli. Che Abeli ŵaliji jwakuchinga ngondolo, nambo che Kaini ŵaliji jwakulima. <verse eid="GEN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 4:3" />Lyuwa limo, che Kaini ŵapeleche sadaka ja magungulo gakwe kwa Ambuje. <verse eid="GEN 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 4:4" />Ni che Abeli ŵaapelechele Akunnungu sadaka ja inyama yakunakana ya mmeleko wandanda. Ambuje ŵanonyelwe ni che Abeli pamo ni sadaka jao, <verse eid="GEN 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 4:5" />nambo Ambuje ngananonyelwa ni che Kaini namose sadaka jao. Kwayele che Kaini ŵatumbile nnope ni kutaŵa sinya kumeso. <verse eid="GEN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 4:6" />Nipele Ambuje ŵaasalile che Kaini, “Kwachichi nkutumbila? Ni kwachichi ntaŵile sinya kumeso? <verse eid="GEN 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 4:7" />Iŵaga chintende yambone, ngankundikwa? Nambo pakuŵa ntesile chigongomalo, sambi jili pa nnango penu, jikunnupata, nambo nkusachilwa kusipunda.”<verse eid="GEN 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 4:8" />Nipele che Kaini ŵasalile che Abeli mpwakwe, “Twende kungunda.” Paŵaliji kungunda, che Kaini ŵanguluchile che Abeli mpwakwe ni kumbulaga. <verse eid="GEN 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 4:9" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵammusisye che Kaini, “Apwenu che Abeli ali kwapi?” Che Kaini ŵajanjile, “Kwaali! Uli, une ndili jwakunnindilila mpwanga?” <verse eid="GEN 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 4:10" />Nipele Ambuje Akunnungu ŵausisye, “Ntesile ichichi? Miasi ja mpwenu jikuundilila kutyochela mu litaka. <verse eid="GEN 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 4:11" />Sambano nlweseche mmwe ni kutopolwa pa litaka lyalikwembile miasi ja mpwenu jwamummuleje. <verse eid="GEN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 4:12" />Pachinlime, litaka ngalimpa magungulo. Chimme mundu jwa kwendajenda pachilambo, jwangali liuto lyakutama.”<verse eid="GEN 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 4:13" />Che Kaini ŵaasalile Ambuje Akunnungu, “Lijamuko limumbele likusile nnope, ngulepela kupililila. <verse eid="GEN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 4:14" />Nnole, lelo muminjile kutyochela pa litaka lya chajila ni kutalikangana ni mmwe. Nipele chime mundu jwakwendajenda, jwangali liuto lyakutama pa chilambo, ni julijose juchasimane ni une chamulaje.” <verse eid="GEN 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 4:15" />Nambo Ambuje ŵanjanjile, “Ngwamba! Juchammulaje mmwe chauchiswe mala saba.” Nipele Ambuje ŵantasile chimanyililo che Kaini, kuti jwalijose juchammone anammulaje. <verse eid="GEN 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 4:16" />Nipele che Kaini ŵatyosile paujo pa Ambuje, ni kwaula kukutama chilambo cha ku Nodi, chachili kungopochelo lyuwa kwa Edeni.<verse eid="GEN 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uŵelesi u che Kaini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 4:17" />Che Kaini ŵagonile ni ŵankwawo, nombejo ŵaliji ni chiilu, ŵammeleche mwanache jwannume liina lyakwe Enoki. Nipele che Kaini ŵataŵile musi ni ŵauŵilasile musi wo Enoki liina lya mwanagwe jo. <verse eid="GEN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 4:18" />Kwa che Enoki ŵapagwile che Iladi ni che Iladi ŵammeleche che Mehuyaeli, che Mehuyaeli ŵammeleche che Mesushaeli ni che Mesushaeli ŵammeleche che Lameki. <verse eid="GEN 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 4:19" />Che Lameki ŵalombele maŵasa, jwaandanda liina lyakwe che Ada ni jwine che Sila. <verse eid="GEN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 4:20" />Che Ada ŵammeleche che Yabali juŵaliji atati ŵa ŵandu ŵakulanga inyama ni ŵakutama mmasakasa. <verse eid="GEN 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 4:21" />Mpwakwe che Yabali ŵaliji che Yubali, jweleju ŵaliji atati jwa wose ŵakugomba ing'wenyeng'wenye ni ipeta. <verse eid="GEN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 4:22" />Che Sila nombe ŵammeleche che Tubali Kaini, juŵaliji jwakusyana yoombo ya shaba ni ya isyano. Alumbugwe che Tubali Kaini ŵaliji che Naama.<verse eid="GEN 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 4:23" />Che Lameki ŵaasalile achiŵankwakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 4:23">“Mwanya che Ada ni che Sila mumbikanile! Mpikane inguŵecheta, ŵanyamwe achiŵankwakwe che Lameki: Nammuleje mundu ligongo ŵambeteche, ni nammuleje mundu ligongo ŵamulesye.<verse eid="GEN 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 4:24" />Iŵaga che Kaini chauchiswe mala saba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 4:24">isyene che Lameki chauchiswe mala sabini na saba.”<verse eid="GEN 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Seti ni che Enoshi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 4:25" />Che Adamu ŵagonile ni ŵankwawo sooni, ni che Hawa ŵammeleche mwanache jwannume ni kummilanga liina lyakwe Seti, achitiji, “Akunnungu ambele mwanache pa liuto lya che Abeli, juŵaulegwe ni che Kaini.” <verse eid="GEN 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 4:26" />Che Seti ŵaŵeleche mwanache jwannume juŵampele liina lyakwe che Enoshi. Pelepo ni paŵatandite ŵandu kwapopelela Ambuje.<verse eid="GEN 4:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GEN 5" />
  <para style="s">Uŵelesi u che Adamu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 1:1-4">1 Indu ya katema 1:1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 5:1" />Awuwu ni uŵelesi u che Adamu. Katema Akunnungu paŵangumbile mundu, ŵangumbile alandane ni nsyene. <verse eid="GEN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 5:2" />Ŵangumbile jwannume ni jwankongwe, nipele ŵapele upile ni kwapa liina “Ŵandu.”<verse eid="GEN 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 5:3" />Che Adamu paŵaliji ni yaka mia moja ni selasini, ŵaŵeleche mwanache juŵalandene nao, ni juŵaliji mpela nsyene, ŵampele liina che Seti. <verse eid="GEN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 5:4" />Pakumala kwaŵeleka che Seti, che Adamu ŵatemi yaka mia nane, nipele ŵaŵeleche ŵanache ŵane ŵachilume ni ŵachikongwe. <verse eid="GEN 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 5:5" />Yaka yose iŵatemi che Adamu yaliji yaka mia tisa na selasini, ni ŵawile.<verse eid="GEN 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 5:6" />Che Seti paŵaliji ni yaka mia moja ni nsano, ŵammeleche che Enoshi. <verse eid="GEN 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 5:7" />Pakumala kwaŵeleka che Enoshi, che Seti ŵatemi yaka mia nane na saba, ŵaŵeleche ŵanache ŵane ŵachilume ni ŵachikongwe. <verse eid="GEN 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 5:8" />Yaka yose iŵatemi che Seti yaliji yaka mia tisa ni kumi na mbili, ni ŵawile.<verse eid="GEN 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 5:9" />Che Enoshi paŵaliji ni yaka tisini, ŵammeleche che Kenani. <verse eid="GEN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 5:10" />Pakumala kwaŵeleka che Kenani, che Enoshi ŵatemi yaka mia nane kumi na tano ni kwaŵeleka ŵanache ŵane ŵachilume ni ŵachikongwe. <verse eid="GEN 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 5:11" />Yaka yose iŵatemi che Enoshi yaliji yaka mia tisa ni nsano, ni ŵawile.<verse eid="GEN 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 5:12" />Che Kenani paŵaliji ni yaka sabini, ŵammeleche che Mahalaleli. <verse eid="GEN 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 5:13" />Pakumala kwaŵeleka che Mahalaleli, che Kenani ŵatemi yaka mia nane ni alobaini, nipele ŵaŵeleche ŵanache ŵane ŵachilume ni ŵachikongwe. <verse eid="GEN 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 5:14" />Yaka yose iwatemi che Kenani yaliji yaka mia tisa na kumi, ni ŵawile.<verse eid="GEN 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 5:15" />Che Mahalaleli paŵaliji ni yaka sitini na tano ŵammeleche che Yaledi <verse eid="GEN 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 5:16" />Pakumala kwaŵeleka che Yaledi, che Mahalaleli ŵatemi yaka mia nane na selasini ni ŵaŵeleche ŵanache ŵane ŵachilume ni ŵachikongwe. <verse eid="GEN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 5:17" />Yaka yose iŵatemi che Mahalaleli yaliji yaka mia nane tisini na tano, ni ŵawile.<verse eid="GEN 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 5:18" />Che Yaledi paŵaliji ni yaka mia moja sitini na mbili, ŵammeleche che Henoki. <verse eid="GEN 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 5:19" />Pakumala kwaŵeleka che Henoki che Yaledi ŵatemi yaka mia nane ni kwaŵeleka ŵanache ŵane ŵachilume ni ŵachikongwe. <verse eid="GEN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 5:20" />Yaka yose iwatemi che Yaledi yaliji yaka mia tisa sitini na mbili, ni ŵawile.<verse eid="GEN 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 5:21" />Che Henoki paŵaliji ni yaka sitini na tano, ŵammeleche che Metusela. <verse eid="GEN 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 5:22" />Pakumala kwaŵeleka che Metusela, che Henoki ŵatemi kwakukulupilichika paujo pa Akunnungu kwa yaka mia tatu. Che Henoki ŵaŵeleche ŵanache ŵane ŵachilume ni ŵachikongwe. <verse eid="GEN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 5:23" />Yaka yose iŵatemi che Henoki yaliji yaka mia tatu sitini na tano. <verse eid="GEN 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 5:24" />Che Henoki ŵaliji ŵakukulupilichika paujo pa Akunnungu, nipele nganawoneka sooni, pakuŵa Akunnungu ŵanjigele.<verse eid="GEN 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 5:25" />Che Metusela paŵaliji ni yaka mia moja semanini na saba, ŵammeleche che Lameki. <verse eid="GEN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 5:26" />Pakumala kwaŵeleka che Lameki, che Metusela, ŵatemi yaka mia saba semanini na mbili, ni kwaŵeleka ŵanache ŵane ŵachilume ni ŵachikongwe. <verse eid="GEN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 5:27" />Yaka yose iŵatemi che Metusela yaliji yaka mia tisa sitini na tisa, ni ŵawile.<verse eid="GEN 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 5:28" />Che Lameki paŵaliji ni yaka mia moja semanini na mbili, ŵammeleche mwanache jwachilume. <verse eid="GEN 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 5:29" />Jwele mwanache jo ŵammilasile lina lyakwe che Nuhu, ni ŵatite, “Mwanache ju chatutulasye mitima mmasengo gakulimba gagakwikanayo ipwetesi, gatukugapanganya kwa makono getu mu chilambo chiŵachilwesile Ambuje.” <verse eid="GEN 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 5:30" />Pakumala kwaŵeleka che Nuhu, che Lameki ŵatemi yaka mia tano tisini na tano, ni kwaŵeleka ŵanache ŵane ŵachilume ni ŵachikongwe. <verse eid="GEN 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 5:31" />Yaka yose iŵatemi che Lameki yaliji yaka mia saba sabini na saba, ni ŵawile.<verse eid="GEN 5:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 5:32" />Che Nuhu paŵaliji ni yaka mia tano, ŵaŵeleche ŵanache ŵatatu ŵachilume, che Shemu ni che Hamu ni che Yafeti.<verse eid="GEN 5:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GEN 6" />
  <para style="s">Ugongomalo wa Ŵandu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 6:1" />Katema ŵandu paŵajonjesyeche pa chilambo ni kwaŵeleka ŵanache ŵachikongwe, <verse eid="GEN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 6:2" />ŵana ŵa Akunnungu ŵane ŵaweni achiŵali ŵa ŵandu ali ŵakusalala, ŵaajigele ŵaŵaasachile ni kuŵa achiŵankwawo. <verse eid="GEN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 6:3" />Nipele Ambuje Akunungu ŵatite, “Mbumu jangu ngajitama mwa ŵandu moŵa gose pangali mbesi, pakuŵa ŵanyaŵa ali ŵa kuwa pe. Sambano ngaatama kupunda yaka mia moja na ishilini.” <verse eid="GEN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 6:4" />Mu gele moŵa go ni kanyuma kakwe, paliji ni mikammandu pa chilambo yayapagwile ni achiŵali ŵa ŵandu ŵaŵajigalikwe ni ŵana ŵa Akunnungu. Mikammandu yo yaliji ni machili ni yaliji nkumanyika mmoŵa go kwa kuputana ngondo, ni yaŵilanjikwe Ŵanefili.<verse eid="GEN 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 6:5" />Ambuje ŵaiweni kuti ŵandu akupanganya yachigongomalo kwannope pa chilambo, ni yose yakuiganisya mmitima jao ili yachigongomalo moŵa gose. <verse eid="GEN 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 6:6" />Ambuje ŵasongoneche nnope kwa kungumba mundu pa chilambo, ni yaapoteche nnope mu ntima. <verse eid="GEN 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 6:7" />Nipele Ambuje ŵatite, “Chinaaulaje ŵandu unaagumbile pa chilambo, iyoyopeyo chinaiulaje inyama ya mmatinji, ni yaikukwaŵa ni ijuni ya mwinani. Ngusongoneka pakuŵa naagumbile pa chilambo.” <verse eid="GEN 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 6:8" />Nambo che Nuhu ŵakundikwe paujo pa Akunnungu.<verse eid="GEN 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Nuhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 6:9" />Aji ni ngani ji che Nuhu ni uŵelesi wakwe. Che Nuhu ŵaliji mundu jwambone paujo pa Akunnungu, ni sooni nganalalatilwa ni ŵandu ŵa katema ko. Ŵatemi kwakukulupilichika paujo Akunnungu. <verse eid="GEN 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 6:10" />Che Nuhu ŵakwete ŵanache ŵatatu ŵachilume, che Shemu ni che Hamu ni che Yafeti. <verse eid="GEN 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 6:11" />Akunnungu ŵachiweni chilambo chijonasiche ni gumbala utindiganyo. <verse eid="GEN 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 6:12" />Akunnungu ŵachilolite chilambo, ŵachiweni kuti chijonasiche, pakuŵa mundu jwalijose ŵakuiye litala lyakwe lyangalumbana.<verse eid="GEN 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 6:13" />Nipele Akunnungu ŵaasalile che Nuhu, “Amwiwe kwaulaga ŵandu wose pachilambo, pakuŵa ŵandu wo augumbesye utindiganyo pa chilambo pose. Ngusala isyene, chinaajonanje ŵandu wose pamo ni chilambo chose. <verse eid="GEN 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 6:14" />Kwayele nlikolochesye ngalaŵa jekulungwa kwa chitela chakulimba, njiŵilanje safina. Nkatanye yuumba ni kupaka lami nkati ni pasa. <verse eid="GEN 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 6:15" />Nkolosye yelei, uleu mita mia moja selasini na tano, ni wipi wakwe mita ishilini na mbili ni lisusa lyakwe mita kumi na nne. <verse eid="GEN 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 6:16" />Safina jo jiŵe ni golofa sitatu ni mmiche nnango chamumbalati. Nwimbe chipagala, nipele nneche lipesa lya nusu mita sikati ja chipagala ni mwalikomele likumba lya golofa jaatatu. <verse eid="GEN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 6:17" />Mpilikane! Chinyichenacho chikumba meesi pa chilambo ni kuchijonanga chilichose chachili ni umi chachili paasi kwinani. Chilichose chejumi cha pa chilambo chichiwe. <verse eid="GEN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 6:18" />Nambo chindende lilangano ni mwe. Chinjinjile mu safina, mwe ni ŵankwenu ni ŵanache ŵenu ni achiŵankwawo. <verse eid="GEN 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 6:19" />Nomwe chinjinjisye mu safina yepanganyikwe yejumi ya uŵeleuŵele, iŵili iŵili likambaku ni likolo, aŵe ŵajumi pamo ni mmwe. <verse eid="GEN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 6:20" />Chinjinjisye ijuni iŵili iŵili ya uŵeleuŵele nkambaku ni nkolo, ni inyama ya uŵeleuŵele nkambaku ni nkolo ni yepanganyikwe yaikukwaŵa yauŵeleuŵele nkambaku ni nkolo, aŵe ŵajumi pamo ni mmwe. <verse eid="GEN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 6:21" />Nombe njigale yakulya ya uŵeleuŵele, nligosele kwaligongo lyenu ni kwaligongo lyao.” <verse eid="GEN 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 6:22" />Che Nuhu ŵapangenye yose mpela iŵatite pakulajiswa ni Akunnungu.<verse eid="GEN 6:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="GEN 7" />
  <para style="s">Chikumba meesi chekulungwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 7:1" />Ambuje ŵasalile che Nuhu, “Njinjile mu safina mmwe pamo ni ŵandu ŵa pannango penu, pakuŵa nammweni kuti mmwe jikape ni junkuunonyelesya une, pasikati ja ŵandu wose ŵa uŵelesi wu. <verse eid="GEN 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 7:2" />Mu inyama yaili yambone paujo pangu, njigale inyama sabasaba nkambaku ni nkolo, ni mu inyama yangaŵa yambone paujo pangu, njigale iŵili iŵili nkambaku ni nkolo. <verse eid="GEN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 7:3" />Ni sooni njigale ijuni ya mwinani sabasaba nkambaku ni nkolo, nnyigose kuti ijendelechele kupagwa aina zote pa chilambo. <verse eid="GEN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 7:4" />Pakuŵa pakumala moŵa saba, chinajilechelele ula pa chilambo jinye moŵa alobaini muusi ni chilo, ni chinaijonanje tikitiki yepanganyikwe yose inaigumbile yaili pachanya lisi.” <verse eid="GEN 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 7:5" />Che Nuhu ŵatesile chilichose mpela iŵatite pa kulajiswa ni Ambuje.<verse eid="GEN 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 7:6" />Che Nuhu ŵaliji ni yaka mia sita katema pichatyochele chikumba meesi chachikulungwa pa chilambo. <verse eid="GEN 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 7:7" />Che Nuhu ni ŵankwawo ni achiŵanagwe ni achiŵankwawo ŵajinjile mu safina kuchiŵambala chikumba meesi chachikulungwa. <verse eid="GEN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 7:8" />Inyama yaili yambone paujo pa Akunnungu ni inyama yangaŵa yambone paujo pa Akunnungu ni ijuni ni yepanganyikwe yaikukwaŵa, <verse eid="GEN 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 7:9" />iŵili iŵili nkambaku ni nkolo, ŵajinjile mu safina pamo ni che Nuhu mpela ila che Nuhu iŵatite pakulajiswa ni Akunnungu. <verse eid="GEN 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 7:10" />Pakumala moŵa saba, meesi ga chikumba meesi chekulungwa gatandite kuchiunichila chilambo.<verse eid="GEN 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 7:11" />Che Nuhu paŵaliji ni yaka mia sita, pa lyuŵa lya kumi na saba lya mwesi wa ŵili, lyele lyuŵa lyo uliŵa wose wa mwakusokolesya wajilime meesi mu chilambo ni kwinani kwaugwiche mpela madilisha. <verse eid="GEN 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 7:12" />Nipele ula janyele moŵa alobaini muusi ni chilo. <verse eid="GEN 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 7:13" />Lyuŵa lilyolyo che Nuhu ŵajinjile mu safina ni ŵankwawo pamo ni achiŵanagwe ŵatatu ŵachilume, che Shemu ni che Hamu ni che Yafeti pamo ni achiŵankwawo. <verse eid="GEN 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 7:14" />Ŵajinjile mu safina pamo ni inyama ya mmatinji ya uŵeleuŵele ni yakulangwa ya uŵeleuŵele ni yaikukwaŵa ya uŵeleuŵele ni ijuni ya uŵeleuŵele. <verse eid="GEN 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 7:15" />Yajinjile mu safina muŵaliji che Nuhu yepanganyikwe yaili ni umi yose iŵili iŵili. <verse eid="GEN 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 7:16" />Inyama yose yajinjile nkambaku ni likolo mpela Akunnungu iŵatite pakwalajisya che Nuhu. Nipele Ambuje ŵammugalile che Nuhu.<verse eid="GEN 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 7:17" />Chikumba meesi chekulungwa chalonjele moŵa alobaini. Meesi gagumbele ni kujijajaŵasya safina, nombejo jaliji pachanya meesi. <verse eid="GEN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 7:18" />Meesi gapundile koonjecheka mchilambo ni safina jajajaŵele pachanya meesi. <verse eid="GEN 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 7:19" />Meesi gagumbele nnope pachilambo ni kugaunichila matumbi geleu gose gagali paasi kwinani. <verse eid="GEN 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 7:20" />Meesi gagumbele nnope mpaka kugaunichila matumbi mpela mita saba. <verse eid="GEN 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 7:21" />Yepanganyikwe yejumi yose yaili pachilambo yawile: Ijuni ni inyama yakulangwa ni inyama ya mmatinji ni yepanganyikwe yaikwenda pa litaka ni ŵandu, yose yawile. <verse eid="GEN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 7:22" />Chepanganyikwe chilichose chachili pa litaka chachikupuumulila mumbula chawile. <verse eid="GEN 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 7:23" />Akunnungu ŵaijonasile yepanganyikwe yaili ni umi yose ya pachilambo, kutandilila ŵandu ni inyama ni yaikukwaŵa ni ijuni ya mwinani. Yose pachilambo yajonasikwe tipitipi. Che Nuhu pe ni juŵasigele pamo uŵaliji nawo mu safina wala. <verse eid="GEN 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 7:24" />Gele meesi gasigele pachilambo moŵa mia moja na hansini.<verse eid="GEN 7:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="GEN 8" />
  <para style="s">Chikumba meesi chekulungwa chikumala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 8:1" />Nipele Akunnungu ŵaakumbuchile che Nuhu ni inyama yose ya mmatinji ni yakulangwa iyaliji pamo nawo mu safina. Nipele, Akunnungu ŵaichenajo mbungo pachilambo ni meesi gatandite kuumilila. <verse eid="GEN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 8:2" />Uliŵa wa meesi wa mwakusokolesya ni madilisha ga kwinani yaugalikwe ni ula jalesile kunya, <verse eid="GEN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 8:3" />ni meesi gajendelechele kuumilila mbolembole pachilambo. Nipele pagapite moŵa mia moja na hansini, meesi gapungwiche nnope. <verse eid="GEN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 8:4" />Pa lyuwa lya kumi na saba lya mwesi wa saba Safina jatusile mmatumbi ga Alalati. <verse eid="GEN 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 8:5" />Meesi gajendelechele kuumilila mbolembole ni lyuŵa lyaandanda lya mwesi wa kumi, songa sya matumbi syaoneche.<verse eid="GEN 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 8:6" />Pagamasile moŵa alobaini, che Nuhu ŵaugwile lidilisha liŵakolosisye mu safina, <verse eid="GEN 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 8:7" />ni ŵalikopwesye likunguulu paasa, nombelyo nganiliuja nambo lyagulwichegulwiche ako ni ako mpaka pagajumwile meesi pachilambo. <verse eid="GEN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 8:8" />Nipele che Nuhu ŵajikopwesye nguunda kuti alole iŵaga meesi galiji gajumilile pachilambo. <verse eid="GEN 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 8:9" />Nambo pakuŵa meesi galiji gagumbele pa chilambo pose, nguunda jila jalepele kutula, jausile ku che Nuhu mu safina. Che Nuhu ŵagolwesye nkono, ŵajijigele ni kujijinjisya mu safina. <verse eid="GEN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 8:10" />Che Nuhu ŵalindilile moŵa gane saba ni kujituma ngunda kaaŵili. <verse eid="GEN 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 8:11" />Jele ngunda jo jausile ku che Nuhu katema ka ligulo jili jijigele lisamba lyeŵisi lya mseituni mu lugomo. Kwayele che Nuhu ŵaimanyilile kuti meesi gapuungwiche pa chilambo. <verse eid="GEN 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 8:12" />Nipele che Nuhu ŵalindilile moŵa gane saba, ŵajitumile sooni ngunda jila nambo ngunda jila nganijiuja sooni.<verse eid="GEN 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 8:13" />Che Nuhu paŵaliji ni yaka mia sita ni umo, pa lyuŵa lyaandanda lya mwesi waandanda, meesi gajumwile pachilambo. Che Nuhu ŵachityosisye chipagala cha safina ni paŵalolite, ŵaiweni kuti chilambo chejumule. <verse eid="GEN 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 8:14" />Pa lyuŵa lya ishilini na saba lya mwesi waaŵili, chilambo chajumwile.<verse eid="GEN 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 8:15" />Nipele, Akunnungu ŵansalile che Nuhu, <verse eid="GEN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 8:16" />“Nkopoche mu safina, mwe ni ŵankweni, ni ŵanagwenu pamo ni achiŵankwawo. <verse eid="GEN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 8:17" />Nnyikoposye yepanganyikwe yose ya uŵeleuŵele yaili pamo ni mmwe: Ijuni yose ni inyama yose ni yepanganyikwe yose yaikukwaŵa, kuti iŵelekane nnope, ijonjesyeche ni kuchigumbasya chilambo.” <verse eid="GEN 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 8:18" />Nipele, che Nuhu ŵakopweche mu safina ni ŵankwawo ni achiŵanagwe pamo ni achiŵankwawo. <verse eid="GEN 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 8:19" />Inyama yose ni yepanganyikwe yaikukwaŵa yose ni ijuni yose yakopweche mu safina mpela iyatite kwinjila.<verse eid="GEN 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Nuhu akupeleka mbopesi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 8:20" />Nipele che Nuhu ŵaataŵile Ambuje chilisa, ŵajigele jumo jumo mwa inyama ni ijuni yaili yambone paujo pa Akunnungu ni kwapelechela Akunnungu mbopesi ja kutinisya pa chilisa. <verse eid="GEN 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 8:21" />Ambuje ŵanusisye ununjile wambone wa mbopesi jo ni kunonyelwa najo, Ambuje ŵalisalile, “Nganguchilwesya sooni ng'oo chilambo kwaligongo lya aila yakuitendekanya ŵandu, nguimanyilila kuti ng'anisyo syao sili syangalimate chitandile kuuwanache wao. Atamuno ngunajonanga sooni yepanganyikwe yose yejumi mpela inatite kupanganya. <verse eid="GEN 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 8:22" />Mpela ichikuti kulonjela chilambo, chikapagwe katema kakupanda ni katema kakugungula ni katema kamalili ni katema kantukuta ni katema kachuuku ni katema ka chau ni katema ka muusi ni chilo, ngaimala.”<verse eid="GEN 8:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="GEN 9" />
  <para style="s">Akunnungu akuŵika lilangano ni che Nuhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 9:1" />Nipele Akunnungu ŵampele upile che Nuhu ni achiŵanagwe, ŵaasalile, “Mmeleche, njonjesyeche nkachigumbasye chilambo. <verse eid="GEN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 9:2" />Inyama yose ni ijuni ya mwinani yose ni yepanganyikwe yaikukwaŵa yose pachilambo ni somba syose sya mu bahali, yose ili mu ulamusi wenu, nombeyo chiikole lipamba ni kunjogopa ŵanyamwe. <verse eid="GEN 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 9:3" />Inyama yose chiiŵe chakulya chenu, ngumpanga mpela ila inditite pakumpa mimela kuŵa chakulya chenu. <verse eid="GEN 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 9:4" />Nambo ngasinlya nyama jili ni miasi, umi uli mu miasi. <verse eid="GEN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 9:5" />Mundu jwalijose ambulagaga njakwe chalamulikwe. Ni chinyama chilichose chachichiulaje mundu chinachiulaje. <verse eid="GEN 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 9:6" />Mundu jwalijose juchammulaje njakwe nombejo aulajikwe ni ŵandu, pakuŵa Akunnungu ŵangumbile mundu kwa kulandana ni asyene.<verse eid="GEN 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 9:7" />“Ni ŵanyamwe mmeleche nkajonjesyeche, mmeleche kwannope nkachigumbasye chilambo.”<verse eid="GEN 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 9:8" />Nipele Akunnungu ŵansalile che Nuhu ni achiŵanagwe, <verse eid="GEN 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 9:9" />“Sambano nguŵika lilangano lyangu ni ŵanyamwe pampepe ni uŵelesi ŵenu, <verse eid="GEN 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 9:10" />ni chepanganyikwe chachilichose chachili pamo ni wanyamwe: Ijuni ya mwinani ni inyama yakulangwa ni ya mmatinji, ni wose ŵaŵakopweche pamo ni ŵanyamwe mu safina. <verse eid="GEN 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 9:11" />Ngulisalichisya lilangano lyangu ni ŵanyamwe kuti, ngunaaulaga yepanganyikwe yose ni chikumba meesi chekulungwa atamuno ngachityochela chikumba meesi ng'oo kuchijonanga chilambo.” <verse eid="GEN 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 9:12" />Sooni Akunnungu ŵatite, “Achi ni chimanyisyo cha lilangano lyangu lingutenda ni ŵanyanwe pampepe ni yepanganyikwe yejumi yose yaili pamo ni ŵanyamwe kwa iŵelesi yose ichiiche. <verse eid="GEN 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 9:13" />Nguŵika ukunje wa ula kumaunde, ni wele chiuŵe chimanyisyo cha lilangano lyangu ni chilambo. <verse eid="GEN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 9:14" />Katema kose pachiichenago maunde pachilambo ni ukunje wa ula pachiutyochele mmaunde, <verse eid="GEN 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 9:15" />chinalikumbuchile lilangano lyangu ni ŵanyamwe pamo ni yepanganyikwe yejumi yose. Iyoyo chikumba meesi chekulungwa ngachiulaga yepanganyikwe yejumi. <verse eid="GEN 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 9:16" />Wele ukunje wa ula pachiutyoche kumaunde, chinauwone ni kulikumbuchila lilangano lyangu lya moŵa gose pangali mbesi lyalili pasikati jangu ni yepanganyikwe yose yaili ni umi ya uŵeleuŵele pachilambo.” <verse eid="GEN 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 9:17" />Nipele Akunnungu ŵansalile che Nuhu, “Achi ni chimanyisyo cha lilangano lindesile pasikati jangu ni yepanganyikwe yose pachilambo.”<verse eid="GEN 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Nuhu ni achiŵanagwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 9:18" />Ŵanache ŵa che Nuhu uŵakopweche mu safina ŵaliji che Shemu ni che Hamu ni che Yafeti. Che Hamu ŵaliji atatigwe che Kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 9:19" />Ŵele ŵatatu wo ali achiŵanagwe che Nuhu ni kutyochela mwa ŵelewo ŵandu ŵagumbele mchilambo chose.<verse eid="GEN 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 9:20" />Che Nuhu ŵatandite kulima, ni ŵapandile misabibu. <verse eid="GEN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 9:21" />Ŵang'wele divai, ŵakolelwe, nipele ŵausile iwalo yao ŵagonile matakope mu lisakasa lyao. <verse eid="GEN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 9:22" />Che Hamu, atatigwe che Kanaani, paŵammweni atatigwe ali matakope, ŵakopweche paasa ni kwasalila achapwakwe ŵaŵili. <verse eid="GEN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 9:23" />Nambo che Shemu ni che Yafeti ŵajigele nguo, ŵaliuniche mmakoyo mwao, ŵajawile chitukulu nyuma ni kwaunika atati ŵao. Ŵalolite pambali kuti ngasiŵawona atati ŵao ali matakope. <verse eid="GEN 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 9:24" />Che Nuhu puwaatyosile divai muntwe ŵaimanyilile iŵaitesile mwanagwe jwannandi, <verse eid="GEN 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 9:25" />ŵatite,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:25">“Che Kanaani alweseche!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:25">Chaaŵe kapolo jwa pasi nnope mwa achikapolo ŵa achapwakwe.”<verse eid="GEN 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 9:26" />Sooni ŵatite, “Ajinichilwe Ambuje, Akunnungu jwa che Shemu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:26">Kanaani aŵe kapolo jwakwe.<verse eid="GEN 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 9:27" />Akunnungu auchulusye uŵelesi u che Yafeti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:27">Che Yafeti atame mmasakasa ga che Shemu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 9:27">Kanaani aŵe kapolo jwakwe.”<verse eid="GEN 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 9:28" />Pachamasile chikumba meesi che Nuhu ŵatemi yaka mia tatu na hansini. <verse eid="GEN 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 9:29" />Yaka yose iŵatemi che Nuhu yaliji yaka mia tisa na hansini, ni ŵawile.<verse eid="GEN 9:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="GEN 10" />
  <para style="s">Isukulu i che Nuhu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 1:5-23">1 Indu ya katema 1:5-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 10:1" />Jeleji jili ngani ja ŵanache ŵa che Nuhu: Che Shemu ni che Hamu ni che Yafeti ŵaŵaŵeleche ŵanache ŵachilume ni ŵachikongwe pachamasile chikumba meesi chekulungwa.<verse eid="GEN 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 10:2" />Ŵanache ŵa che Yafeti ŵaliji che Gomeli ni che Magogu ni che Madai ni che Yavani ni che Tubali ni che Mesheki ni che Tilasi. <verse eid="GEN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 10:3" />Ŵanache ŵa che Gomeli ŵaliji che Ashikenasi ni che Lifati ni che Togama. <verse eid="GEN 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 10:4" />Ŵanache ŵa che Yavani ŵaliji che Elisha ni che Talishishi ni che Kitimu ni che Lodanimu. <verse eid="GEN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 10:5" />Ŵandu ŵa ali achachekulu ŵa ŵandu uŵatamaga kumbwani jwalijose kwa iŵecheto yakwe, ni kwa ngosyo syao ni kwa ilambo yao.<verse eid="GEN 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 10:6" />Ŵanache ŵachilume ŵa che Hamu ŵaliji che Kushi ni che Misili ni che Puti ni che Kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 10:7" />Ŵanache ŵachilume ŵa che Kushi ŵaliji che Seba ni che Havila ni che Sabita ni che Laama ni che Sabiteka. Ŵanache ŵachilume ŵa che Laama ŵaliji che Sheba ni che Dedani. <verse eid="GEN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 10:8" />Che Kushi ŵaŵeleche che Nimulodi juŵaliji mundu jwakuputana jwaandanda jwa machili pachilambo. <verse eid="GEN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 10:9" />Ŵaliji jwakulupata jwakangamala pameso pa Akunnungu, nipele kwana uŵecheto waukuti, “Mpela che Nimulondi jwakulupata jwakangamala paujo pa Akunnungu.” <verse eid="GEN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 10:10" />Misi jandanda jiŵatawele che Nimulodi jaliji ku Babeli ni ku Eleki ni ku Akadi ni ku Kaline kuchilambo cha Shinali. <verse eid="GEN 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 10:11" />Kutyochela kwele, che Nimulodi ŵajawile ku Ashulu, ŵataŵile misi ja ku Ninawi ni ku Lehobosi Ili ni ku Kala, <verse eid="GEN 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 10:12" />ni ku Leseni musi wauli pasikati ja ku Ninawi ni musi wekulu wa ku Kala.<verse eid="GEN 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 10:13" />Che Misili ŵaliji ambuje jwa Ŵaludi ni Ŵaanamu ni Ŵalehabi ni Ŵanafituhi, <verse eid="GEN 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 10:14" />Ŵapatilasi ni Ŵakasiluhi, kweleko ni kuŵatyochele Ŵafilisiti ni Ŵakafitoli.<verse eid="GEN 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 10:15" />Mwanache jwa kwitiwo ju che Kanaani jwaŵilanjikwe che Sidoni, juŵaliji ambuje jwa Ŵasidoni. Che Kanaani iyoyo ŵaliji ambuje jwa Ŵahiti, <verse eid="GEN 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 10:16" />ni Ŵayebusi ni Ŵaamoli ni Ŵagiligasi, <verse eid="GEN 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 10:17" />ni Ŵahivi ni Ŵaaliki ni Ŵasini, <verse eid="GEN 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 10:18" />Ŵaalivadi ni Ŵasemali ni Ŵahamati. Kanyuma ngosyo sya Ŵakanaani syapwilingene. <verse eid="GEN 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 10:19" />Mipika ja Kanaani jajenele kutandilila ku Sidoni kwaula ku Gelali mpaka ku Gasa, kwaula kungopochelo lyuŵa mpaka ku Sodoma ni ku Gomola, ni ku Adima ni ku Seboimu ni ku Lasha. <verse eid="GEN 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 10:20" />Wele uli uŵelesi u che Hamu malinga ni ngosyo syao ni iŵecheto yao ni ilambo yao.<verse eid="GEN 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 10:21" />Che Shemu, akulugwe che Yafeti ŵaliji ambuje jwa Ŵaebulania wose. <verse eid="GEN 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 10:22" />Ŵanache ŵachilume ŵa che Shemu ŵaliji che Elamu ni che Ashulu ni che Alifakisadi ni che Ludi ni che Alamu. <verse eid="GEN 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 10:23" />Ŵanache ŵachilume ŵa che Alamu ŵaliji che Usi ni che Huli ni che Geseli ni che Mashi. <verse eid="GEN 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 10:24" />Che Alifakisadi ŵammeleche che Shela ni che Shela ŵammeleche che Ebeli. <verse eid="GEN 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 10:25" />Che Ebeli ŵaliji ni ŵanache ŵaŵili ŵachilume, jwaandanda ŵammilasile che Pelegi pakuŵa kele katema ko ŵandu ŵa pachilambo ŵagaŵanyiche ni mwanache jwaaŵili ŵammilasile che Yokitani. <verse eid="GEN 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 10:26" />Che Yokitani ŵaŵeleche che Alimodadi ni che Shelefu ni che Hasalimawesi ni che Yela, <verse eid="GEN 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 10:27" />ni che Hadolamu ni che Usali ni che Dikila, <verse eid="GEN 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 10:28" />ni che Obali ni che Abimaeli ni che Sheba, <verse eid="GEN 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 10:29" />ni che Ofili ni che Haŵila ni che Yobabu. Ŵele wose ŵaliji ŵanache ŵa che Yokitani. <verse eid="GEN 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 10:30" />Chilambo chiŵatamaga chatandilile ku Mesha mpaka ku Sefali chilambo cha matumbi chachili kungopochelo lyuŵa. <verse eid="GEN 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 10:31" />Welewo ni uŵelesi u che Shemu, malinga ni ngosyo syao ni iŵecheto yao ni ilambo yao ni ŵandu ŵao.<verse eid="GEN 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 10:32" />Syelesi ni ngosyo sya ŵanache ŵa che Nuhu, malinga ni iŵelesi yao ni ilambo yao. Mwa ŵele ŵanyaŵa, ŵandu ŵajenele pa chilambo pose pakumala chikumba meesi chekulungwa.<verse eid="GEN 10:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="GEN 11" />
  <para style="s">Lusonga lwa Babeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 11:1" />Katema ko ŵandu wose ŵa pachilambo ŵaŵechete chiŵecheto chimo, ni maloŵe gao galandene. <verse eid="GEN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 11:2" />Nipele, paŵasamagasamaga ŵandu kutyoka kungopochelo lyuŵa, ŵaiche pachilambo chachili ni lutando cha ku Shinali ni kutama kweleko. <verse eid="GEN 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 11:3" />Ŵaŵechetesyene achinsyene achitiji, “Ayaga! Tugumbe matofali, tugachome galimbangane.” Ŵataŵile kwa matofali pamalo pa maganga ni lami pamalo pa chokaa. <verse eid="GEN 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 11:4" />Ŵatite, “Ayaga, tutaŵe musi ni tutaŵe lusonga lwati kumbesi kwakwe kuiche kwinani, pakuti tukole liina, tukaika kupwilingana pachilambo chose.”<verse eid="GEN 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 11:5" />Nipele Ambuje ŵatulwiche paasi kukulola wele musi ni lusonga lwalukutaŵikwa ni ŵandu. <verse eid="GEN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 11:6" />Ambuje ŵatite, “Nnole, ŵandu ŵa aŵele ŵandu ŵa chilambo chimo ni chiwecheto chimo, ni gelega gali ndande ja agala gakusaka kupanganya. Sambano ngaikomboleka kwasiŵila kuchitendekanya chilichose chakusaka kuchipanganya. <verse eid="GEN 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 11:7" />Ayaga, tutuluche paasi ni kwatindiganya chiŵecheto chao anakombole kwilana.” <verse eid="GEN 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 11:8" />Nipele Ambuje ŵaapwilingenye ŵandu kutyochela pepala ajaule palipose mu chilambo pose, nombewo ŵalesile kutaŵa musi ula. <verse eid="GEN 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 11:9" />Musi ula waŵilanjikwe Babeli ligongo kweleko Ambuje ni kuŵatindigenye chiŵecheto cha chilambo chose, ni kutyochela pelepo Ambuje ŵaapwilingenye ŵandu ajaule mu chilambo chose.<verse eid="GEN 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iŵelesi i che Shemu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 1:24-27">1 Indu ya katema 1:24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 11:10" />Ayiyi ni iŵelesi i che Shemu. Yaka iŵili pachamasile chikumba meesi, che Shemu ŵaliji ni yaka mia moja, ni ŵammeleche che Alifakisadi. <verse eid="GEN 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 11:11" />Che Shemu paŵammeleche che Alifakisadi, che Sela ŵatemi yaka ine mia tano, ni ŵakwete sooni ŵanache ŵane ŵachilume ni ŵachikongwe.<verse eid="GEN 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 11:12" />Che Alifakisadi paŵaliji ni yaka selasini na tano, ŵammeleche che Sela. <verse eid="GEN 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 11:13" />Che Alifakisadi paŵammeleche che Sela, che Alifakisadi ŵatemi yaka ine mia nne ni itatu, ni ŵakwete ŵanache ŵane ŵachilume ni ŵachikongwe.<verse eid="GEN 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 11:14" />Che Sela paŵaliji ni yaka selasini, ŵammeleche che Ebeli. <verse eid="GEN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 11:15" />Che Sela paŵammeleche che Ebeli, che Sela ŵatemi yaka mia nne ni itatu, ni ŵakwete ŵanache ŵane ŵachilume ni ŵachikongwe.<verse eid="GEN 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 11:16" />Che Ebeli paŵaliji ni yaka selasini na nne, ŵammeleche che Pelegi. <verse eid="GEN 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 11:17" />Che Ebeli paŵammeleche che Pelegi, che Ebeli ŵatemi yaka mia nne na selasini, ni ŵakwete ŵanache ŵane ŵachilume ni ŵachikongwe.<verse eid="GEN 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 11:18" />Che Pelegi paŵaliji ni yaka selasini, ŵammeleche che Leu. <verse eid="GEN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 11:19" />Che Pelegi paŵammeleche che Leu, che Pelegi ŵatemi yaka mia mbili na tisa, ni ŵakwete ŵanache ŵane ŵachilume ni ŵachikongwe.<verse eid="GEN 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 11:20" />Che Leu paŵaliji ni yaka selasini na mbili, ŵammeleche che Selugi. <verse eid="GEN 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 11:21" />Che Leu paŵammeleche che Selugi, che Leu ŵatemi yaka mia mbili na saba, ni ŵakwete ŵanache ŵane ŵachilume ni ŵachikongwe.<verse eid="GEN 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 11:22" />Che Selugi paŵaliji ni yaka selasini, ŵammeleche che Naholi. <verse eid="GEN 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 11:23" />Che Selugi paŵammeleche che Naholi, che Selugi ŵatemi yaka mia mbili, ni ŵakwete ŵanache ŵane ŵachilume ni ŵachikongwe.<verse eid="GEN 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 11:24" />Che Naholi paŵaliji ni yaka ishilini na tisa, ŵammeleche che Tela. <verse eid="GEN 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 11:25" />Che Naholi paŵammeleche che Tela, che Naholi ŵatemi yaka mia moja na kumi na tisa, ni ŵakwete ŵanache ŵane ŵachilume ni ŵachikongwe.<verse eid="GEN 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 11:26" />Che Tela paŵaliji ni yaka sabini, ŵaaŵeleche che Iblamu ni che Naholi ni che Halani.<verse eid="GEN 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iŵelesi i che Tela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 11:27" />Ayiyi ni iŵelesi i che Tela, atati ŵao che Iblamu ni che Naholi ni che Halani. Che Halani ŵammeleche che Lutu. <verse eid="GEN 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 11:28" />Che Halani ŵawilile ku Ulu, chilambo cha Ŵakalidayo kuŵapagwile katema che Tela atatigwe ali nkutama mu musi wo. <verse eid="GEN 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 11:29" />Che Iblamu ni che Naholi ŵalombele. Ŵankwawo che Iblamu ŵaŵilanjikwe che Salai, ni ŵankwawo che Naholi ŵaŵilanjikwe che Milika mwali ju che Halani. Che Halani ali atati ŵa che Milika ni che Isika. <verse eid="GEN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 11:30" />Che Salai nganakola ŵanache ligongo ŵaliji ngaakuŵeleka.<verse eid="GEN 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 11:31" />Che Tela ŵaajigele che Iblamu mwanagwe pamo ni che Lutu chisukulu chao, mwanache ju che Halani, ni che Salai akwegwao, ŵankwakwe che Iblamu, wose ŵatyosile musi wa ku Ulu chilambo cha Ŵakalidayo ni kwaula ku Kanaani. Nambo paŵaiche ku Halani, ŵatemi pelepo. <verse eid="GEN 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 11:32" />Yaka yose iŵatemi che Tela yaliji yaka mia mbili na tano ni ŵawilile akula ku Halani.<verse eid="GEN 11:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="GEN 12" />
  <para style="s">Akunnungu akwaŵilanga che Iblamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 12:1" />Ambuje ŵaasalile che Iblamu, “Ntyoche mu chilambo chenu, mwaleche achalongo achinjenu ni ŵandu ŵaali mu nyuumba ja atati ŵenu, njaule ku chilambo kuchinannosye. <verse eid="GEN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 12:2" />Chinantende mme chilambo chachikulungwa, ni kumpa upile ni kulitenda liina lyenu limanyiche, ni mmwe chimme upile.<verse eid="GEN 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 12:3" />Uchampe upile mmwe, none chinaape upile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 12:3">Nambo juchannwesye mmwe, none chinaalwesye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 12:3">Ni kutyochela kwenumwe ŵandu wose ŵa ilambo yose chapegwe upile.”<verse eid="GEN 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 12:4" />Kwayele, che Iblamu ŵatyosile mpela iŵatite pakusalilwa ni Ambuje ni che Lutu ŵaliji pamo nawo. Che Iblamu ŵaliji ni yaka sabini na tano paŵatyosile ku Halani. <verse eid="GEN 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 12:5" />Che Iblamu ŵanjigele che Salai ŵankwawo ni che Lutu mwanache jwa mpwakwe, pamo ni ipanje yao yose ni ŵandu wose ŵaŵaapatile ku Halani ni kwaula kuchilambo cha Kanaani. Paŵajinjile mu chilambo cha Kanaani, <verse eid="GEN 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 12:6" />che Iblamu ŵapitile pasikati ja chilambo cho mpaka ŵaiche ku Shekemu, pa chitela chachikulungwa chachikuŵilanjikwa Mole. Kele katema ko Ŵakanaani ni uŵaliji achinsyene chilambo cho. <verse eid="GEN 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 12:7" />Nipele Ambuje ŵankopochele che Iblamu ni kwasalila, “Iŵelesi yenu chinaape chilambo chi.” Pelepo che Iblamu ŵaataŵile chilisa Ambuje juŵankopochele. <verse eid="GEN 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 12:8" />Kutyochela pelepo che Iblamu ŵatyosile ni kwaula mpaka kuchikwesya kungopochelo lyuŵa kwa chilambo cha Beseli ni kweleko ŵataŵile lisakasa lyao, ŵatemi pasikati ja musi wa Beseli wauli upaande wa kumaswelo lyuŵa ni ku Ai wauli upaande wa kungopochelo lyuŵa. Kweleko nombe ŵaataŵile Ambuje chilisa cha maganga ni kwapopelela. <verse eid="GEN 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 12:9" />Ni che Iblamu ŵajendelechele ni ulendo upaande wa kulujenda.<verse eid="GEN 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Iblamu mu chilambo cha Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 12:10" />Kele katema ko, jakopochele sala ja jajikulungwa pachilambo cha Kanaani. Kwayele che Iblamu ŵatulwiche kwaula kuchilambo cha Misili ni kutama kweleko kwa katema. <verse eid="GEN 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 12:11" />Che Iblamu paŵaŵandichile kwinjila ku Misili, ŵaasalile che Salai ŵankwakwe, “Nguimanyilila kuti mmwe ndi jwankongwe jwakusalala. <verse eid="GEN 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 12:12" />Ŵamisili pachammone chasale, ‘Aŵa ali ŵankwawo,’ nipele chammulaje une ni mmwe kunneka ŵajumi. <verse eid="GEN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 12:13" />Choonde, mwasalile kuti mmwe nli alumbu ŵangu kuti iŵe yambone kukwangu, aaneche jwanjumi kwaligongo lyenu.” <verse eid="GEN 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 12:14" />Nipele, che Iblamu paŵaiche ku Misili, Ŵamisili ŵaweni che Salai kuti ali jwankongwe jwakusalala nnope. <verse eid="GEN 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 12:15" />Ni achakulu ŵa Falao paŵaweni che Salai, ŵakulapile kusalala kwao kwa Falao. Nipele ŵajawisye che Salai ku nyuumba ja Falao. <verse eid="GEN 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 12:16" />Kwaligongo li che Salai, Falao ŵatendele yambone che Iblamu, ŵapele ngondolo ni ng'ombe ni mbunda ni achikapolo achalume ni achakongwe ni mikolo ja mbunda ni ngamia.<verse eid="GEN 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 12:17" />Nambo Ambuje ŵanlagesye Falao kwa kwaichisya ilwele yakupunda ni achalongo achinjakwe wose ligongo ŵanjigele che Salai, ŵankwakwe che Iblamu. <verse eid="GEN 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 12:18" />Nipele Falao ŵammilasile che Iblamu, ni kwausya, “Kwachichi mundesile yeleyi? Ligongo chi nganimuusalila kuti che Salai ali ŵankwenu? <verse eid="GEN 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 12:19" />Ana kwaligongo chi mwatite ali alumbu ŵenu mpaka naajigele ni kwatenda ŵankwangu? Sambano ŵankwenu aŵapa. Mwajigale njaule!” <verse eid="GEN 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 12:20" />Nipele Falao ŵalajisye ŵandu ŵakwe ŵaajigale che Iblamu ni ŵankwawo ni ipanje yao yose, ŵaakoposye Mmisili.<verse eid="GEN 12:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="GEN 13" />
  <para style="s">Che Iblamu ni che Lutu akulekangana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 13:1" />Che Iblamu ŵausile kutyochela ku Misili, ŵakwesile kwaula ku lujenda kwa Kanaani. Ŵaliji ni ŵankwawo ni chachilichose chiŵakwete, ni che Lutu ŵajawile pamo ni jwelejo che Lutu. <verse eid="GEN 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 13:2" />Kele katema ko che Iblamu ŵaliji jwa chipanje nnope, ŵakwete ilango yejinji ni madini ga feza ni Sahabu. <verse eid="GEN 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 13:3" />Ŵajendelechele ni ulendo kutyochela ku lujenda mpaka ŵaiche ku Beseli. Ŵaiche peuto paŵataŵile lisakasa kuundanda, pasikati ja ku Beseli ni ku Ai, <verse eid="GEN 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 13:4" />apala peuto paŵataŵile che Iblamu chilisa cha maganga, kweleko ni kuŵaapopelele Ambuje. <verse eid="GEN 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 13:5" />Ni che Lutu juŵaliji pamo ni che Iblamu mu ulendo, nombejo ŵaliji ni ngondolo ni mbusi ng'ombe ni masakasa. <verse eid="GEN 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 13:6" />Ilango yao yaliji yejinji nnope ni chilambo chila chaliji chachinandi, nganichikwana kwa che Iblamu ni che Lutu kutama pamo ni kulisisya ilango. <verse eid="GEN 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 13:7" />Nipele kwatyochele umani sikati ŵakuchinga ŵa che Iblamu ni che Lutu. Katema ko Ŵakanaani ni Ŵapelisi ŵaliji akutama mu chilambo cho.<verse eid="GEN 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 13:8" />Nipele che Ablahamu ŵansalile che Lutu, “Tukatindana mmwe ni une atamuno ŵakuchinga ŵangu ni ŵakuchinga ŵenu ligongo uwe tuli achalongo. <verse eid="GEN 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 13:9" />Uli chilambo chose nganichiŵa mmbujo mwenu? Twende tulekangane, mwajaulaga kunchiji none chinyaule kundyo yaŵaga chinjaule kundyo none chinyaule kunchiji.”<verse eid="GEN 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 13:10" />Che Lutu ŵalolite, ŵaliweni lichemba lya lusulo lwa Yolodani, likwete meesi gamajinji mwamulimose, mpela ngunda wa mwana wa Ambuje ni mpela chilambo cha ku Misili chachili mbande ja Soali. Yeleyi yaliji Ambuje akanaŵe kujijonanga misi ja ku Sodoma ni ku Gomola. <verse eid="GEN 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 13:11" />Kwayele che Lutu ŵalisagulile lichemba lyose lya Yolodani, ŵajawile upaande wa kungopochelo lyuŵa. Yeleyi ni iŵatite kulekangana ŵandu ŵa. <verse eid="GEN 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 13:12" />Che Iblamu ŵasigele ku chilambo cha ku Kanaani ni che Lutu ŵatemi mu misi jajili pa lichemba lya Yolodani, nipele ŵataŵile masakasa gakwe chiŵandika ni ku Sodoma. <verse eid="GEN 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 13:13" />Nambo ŵandu ŵa ku Sodoma ŵaliji ŵachigongomalo kwannope ni ŵaliji nkwatendela Ambuje sambi syasijinji nnope.<verse eid="GEN 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Iblamu akwaula ku Hebuloni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 13:14" />Che Lutu paŵamasile kulekangana ni che Iblamu, Ambuje ŵansalile che Iblamu, “Pelepo panli po nnolechesye yambone mbande syose ncheche sya chilambo. <verse eid="GEN 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 13:15" />Chilambo chose chinkuchiwona chi chinampe mmwe ni uŵelesi wenu, chiŵe chenu moŵa gose pangali mbesi. <verse eid="GEN 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 13:16" />Uŵelesi wenu tinauchulusye ni ngauŵalanjika, mpela luundu lwa pachilambo. Ni mpela ila mundu yakuti kulepela kuŵalanga luundu, iyoyo peyo ngapagwa mundu juchakombole kuuŵalanjila uŵelesi wenu. <verse eid="GEN 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 13:17" />Sambano njimuche, njaule nkajimejime mu chilambo chose chanchileu ni chanchijipi, pakuŵa chilambo chose cho chinampe mmwe.” <verse eid="GEN 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 13:18" />Kwayele che Iblamu ŵalityosisye lisakasa lyao, ŵajawile kutama chiŵandi ni itela yekulungwa ya ku Mamle ku Hebuloni ko. Kweleko ŵaataŵile Akunnungu chilisa cha maganga.<verse eid="GEN 13:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="GEN 14" />
  <para style="s">Che Iblamu akwakulupusya che Lutu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 14:1" />Kele katema ko, che Amulafeli juŵaliji mwenye jwa ku Shinali ni che Alioki juŵaliji mwenye jwa ku Elasali ni che Kedolilaoma juŵaliji mwenye jwa ku Elamu ni che Tidali juŵaliji mwenye jwa ku Goiimu, <verse eid="GEN 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 14:2" />ŵajawile kuputana ngondo ni che Bela mwenye jwa ku Sodoma ni che Bilisha mwenye jwa ku Gomola. Che Shinabu mwenye jwa ku Adima ni che Shemebeli mwenye jwa ku Seboimu ni mwenye jwa ku Bela pane jikuŵilanjikwa Soali. <verse eid="GEN 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 14:3" />Mamwenye wose nsano ŵasimene ni kwalumbikanya ŵangondo wao pa lichemba lya Sidimu, kweleko sambano kukuŵilanjikwa Bahali ja njete. <verse eid="GEN 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 14:4" />Kwa yaka kumi ni mbili ŵaliji nkwatumichila mwenye che Kedolilaoma, nambo pa chaka cha kumi ni tatu ŵalesile kwatumichila. <verse eid="GEN 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 14:5" />Pa chaka cha kumi na nne mwenye che Kedolilaoma ni mamwenye achinjakwe ŵaŵalumbikene pamo ŵajawile kukwaputa Ŵalefaimu ako ku Ashitalosi Kanaliamu ni Ŵasusi ako ku Hamu ni Ŵaemi ako ku Shawe Kiliasaimu, <verse eid="GEN 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 14:6" />ni Ŵaholi ku chilambo cha ikwesya ya Seili, ŵaatopwele mpaka ku Elipalani, mumpika mwa lipululu. <verse eid="GEN 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 14:7" />Nipele ŵausile panyuma mpaka ku Enimishipati, sooni pakuŵilanjikwa ku Kadeshi, ni kwaputa Ŵaamaleki wose ni kwapunda, iyoyo peyo ŵaaputile Ŵaamoli ŵaakutama ku Hazazoni Tamali ni kwapunda.<verse eid="GEN 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 14:8" />Mwenye jwa ku Sodoma ni mwenye jwa ku Gomola ni mwenye jwa ku Adima ni mwenye jwa ku Seboimu ni mwenye jwa ku Bela, ŵatesile ngondo pa lichemba lya Sidimu, <verse eid="GEN 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 14:9" />aputane ni che Kedolilaoma mwenye jwa ku Elamu ni che Tidali mwenye jwa ku Goimu ni che Amlafeli mwenye jwa ku Shinali ni che Alioko mwenye jwa ku Elasali. Mamwenye ncheche ŵaputene ngondo ni mamwenye nsano. <verse eid="GEN 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 14:10" />Lichemba lya Sidimu lyagumbele masimbo ga lami, kwayele mamwenye ŵa ku Sodoma ni ku Gomola paŵautukaga ngondo ŵatumbuchile mwelemo, nambo ŵaŵasigele ŵautuchile ku itumbi. <verse eid="GEN 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 14:11" />Mamwenye ncheche ŵala ŵajigele chipanje chose cha ku Sodoma ni ku Gomola pampepe ni yakulya yao yose ni kwaula. <verse eid="GEN 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 14:12" />Iyoyopeyo ŵaajigele ni che Lutu mwana jwa mpwakwe che Iblamu juŵatamaga ku Sodoma pampepe ni chipanje chakwe chose chiŵakwete ni kwaula.<verse eid="GEN 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 14:13" />Nambo mundu jumpepe juŵakulupwiche ŵajawile kukwasalila che Iblamu juŵaliji Mwebulania jwatamaga chiŵandi ni itela yekulungwa ya che Mamle Mwamoli jula. Che Mamle jwaliji mpwakwe che Eshikoli ni che Aneli, wose ŵakamulene ni che Iblamu. <verse eid="GEN 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 14:14" />Che Iblamu paŵapilikene mwipwa jwao akamwilwe, ŵajawile ni ŵandu ŵao mia tatu ni kumi na nane ŵajiganyikwe kuputana ngondo ŵaŵapagwile mu nyuumba jao, ŵaakuiye mpaka ku Dani. <verse eid="GEN 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 14:15" />Chilo che Iblamu ŵasapwile ŵangondo ŵao mipingo mipingo, ŵaaputile ŵammagongo ŵao, ŵaapundile ni kwatopola mpaka ku Hoba, kumpoto kwa musi wa ku Damasika. <verse eid="GEN 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 14:16" />Yele ni iŵatite che Iblamu pakuiwombola ipanje yose ni iyoyopeyo ŵawombwele che Lutu mwipwagwe ni chipanje chao pamo ni achakongwe ni ŵandu ŵane.<verse eid="GEN 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Melekisedeki akwapa upile che Iblamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 14:17" />Che Iblamu paŵausile pakumala kwaputa che Kedolilaoma ni mamwenye achinjakwe, mwenye jwa ku Sodoma ŵatyosile ni kusimana nao pa lichemba lya Shawe, iyoyo likuŵilanjikwa Lichemba lya Mwenye. <verse eid="GEN 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 14:18" />Nipele che Melikisedeki mwenye jwa ku Salemu, iyoyo peyo ŵaliji jwambopesi jwa Akumanani ŵaapelechele che Iblamu mkate ni divai, <verse eid="GEN 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 14:19" />ŵampele upile achitiji, “Che Iblamu nkwete upile ni Akunnungu Ŵakulu, Jwakugumba kwinani ni chilambo! <verse eid="GEN 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 14:20" />Ajinichilwe Akunnungu Ŵakulu, ŵankamwisye kwapunda ŵamagongo ŵenu!” Nombe che Iblamu ŵapele che Melekisedeki liunjili lya kakumi lya indu iyaisumwiile kungondo.<verse eid="GEN 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 14:21" />Mwenye jwa ku Sodoma ŵasaalile che Iblamu, “Njigale ipanje yose nambo mumbe ŵandu wo.” <verse eid="GEN 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 14:22" />Nambo che Iblamu ŵanjanjile mwenye jwa ku Sodoma, “Ngulumbila kwa Ambuje, Akunnungu Ŵakulu, juŵagumbile kwinani ni chilambo, <verse eid="GEN 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 14:23" />kuti ngunyigala chindu chilichose chenu mmwe, iŵeje usi atamuno ngonji sya ilatu, nkajila kuti mundendekasisye me jwakusichila. <verse eid="GEN 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 14:24" />Ngunyigala chilichose ikaŵe aila pe yalile achachanda ŵangu ni ŵane mwa ŵeŵala uŵaliji pamo none, yaani che Aneli ni che Eshikoli ni che Mamle, ŵanyaŵa akwete liunjili mu indu yo.”<verse eid="GEN 14:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="GEN 15" />
  <para style="s">Akunnungu akutenda lilangano ni che Iblamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 15:1" />Pagamasile gelego, liloŵe lya Ambuje lyaichile che Iblamu mu yakwiwona, “Che Iblamu! Nkajogopa! Une chinjingosa. Chinjimpa mbote jekulungwa!” <verse eid="GEN 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 15:2" />Nambo che Iblamu ŵajanjile, “Alakwe Ambuje Akunnungu, chimumbe ichichi akuno ngutama pangali mwanache, ni aju juchalisi indu yangu ali che Eliasali mundu jwa ku Damesika?” <verse eid="GEN 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 15:3" />Nipele che Iblamu ŵatite, “Nnole! Nganimumba mwanache ni kapolo jwapagwile mu nyuumba jangu ni juchalisi indu yangu.”<verse eid="GEN 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 15:4" />Nipele Ambuje ŵaasalile sooni, “Ajuju ngaaŵa juchalisi indu yenu, nambo mwanache juchimummeleche mwasyene, jwelejo ni juchalisi indu yenu.” <verse eid="GEN 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 15:5" />Pelepo Ambuje ŵankopwesye paasa che Iblamu ni kunsalila, “Nnole mwinani! Mmalanje ndondwa, iwaga chinkombole kuŵalanga! Iyoyo peyo uŵelesi wenu ni uchiiŵe wejinji!” <verse eid="GEN 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 15:6" />Che Iblamu ŵaakulupilile Ambuje, nombe Ambuje ŵaŵalanjile kuti ali mundu jwakupanganya yambone paujo pao.<verse eid="GEN 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 15:7" />Nipele Ambuje ŵaasalile che Iblamu, “Une ndili Ambuje junantyosisye ku Ulu, ku chilambo cha Ŵakalidayo, kuti nampe chilambo chi chiŵe chenu.” <verse eid="GEN 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 15:8" />Nambo che Iblamu ŵausisye, “Alakwe Ambuje Akunnungu, chinaimanye chinauli kuti chilambo chi chichiŵe changu?” <verse eid="GEN 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 15:9" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaasalile, “Munyigalile nkolo wa ng'ombe ni nkolo wa mbusi ni likambaku lya ngondolo, wose ŵa, julijose jwa yaka itatu pamo ni njuŵa ni likandi lya ngunda.” <verse eid="GEN 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 15:10" />Che Iblamu ŵaajigalile Ambuje Akunnungu wose wo, chinyama chilichose ŵachikatenye ipande iŵili ni kwipanga misitali jiŵili ininkulolegana nambo ijuni nganaikatanya ipande iŵili. <verse eid="GEN 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 15:11" />Ni matumbusi payaikaga pa mitembo jila, che Iblamu ŵaliji nkuiŵinga.<verse eid="GEN 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 15:12" />Palyatiŵilaga lyuŵa, che Iblamu ŵakamwilwe ni lugono lwakutopela, lipamba ni chipi totolo yaunichile. <verse eid="GEN 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 15:13" />Pele Ambuje ŵaasalile che Iblamu, “Mmanyilile kusyene kuti uŵelesi wenu chiutame nti achalendo mu chilambo changaŵa chao, chaŵe achikapolo ni chalaje kwa yaka mia nne. <verse eid="GEN 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 15:14" />Nambo, chinjajamuka ŵandu ŵachachatenda achikapolo ni kumbesi ŵandu ŵangu chatyoche mu chilambo cho ali ni chipanje chachijinji. <verse eid="GEN 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 15:15" />Nambo mmwe mwasyene chintame yaka yejinji, chinchiwa kwa chitendewele ni kunsika yambone. <verse eid="GEN 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 15:16" />Pa uŵelesi wenu wa ncheche, uŵelesi wenu chiuuje apano ligongo ugongomalo wa Ŵaamoli ngaunaŵe kumalila kuti alamulikwe.”<verse eid="GEN 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 15:17" />Palyamasile kutiŵila lyuŵa ni kwinjila chipi, chiteleko chachikututuma lyosi ni lumuli yapite pasikati ja aila ipande ya nyama. <verse eid="GEN 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 15:18" />Lyele lyuŵa Ambuje ŵatesile lilangano ni che Iblamu achitiji, “Uŵelesi wenu chinaape achi chilambo chi, kutandila lusulo lwa Misili mpaka lusulo lwekulungwa lwa Efulati, <verse eid="GEN 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 15:19" />pamo ni chilambo cha Ŵakeni ni Ŵakenisi ni Ŵakadimoni, <verse eid="GEN 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 15:20" />ni Ŵahiti ni Ŵapelisi ni Ŵalefai, <verse eid="GEN 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 15:21" />ni Ŵaamoli ni Ŵakanaani ni Ŵagiligashi ni Ŵayebusi.”<verse eid="GEN 15:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="GEN 16" />
  <para style="s">Che Hajili ni che Ishumaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 16:1" />Nipele, che Salai ŵankwawo che Iblamu ŵaliji akanaŵe kwaŵelechela ŵankwawo mwanache. Nambo ŵakwete kapolo jwankongwe liina lyakwe che Hajili kutyochela ku Misili. <verse eid="GEN 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 16:2" />Nipele, che Salai ŵaasalile che Iblamu, “Nkuimanyilila kuti Ambuje andesile jwangaŵeleka. Sambano ngone ni che Hajili kapolo jwangu panepa chakombole kuumelechela ŵanache.” Che Iblamu ŵagajitichisye maloŵe ga che Salai ŵankwawo. <verse eid="GEN 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 16:3" />Kwayele che Salai ŵaajigele kapolo jwao jwankongwe mundu jwa ku Misili, jwakuŵilanjikwa che Hajili, ŵaapele che Iblamu aŵe chilanga chao. Gele gatyochele che Iblamu ali atemi ku Kanaani kwa yaka kumi. <verse eid="GEN 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 16:4" />Che Iblamu ŵagonile ni che Hajili, nombejo ŵakwete chitumbo. Nambo che Hajili paŵaiweni pe kuti akwete chitumbo, ŵatandite kwanyelusya che Salai. <verse eid="GEN 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 16:5" />Nipele che Salai ŵaasalile che Iblamu, “Ungalumbana wakundendela une wu nomwe muumanyi. Nampele kapolo jwangu, pakuŵa sambano akumanyilila kuti akwete chitumbo, akutanda kunyelusya! Ambuje atulamule mmwe ni une!” <verse eid="GEN 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 16:6" />Nambo che Iblamu ŵaasalile che Salai, “Kapolo jwenu ali pa ulamusi wenu, mwatende chachilichose chinkuchisaka.” Nipele che Salai ŵanlagesye che Hajili mpaka ŵatolweche.<verse eid="GEN 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 16:7" />Katumetume jwa kwinani jwa Ambuje ŵaasimene che Hajili pa uliŵa mwipululu, uliŵa wauli pa litala lyalikwaula ku Shuli. <verse eid="GEN 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 16:8" />Katumetume jwa kwinani jwa Ambuje ŵammusisye, “Che Hajili, kapolo ju che Salai! Nkutyochela kwapi ni nkwaula kwapi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 16:8">Che Hajili ŵajanjile, “Ngwautuka che Salai jungwatumichila.”<verse eid="GEN 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 16:9" />Nipele katumetume jwa kwinani jwa Ambuje ŵaasalile, “Mmuje ku che Salai ni kwajitichisya.” <verse eid="GEN 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 16:10" />Nipele, katumetume jwa kwinani jwa Ambuje ŵajendelechele kusala, “Chinauchulusye uŵelesi wenu mpaka ŵandu chalepele kuuŵalanga.” <verse eid="GEN 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 16:11" />Nipele Katumetume jwa kwinani jwa Ambuje ŵansalile, “Mmwe sambano nkwete chitumbo, nomwe chimmeleche mwanache jwannume, chimummilanje Ishumaeli, ligongo Ambuje akuweni kulaga kwenu. <verse eid="GEN 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 16:12" />Nambo mwanagwenu chaŵe mpela mbunda ja mwikonde jangatawalika, jangasaka kwilana ni mundu jwalijose. Chaputane ni kila mundu ni kila mundu chaputane ni jwelejo. Chatame mpela jwammagongo jwa achalongo achinjakwe nombejo chakombole.”<verse eid="GEN 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 16:13" />Che Hajili ŵammilasile Ambuje juŵaŵechete nao, “Mmwe nli Akunnungu ŵakulola,” pakuŵa ŵatite, “Kusyene apano naweni aŵala ŵakumona une.” <verse eid="GEN 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 16:14" />Kwa yele chisima chila ŵandu ŵachiŵilasile, Beli Lahi Loi, malumbo gakwe, “Chisima cha jwanjumi jwakumona uneji.” Chele chisima cho chipali mpaka sano, chili pasikati ja ku Kadeshi ni ku Beledi.<verse eid="GEN 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 16:15" />Che Hajili ŵaŵelechele che Iblamu mwanache jwannume, ni che Iblamu ŵampele mwanache jo liina li che Ishumaeli. <verse eid="GEN 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 16:16" />Che Iblamu ŵaliji ni yaka semanini ni sita katema che Hajili paŵammeleche che Ishumaeli.<verse eid="GEN 16:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="GEN 17" />
  <para style="s">Kuumbala kuli chilosyo cha lilangano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 17:1" />Che Ablamu paŵaliji ni yaka tisini ni tisa, Ambuje ŵaakopochele ni kwasalila, “Une ndili Akunnungu Jwamachili. Mumbikanile ni kutenda yaili yambone moŵa gose. <verse eid="GEN 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 17:2" />None chimiche lilangano nomwe ni chinampe uŵelesi wangaŵalanjikwa.” <verse eid="GEN 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 17:3" />Che Iblamu ŵakoteme mpaka paasi. Nombe Akunnungu ŵaasalile, <verse eid="GEN 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 17:4" />“Nguŵika lilangano li ni mmwe: Chimme atati ŵa ilambo yejinji. <verse eid="GEN 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 17:5" />Kutandilila sambano, ngammilanjikwa sooni che Iblamu nambo chimmilanjikwe che Ibulahimu, pakuŵa nantesile kuŵa atati ŵa ilambo yejinji. <verse eid="GEN 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 17:6" />Chinampe uŵelesi wejinji nnope, kutyochela kwa mmwe chaakopochele ŵandu ŵa ilambo yejinji ni ŵane mwa ŵelewo chaŵe mamwenye.<verse eid="GEN 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 17:7" />“Ngulilimbisya Lilangano lyangu pasikati jangu une ni mmwe, ni uŵelesi wenu ni iŵelesi yao yose moŵa gose pangali mbesi. Chime Akunnungu jwenu ni chime Akunnungu jwa uŵelesi wenu. <verse eid="GEN 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 17:8" />None chinampe mmwe ni uŵelesi wenu achi chilambo chinkutama mpela achalendo. Chilambo chose cha Kanaani chichiŵe cha uŵelesi wenu moŵa gose pangali mbesi ni une chime Akunnungu jwao.”<verse eid="GEN 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 17:9" />Nipele Akunnungu ŵaasalile che Ibulahimu, “Ni mmwe iyoyo, nlikamule lilangano lyangu, mmwe mwasyene ni uŵelesi wenu ni iŵelesi yao yaikwika yose. <verse eid="GEN 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 17:10" />Ali lili lilangano lyangu pasikati jangu une ni mmwe pamo ni iŵelesi yenu lichinjendelechele kulikamulisya, jwannume jwalijose pasikati jenu aumbale. <verse eid="GEN 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 17:11" />Chimbumbale, chele ni chichiŵe chimanyisyo cha lilangano pasikati jangu ni ŵanyamwe. <verse eid="GEN 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 17:12" />Kila mwanache jwannume jwa moŵa nane pakumala kupagwa mwa ŵanyamwe aumbale. Kila jwannume jwa mu uŵelesi wenu, pamo ni kapolo jwapagwile mu nyuumba jenu pane kapolo jwasumikwe kutyochela kwa achalendo aumbale. <verse eid="GEN 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 17:13" />Elo kila mwanache jwannume jwapagwile mu nyuumba jenu atamuno jwasumikwe kwa mbiya syenu aumbale. Chelechi chichiŵe chimanyisyo mu ilu yenu cha lilangano lyangu lya moŵa gose pangali mbesi. <verse eid="GEN 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 17:14" />Jwannume jwalijose jwangaumbala chatyosyekwe pasikati ja ŵandu, pakuŵa nganakamulisya lilangano lyangu.”<verse eid="GEN 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 17:15" />Nipele Akunnungu ŵaasalile che Ibulahimu, “Yankati ŵankwenu, ngamwaŵilanga soni che Salai, nambo liina lyao chiliŵe che Sala. <verse eid="GEN 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 17:16" />Chinaape upile, nombe chachimmelechela mwanache jwannume. Kusyene chinaape upile che Sala, nombejo chaŵe achikulu jwa ilambo yejinji ni mamwenye chatyochele mu uŵelesi wao.”<verse eid="GEN 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 17:17" />Pelepo che Ibulahimu ŵakoteme mpaka paasi ni kuseka chikatikati achilisalilaga, “Ana chikomboleche chinauli kwa mundu jwa yaka lichila kola mwanache? Ni uli che Sala jwa yaka tisini ikomboleka kola mwanache?” <verse eid="GEN 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 17:18" />Nipele che Ibulahimu ŵaasalile Akunnungu, “Ikaliji mmbaya che Ishumaeli akaatemi mu upile wenu!”<verse eid="GEN 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 17:19" />Nambo Akunnungu ŵajanjile, “Ngwamba, ŵankwenu che Sala chammelechele mwanache jwannume, nomwe chimummilanje liina lyakwe che Isaka. None chimiche lilangano lyangu ni jwelejo liŵeje lya moŵa gose pangali mbesi kwa uŵelesi wao waukwika. <verse eid="GEN 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 17:20" />Mbilikene intite kuŵenda nkati che Ishumaeli. Kusyene chinaape upile ni chinaape ŵanache ŵajinji ni uŵelesi wejinji. Che Ishumaeli chaŵe atati jwa ŵakutawala kumi ni mbili, ni chinaatende aŵe atati ŵa chilambo chachikulungwa. <verse eid="GEN 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 17:21" />Nambo lilangano lyangu nguliŵika ni mwanagwenu che Isaka juchammelechele che Sala, katema mpela akano pa chaka chachikwika.” <verse eid="GEN 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 17:22" />Akunnungu paŵamasile kuŵecheta ni che Ibulahimu, ŵannesile ni kwaula kwinani.<verse eid="GEN 17:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 17:23" />Pa lyuwa lilyolyo che Ibulahimu ŵammumbesye che Ishumaeli mwanagwe, iyoyo ŵaaumbesye achikapolo ŵao wose ŵaŵapagwile mu nyuumba jao ni achikapolo ŵaŵaasumile kwa mbiya syao, mpela Akunnungu iŵatite pakwalajisya. <verse eid="GEN 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 17:24" />Che Ibulahimu ŵaumbele ali ni yaka tisini ni tisa. <verse eid="GEN 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 17:25" />Ni che Ishumaeli mwanagwe ŵaumbele ali ni yaka kumi ni tatu. <verse eid="GEN 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 17:26" />Che Ibulahimu ŵaumbele pa lyuŵa limo ni che Ishumaeli mwanagwe, <verse eid="GEN 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 17:27" />pamo ni achalume wose ŵa munyuumba jao ni achikapolo wose ŵaŵapagwile mu nyuumba jao ni achikapolo wose ŵaŵaasumile kwa mbiya syao.<verse eid="GEN 17:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="GEN 18" />
  <para style="s">Akunnungu akulisalichisya lilangano lyakwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 18:1" />Ambuje ŵankopochele che Ibulahimu chiŵandika ni itela yekulungwa ya Mamle. Che Ibulahimu ŵatemi pannango wa lisakasa lyakwe muusi katema ka ntukuta. <verse eid="GEN 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 18:2" />Che Ibulahimu ŵajinamukwile meeso gao, ŵaweni ŵandu ŵatatu ali ajimi paujo pao. Nkwawona pe ŵaautuchile kukwachingamila. Paŵaaichile ŵakoteme mpaka paasi. <verse eid="GEN 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 18:3" />Ŵatite “Ambuje ŵangu, iŵaga muungundile, choonde nkaambeleta une jwakutumichila jwenu, ngunkalibisya kumangwangu kwa ndema, mme jwannendo jwangu. <verse eid="GEN 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 18:4" />Nlinde annyichisye meesi kanandi nlikunde mmakongolo genu ni kupumulila paasi chitela. <verse eid="GEN 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 18:5" />Katema pachimpumulile, nankolochesye chakulya kanandi, ndye kuti nkole machili ga kwendelechela ni ulendo wenu, ligongo munyichilile jwakutumichila jwenu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:5">Nombewo ŵatite, “Yambone! Ntende mpela intite pakusala.” <verse eid="GEN 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 18:6" />Che Ibulahimu ŵausile nkati ni kwasalila che Sala, “Nsapule kwa chitema mbisi nsano sya utandi wambone, mmunye ni kolosya mikate.” <verse eid="GEN 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 18:7" />Nipele ŵautuchile kwaula mpingo wa ng'ombe, ŵasagwile ng'ombe jajinandi jambone jajijimbele, ŵampele jwakutumichila, nombejo ŵajisikite ni ŵajangwiye kuteleka. <verse eid="GEN 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 18:8" />Ni che Ibulahimu ŵajigele siagi ni maŵele ni nyama jeteleche ni kwakulumichisya chakulya achalendo, paŵaliji nkulyanga kuusi chitela che Ibulahimu ŵajimi mwakuŵandikana nawo.<verse eid="GEN 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 18:9" />Nipele achalendo ŵala ŵausisye, “Ŵankwenu che Sala ali kwapi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:9">Che Ibulahimu ŵajanjile, “Ali mu lisakasa.”<verse eid="GEN 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 18:10" />Jumo jwao ŵatite, “Kusyene chinammujilile pa moŵa mpela aga pa chaka chachikwika, ni ŵankwenu che Sala chaligopole mwanache jwannume.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:10">Che Sala ŵaliji kusyeto nnango wa lisakasa aninkupikanila. <verse eid="GEN 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 18:11" />Che Ibulahimu ni che Sala ŵalinji achekulwipe nnope, ni katema ka che Sala kuŵeleka kaliji kapite. <verse eid="GEN 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 18:12" />Kwayele, che Sala ŵasechile muntima achitiji, “Une njekulwipe nnope ni ŵankwangu nombe achekulwipe nnope. Uli chingombole kugona ni ŵankwangu ni kuŵeleka ŵanache?” <verse eid="GEN 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 18:13" />Pelepo Ambuje ŵausisye che Ibulahimu, “Ligongo chi che Sala akuseka ni kuliusya kuti ‘Kusyene chimeleche ndi njekulwipe?’ <verse eid="GEN 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 18:14" />Uli kwana chachili chose chingachikukomboleka kwa Ambuje? Chinambujile katema kakaŵichikwe, katema mpela kakaka pa chaka chachikwika, ni che Sala chammelechele mwanache jwannume.” <verse eid="GEN 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 18:15" />Nambo ligongo che Sala ŵaliji ni lipamba ŵakanile achitiji, “Nguniseka!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:15">Nambo Ambuje ŵansalile, “Isyene mwaliji nkuseka!”<verse eid="GEN 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Ibulahimu akwapopelela ŵandu ŵa ku Sodoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 18:16" />Nipele, ŵandu ŵala ŵatyosile, ŵaiche peuto paŵakombwele kuuwona musi wa ku Sodoma, che Ibulahimu ali pamo nawo kwapechesya. <verse eid="GEN 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 18:17" />Nipele, Ambuje ŵatite, “Kwachichi naasise che Ibulahimu chindu chingusaka kupanganya? <verse eid="GEN 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 18:18" />Che Ibulahimu chaŵe atati ŵa ŵandu ŵa chilambo chachikulungwa chachili ni machili ni kwa litala lya ŵelewo ŵandu wose ŵa ilambo chapegwe upile! <verse eid="GEN 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 18:19" />Naasagwile ŵelewo ni achiŵanagwe. Ŵelewo chiŵaajinganye uŵelesi wao kumbilikanichisya kwa kutendekanya aila ingusaka une. Atendaga yeleyo, chinaapanganyichisye yose inaalanjile che Ibulahimu.”<verse eid="GEN 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 18:20" />Nipele Ambuje ŵansalile che Ibulahimu, “Kwana madandaulisi gamakulungwa nnope nkati ŵandu ŵa ku Sodoma ni ku Gomola ni sambi syao sijonjesyeche kwannope. <verse eid="GEN 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 18:21" />Sambano ngutuluchila kweleko ngalole iŵaga achila chapangenye chikulandana ni madandaulisi gimbilikene. Naga ngaŵa yele chiimanyilile.”<verse eid="GEN 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 18:22" />Nipele, ŵandu ŵaŵili mwa ŵele ŵandu wo ŵatandite ulendo wa ku Sodoma, nambo che Ibulahimu ŵasigele ali ajimi paujo pa Ambuje. <verse eid="GEN 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 18:23" />Nipele che Ibulahimu ŵaaŵandichile Ambuje ni kwausya, “Uli, chimwaulaje ŵandu ŵangaleŵa pamo ni ŵandu ŵaleŵile? <verse eid="GEN 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 18:24" />Iŵaga mmusi mo mwana ŵandu ŵangaleŵa hansini. Uli chimuujonanje wele musi wose pane kuuleka kwaligongo lya ŵandu ŵangaleŵa hansini ŵaali mwelemo? <verse eid="GEN 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 18:25" />Nganguganisya kuti chintende yele, kwaulaga ŵandu ŵangaleŵa pamo ni ŵandu ŵaleŵile, ni kwatenda ŵandu ŵangaleŵa mpela ŵandu ŵaleŵile. Ngaikomboleka! Jwakuchilamula chilambo chose akusachilwa alamule yaluumo!”<verse eid="GEN 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 18:26" />Ambuje ŵajanjile, “Naasimanaga ŵandu ŵangaleŵa hansini mu Sodoma, kwaligongo lya ŵele ŵandu wo chinauleche musi wose.”<verse eid="GEN 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 18:27" />Che Ibulahimu ŵaŵechete sooni, “Sambano nganinyogopa kukunguluka ni alakwe Ambuje, une jundi luundu ni liu pe. <verse eid="GEN 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 18:28" />Iŵaga kwana ŵandu ŵangaleŵa alobaini na tano. Uli chimuujonanje musi wose ligongo apungwiche ŵandu nsano wo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:28">Ambuje ŵajanjile, “Ngasinaujonanga musi wo iŵaga kwana ŵandu ŵangaleŵa alobaini ni tano.”<verse eid="GEN 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 18:29" />Che Ibulahimu ŵaŵechete sooni, “Uli iŵaga kwana ŵandu alobaini?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:29">Ambuje ŵajanjile, “Kwaligongo lya ŵele ŵandu ŵangaleŵa alobaini ngasinaujonanga.”<verse eid="GEN 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 18:30" />Nipele che Ibulahimu ŵatite, “Alakwe Ambuje choonde ngasimundumbilila, ngusaka mechete sooni. Uli iŵaga kwana ŵandu selasini?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:30">Ambuje ŵajanjile, “Ngasinaujonanga musi wo iŵaga chinaasimane ŵandu selasini.”<verse eid="GEN 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 18:31" />Che Ibulahimu ŵatite, “Choonde muunechelesye pakuŵa nganinyogopa kukunguluka ni alakwe Ambuje. Uli iŵaga kwana ŵandu ishilini?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:31">Ambuje ŵajanjile, “Ngasinaujonanga musi wo kwaligongo lya ŵele ŵandu ishilini.”<verse eid="GEN 18:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 18:32" />Che Ibulahimu ŵatite, “Ambuje choonde ngasimuundumbilila, muuneche mechete sooni kamope. Uli, iŵaga kwana ŵandu kumi ŵangaleŵa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:32">Ambuje ŵajanjile, “Ngasinaujonanga musi wo kwaligongo lya ŵele ŵandu kumi.” <verse eid="GEN 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 18:33" />Ambuje paŵamasile kukunguluka ni che Ibulahimu, ŵajawile, nombe che Ibulahimu ŵausile kumangwao.<verse eid="GEN 18:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="GEN 19" />
  <para style="s">Sambi sya ŵandu ŵa ku Sodoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 19:1" />Nipele aŵala achikatumetume ŵaŵili ŵaiche ku Sodoma ligulo. Che Lutu ŵaliji atemi pa nnango wekulungwa wa musi wa Sodoma, paŵaweni, ŵajimi ni kwaula kukwapochela, ŵajineme mpaka paasi, <verse eid="GEN 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 19:2" />achitiji, “Achachimwene ŵangu, choonde twende nkaichile mu nyuumba jangu une jwakutumichila jwenu. Nkukombola kugakunda makongolo ni gona mu nyuumba mwangu chilo cha lelo. Kundaŵipe chinjendelechele ni ulendo wenu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 19:2">Nambo ŵanyawo ŵajanjile, “Ngwamba, tutugone paluŵala.”<verse eid="GEN 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 19:3" />Che Lutu ŵachondelele nnope, mbesi jakwe achikatumetume ŵala ŵajitichisye ni kwinjila mu nyuumba jakwe. Ni che Lutu ŵaakulumichisye chakulya, ŵaakolochesye mikate jangatagwa amila ni ŵanyawo ŵalile.<verse eid="GEN 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 19:4" />Nambo chilo akanaŵe gonanga, achalume wose ŵa musi wa ku Sodoma, achachanda ni achachekulu wose ŵajisyungwile nyuumba ji che Lutu. <verse eid="GEN 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 19:5" />Ŵaŵilasile che Lutu ni kwausya, “Alinji kwapi achalume ŵaiche kumangwenu chilo chino? Mwatyosye paasa. Tukusaka kugona nawo.”<verse eid="GEN 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 19:6" />Che Lutu ŵatyosile paasa ni kuugala nnango chapanyuma, <verse eid="GEN 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 19:7" />ni ŵatite, “Achambusanga ŵangu, ngasintenda chigongomalo chanti yeleyo. <verse eid="GEN 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 19:8" />Nnole, ngwete achiŵali ŵaŵili ŵanganagone ni achalume. Nneche nampanje ŵelewo kuti ntende yaili yose inkwisaka kukwao. Nambo nkatenda chilichose kwa ŵele achalume pakuŵa aŵele achalendo ŵangu.”<verse eid="GEN 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 19:9" />Nambo ŵanyawo ŵatite, “Ntupisye! Mwe mwaiche apano nli jwannendo, sano nkusaka kulitenda jwakutulamula! Sambano tutuntendele yangalimate mwasyene kupunda achalendo ŵenu.” Pelepo ŵantutile che Lutu achisakaga atemangulanye nnango wao. <verse eid="GEN 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 19:10" />Nambo achalendo ŵala ŵagolwesye makono gao paasa ni kwautila che Lutu mu nyuumba ni kuugala nnango. <verse eid="GEN 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 19:11" />Nipele ŵaputile chiputa mmeeso ŵandu wose ŵaŵaliji paasa, achanandi kwa achakulungwa, kwayele nganakombolanga kuuwona nnango.<verse eid="GEN 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Lutu akutyoka ku Sodoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 19:12" />Wandu ŵaŵili ŵala ŵaausisye che Lutu, “Uli, nkwete mundu jwine apano, pane achiŵana ŵenu pane achakwegwenu pane achalongo achinjenu ŵakutama mu musi wu? Mwatyosye apano, <verse eid="GEN 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 19:13" />ligongo tukusaka kuujonanga musi wu. Pakuwa Ambuje agapikene madandaulisi gamakulungwa nkati ŵandu ŵa awu musi, nombewo atulajisye tuujonanje.”<verse eid="GEN 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 19:14" />Nipele, che Lutu ŵajaulile achachanda ŵaŵatomele achiŵali wao, ŵaasalile, “Njanguye! Ntyochanje apano, pakuŵa Ambuje akusaka kuujonanga awu musi wu.” Nambo achakwegwao ŵala ŵaiweni nti akutenda yauŵilo.<verse eid="GEN 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 19:15" />Pakwachele, achikatumetume ŵachisisye che Lutu alinkuti, “Njanguye! Mwajigale ŵankwenu ni achiŵali ŵenu ŵaŵili ntyochanje paasa kuti ngasinjonasika katema Ambuje pachaujonanje musi wu.” <verse eid="GEN 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 19:16" />Che Lutu ŵaliji nkulunyalunya. Nambo pakuŵa Ambuje ŵaakolele chanasa che Lutu, achikatumetume ŵala ŵaakamwile makono jwelejo ni ŵankwawo ni achiŵali ŵao ŵaŵili ni kwatyosya paasa musi. <verse eid="GEN 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 19:17" />Paŵatyosisye paasa musi, katumetume jumo ŵaasalile ŵanyawo kuti, “Mbutuche kuti muukulupusye umi wenu. Ngasinlola panyuma namose kwima palipose pa lichemba. Mbutuchile kumatumbi nkaika kuwa.”<verse eid="GEN 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 19:18" />Nambo che Lutu ŵaasalile, “Ngaŵa yeleyo, achachimwene wangu! <verse eid="GEN 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 19:19" />Isyene une jwakutumichila jwenu mbatile kukundikwa paujo penu, ni ŵanyamwe mungolele chanasa kwa kuukulupusya umi wangu. Nambo ngangukombola kuutuchila mpaka kumatumbi uwonasi wu chiuusimane ngunaŵe kwika kweleko, none chimwe. <verse eid="GEN 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 19:20" />Nnole, akula kwana musi wenondi, uli mutuchile kweleko pakuŵa uli wenondi ni kuŵandichile? Mungunde mutuchile kweleko, kwele chiname.”<verse eid="GEN 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 19:21" />Nombejo ŵanjanjile, “Elo, ngundile chimmendile. Nganguujonanga musi umusasile wo. <verse eid="GEN 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 19:22" />Njanguye! Mbutuchile kweleko, none ngundenda chilichose mpaka pachinyiche kweleko.” Nipele wele musi waŵilanjikwe Soali.<verse eid="GEN 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Misi ja ku Sodoma ni ku Gomola jikonasikwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 19:23" />Lyuŵa lyaliji likopweche katema che Lutu paŵajinjile mmusi wa ku Soali. <verse eid="GEN 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 19:24" />Nipele kutyochela kwinani Ambuje ŵanyesisye ula ja wonga pa misi ja ku Sodoma ni Gomola, <verse eid="GEN 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 19:25" />ŵajonasile misi jo, ni lichemba lyose ni ŵandu wose ŵa musi wo, iyoyopeyo ŵajonasile ni mimela jose jijaliji mu ilambo yo. <verse eid="GEN 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 19:26" />Nambo ŵankwawo che Lutu ŵalolite panyuma, papopo ŵagalawiche ni kuŵa chimila cha njete.<verse eid="GEN 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 19:27" />Kundaŵi jakwe kuli mbulutu, che Ibulahimu ŵajimwiche ni kwaula peuto paŵaliji ajimi paujo pa Ambuje. <verse eid="GEN 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 19:28" />Nipele paŵaliji pele, ŵalolite ku misi ja ku Sodoma ni ku Gomola ni liuto lyose lya lichemba, ŵaliweni lyosi lili nkukwela kwaula kwinani mpela lyosi lya litanuli lyekulungwa. <verse eid="GEN 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 19:29" />Nipele Ambuje paŵajijonasile misi ja lichemba liŵatamaga che Lutu, ŵankumbuchile che Ibulahimu, ni ŵantyosisye che Lutu mu uwonasi wo kuti akajonasikwa.<verse eid="GEN 19:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chipago cha Ŵamoabu ni Ŵaamoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 19:30" />Pakuŵa che Lutu ŵajogwepe kutama ku Soali, ŵakwesile ku litumbi pamo ni achiŵali ŵao ŵala, ni kutama mu mbugu. <verse eid="GEN 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 19:31" />Lyuŵa limo mwali jwankulungwa jula ŵansalile mpwakwe, “Atati ŵetu achekulwipe, ni chilambo chatukutama chi ngapagwa jwannume juchatujigale ni kutuŵelekasya ŵanache mpela yaitite kusyoŵelecheka pachilambo pose. <verse eid="GEN 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 19:32" />Nipele, twang'wesye divai kuti akolelwe ni tugone nawo, tuŵeleche nawo ŵanache.” <verse eid="GEN 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 19:33" />Chele chilo cho ŵang'wesisye atati ŵao divai nombejo ŵakolelwe kwannope, mwali jwankulungwa jula ŵajinjile ni kugona ni atatigwe. Nambo atatigwe wo nganaimanyililaga katema mwali paŵagonile nawo namose paŵajimwiche.<verse eid="GEN 19:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 19:34" />Malaŵi jakwe mwali jwankulungwa jula ŵansalile mpwakwe jula, “Chilo nagonile ni atati, lelo twangwesye sooni divai kuti akolelwe, ni chilo nkagone nawo. Nipele uweji wose chituŵeleche ŵanache ni atati ŵetu kuti uŵelesi wakwe ukamala.” <verse eid="GEN 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 19:35" />Iyoyo, chele chilo cho ŵang'wesisye atati ŵao divai kuti akolelwe. Nipele mwali jwannandi jula ŵajinjile gona nawo. Nambo atati ŵao nganaimanyililaga katema mwali paŵagonile nawo atamuno pawajimwiche. <verse eid="GEN 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 19:36" />Kwayele, achiŵali wose ŵaŵili ŵakwete itumbo ya atati ŵao. <verse eid="GEN 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 19:37" />Mwali jwankulungwa jula ŵaligopwele mwanache jwannume, ŵampele liina lyakwe Moabu. Jwelejo ni chipago cha Ŵamoabu mpaka lelo jino. <verse eid="GEN 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 19:38" />Mwali jwannandi jula nombejo ŵaligopwele mwanache jwannume, ŵampele liina lyakwe Beni Ami. Jwele ni chipago cha Ŵaamoni mpaka lelo jino.<verse eid="GEN 19:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="GEN 20" />
  <para style="s">Che Ibulahimu ni che Abimeleki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 20:1" />Che Ibulahimu ŵatyosile ku Mamle ni kwaula ku lujenda ni kutama pasikati ja Kadeshi ni Shuli. Nipele ŵatemi kwa moŵa kanandi ku Gelali. <verse eid="GEN 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 20:2" />Paŵaliji kwele, che Ibulahimu ŵaasalile wandu kuti che Sala ali alumbu ŵao. Nipele, mwenye che Abimeleki jwa ku Gelali ŵanjigele che Sala. <verse eid="GEN 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 20:3" />Nambo chilo Akunnungu ŵankopochele che Abimeleki mu sagamisi ni kwasalila, “Mmwejo chimmwe pakuŵa jwankongwe jumunjigele ali jwankongwe jwa mundu.”<verse eid="GEN 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 20:4" />Nambo che Abimeleki ŵaliji nganagone ni che Sala, kwayele ŵatite, “Ambuje, chimwaulaje ŵandu ŵanganaaleŵa? <verse eid="GEN 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 20:5" />Che Ibulahimu asyene ŵaasalile kuti che Sala ali alumbugwe, ni che Sala iyoyo ŵatite kuti che Ibulahimu ali achimwene jwao! Une natesile yelei kwa mtima wambone, uneji nganineŵa.” <verse eid="GEN 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 20:6" />Nipele Akunnungu ŵansalile che Abimeleki mu sagamisi, “Elo, nguimanyilila kuti ntesile yelei kwa ntima wambone, noneji ni junankanyisye ngasimundendela sambi. Lyelelyo ni ligongo nannekasisye nkagona nawo. <verse eid="GEN 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 20:7" />Ni sambano mumpeleche jwankongwe jo kwa ŵankwakwe. Che Ibulahimu ali jwakulondola, nombejo champopelele ni mmwejo ngammwa. Nambo naga ngamwausya, ngunjamuka kusyene mmwe ni ŵandu ŵenu wose chimmwe.”<verse eid="GEN 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 20:8" />Nipele, che Abimeleki ŵajimwiche kundaŵipe, ni ŵaŵilasile ŵakutumichila ŵao wose ni kwasalila yose yaiweni mu sagamisi. Ni ŵakutumichila ŵala ŵajogwepe kwannope. <verse eid="GEN 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 20:9" />Pele che Abimeleki ŵammilasile che Ibulahimu ni kwausya, “Ana ntutesile ichichi? Ana nantesile chichi mpaka muneŵasye kwanti yele une ni umwenye wangu? Chimuundesile ngaŵa chambone.” <verse eid="GEN 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 20:10" />Nipele che Abimeleki ŵammusisye che Ibulahimu, “Ana kwachichi mundendekenye yeleyo?”<verse eid="GEN 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 20:11" />Che Ibulahimu ŵajanjile, “Natesile yele ligongo naiweni kuti pelepa ngapagwa mundu jwakwajogopa Akunnungu, kwayele akaamuleje kuti ŵajigale ŵankwangu. <verse eid="GEN 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 20:12" />Isyene, che Sala ali alumbwangu, ŵele ni une atati jwetu jumo nambo achikulu ŵetu ŵakulekangana, nipele naajigele aŵe ŵankwangu. <verse eid="GEN 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 20:13" />Akunnungu paŵandyosisye kumusi kwa atati ŵangu kuti nyaule ku chilambo chakutalika, nansalile che Sala, ‘Yelei ni ichinchilosya unonyelo wenu kukwangu, kulikose kuchitujaule mwasalile ŵandu kuti une ndili achimwene jwenu!’ ”<verse eid="GEN 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 20:14" />Nipele che Abimeleki ŵammuchisye che Ibulahimu ŵankwakwe ŵala, ŵampele ni ngondolo ni ng'ombe ni achikapolo ŵachilume ni ŵachikongwe. <verse eid="GEN 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 20:15" />Che Abimeleki ŵansalile che Ibulahimu, “Nnole, chilambo chose chi chili changu! Nipele, nsagule palipose pinkusaka, ntame.” <verse eid="GEN 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 20:16" />Nipele che Abimeleki ŵansalile che Sala, “Nnole, une ngumpa mpwenu ipande elufu moja ya madini ga feza kwalosya wose ŵaali pamo nomwe kuti nganinkola chileŵo, ni jwalijose akumanyilila kuti nganinkola chileŵo.” <verse eid="GEN 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 20:17" />Nipele che Ibulahimu ŵapopele Akunnungu, ni Akunnungu ŵaalamisye che Abimeleki ni ŵankwawo ni achikapolo ŵakwe ŵachikongwe nombewo ŵakombwele kuŵeleka sooni, <verse eid="GEN 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 20:18" />pakuŵa kundanda ko Akunnungu ŵaatendekasisye ŵandu ŵa mu nyuumba ji che Abimeleki anaŵeleche kwaligongo lya che Sala ŵankwawo che Ibulahimu.<verse eid="GEN 20:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="GEN 21" />
  <para style="s">Kupagwa ku che Isaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 21:1" />Ambuje ŵampele upile che Sala, ni ŵantendele mpela iŵatite pakulanga. <verse eid="GEN 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 21:2" />Che Ibulahimu ali achekulwipe, che Sala ŵakwete chiilu, ŵaaŵelechele che Ibulahimu mwanache jwannume pa moŵa galagala gaŵasalile Akunnungu kuti chapagwe. <verse eid="GEN 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 21:3" />Che Ibulahimu ŵampele mwanache juŵaŵelekwe ni che Sala liina lyakwe Isaka. <verse eid="GEN 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 21:4" />A Isaka paŵaliji ni moŵa nane, che Ibulahimu ŵammumbesye mpela Akunnungu iŵatite pakwalajisya. <verse eid="GEN 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 21:5" />Che Ibulahimu ŵaliji ni yaka mia moja katema paŵapagwile che Isaka. <verse eid="GEN 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 21:6" />Nombe che Sala ŵatite, “Akunnungu ambele chiseko, kila mundu juchapilikane jele ngani chaseche pamo ni une.” <verse eid="GEN 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 21:7" />Ŵajonjechesye kuŵecheta, “Ŵaani ŵakakombwele kwasalila che Ibulahimu kuti, uneji che Sala chinjijonjesya ŵanache? Sooni naaŵelechele mwanache jwannume mu uchekulu wao.”<verse eid="GEN 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 21:8" />Mwanache jwakusile, ni pa lyuŵa liŵannekasisye konga che Ibulahimu ŵampanganyichisye chindimba chekulungwa.<verse eid="GEN 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Hajili ni che Ishumaeli akuŵinjikwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 21:9" />Pa lyuŵa limo che Sala ŵammweni che Ishumaeli, mwanache ju che Ibulahimu juŵaŵelekwe ni che Hajili jwa ku Misili, ali nkwatendela yachanache che Isaka. <verse eid="GEN 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 21:10" />Nipele, che Sala ŵaasalile che Ibulahimu, “Mumminje kapolo ju ni mwanagwe, pakuŵa ngaikukomboleka mwana jwa kapolo ju aiche kulisi pamo ni mwanangu che Isaka.” <verse eid="GEN 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 21:11" />Gele maloŵe go gaatesile che Ibulahimu asupuche nnope pakuŵa che Ishumaeli nombe ŵaliji mwanagwe. <verse eid="GEN 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 21:12" />Nambo Akunnungu ŵaasalile che Ibulahimu, “Nkasupuka kwaligongo lya mwanache jo pane kapolo jwenu che Hajili. Chilichose chakunsalila che Sala mpanganye pakuŵa mmwe chinkole iŵelesi inannanjile kutyochela ni che Isaka. <verse eid="GEN 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 21:13" />Ni yankati mwanache jwa kapolo jwenu, iyoyo chinantende atati jwa chilambo chachikulungwa pakuŵa jwelejo nombe ali mwanagwenu.”<verse eid="GEN 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 21:14" />Nipele, malaŵi jakwe kundaŵipe, che Ibulahimu ŵajigele chakulya ni meesi munsaku waukolochekwe ni lipende ni kwapa che Hajili. Che Ibulahimu ŵajigele indu yo, ŵaŵisile mmakoyo ga che Hajili, ŵamminjile pamo ni mwanagwe. Che Hajili ŵatyosile ni ŵaliji nkusyungulasyungula mu lipululu lya Beli Sheba.<verse eid="GEN 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 21:15" />Meesi gala gamasile munsaku mula, che Hajili ŵangoneche mwanagwe pambwilili kuusi chitela. <verse eid="GEN 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 21:16" />Che Hajili ŵasejele pambali utaliche wa mpela mita mia moja ni kuliŵechetela muntima mwake, “Ngangukombola kunnola mwanangu achiwaga.” Ni paŵaliji nkutama pele, ŵatandite kulila.<verse eid="GEN 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 21:17" />Akunnungu ŵampilikene mwanache achililaga ni katumetume jwa kwinani jwa Ambuje ŵammilasile che Hajili ni kummusya, “Che Hajili ana chindu chi chikunsupusya? Nkajogopa pakuŵa Akunnungu akupilikene kulila kwa mwanagwenu kwele kwaali. <verse eid="GEN 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 21:18" />Njime nkankamule mwanagwenu nkono, pakuŵa chinantende aŵe atati jwa chilambo chachikulungwa.” <verse eid="GEN 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 21:19" />Akunnungu ŵammunukwile meeso che Hajili, nombejo ŵachiweni chisima cha meesi. Ŵajawile ni kugumbasya meesi nsaku wa lipende lila, nipele ŵampele mwanagwe ang'we.<verse eid="GEN 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 21:20" />Akunnungu ŵaliji pamo ni nchanda jula, nombejo ŵapundile kukula. Ŵatemi mu lipululu ni ŵaliji jwakuuta nkunje jwambone. <verse eid="GEN 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 21:21" />Ŵaliji nkutama mu lipululu lya Palani, ni achikulu ŵao ŵanjigalile jwankongwe jwa kulombela kutyochela ku Misili.<verse eid="GEN 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Ibulahimu ni che Abimeleki akuŵichilana lilangano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 21:22" />Kele katema ko, che Abimeleki pamo ni che Fikoli, jwankulu jwa mpingo wa ŵandu ŵakwe ŵa ngondo, ŵajawile ku che Ibulahimu ni kwasalila, “Akunnungu ali pamo ni mmwe mu indu yose yankuipanganya. <verse eid="GEN 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 21:23" />Kwayele nnumbile kwa liina lya Akunnungu kuti ngamulambusya une, pane ŵanache ŵangu, pane isukulu yangu. Mpela indite kuntendela yambone mmwe, iyoyopeyo nomwe mundendele yambone une pamo ni ŵandu ŵangu mu chilambo chinkutama chi.” <verse eid="GEN 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 21:24" />Che Ibulahimu ŵatite, “Ngulumbila.”<verse eid="GEN 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 21:25" />Nipele, che Ibulahimu ŵadandaulile che Abimeleki yankati chisima chati ŵakutumichila ŵa che Abimeleki ŵachisumwile. <verse eid="GEN 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 21:26" />Che Abimeleki ŵatite, “Une ngangummanyilila mundu jwatesile yeleyi. Mmweji nganimuusalila ngani ji kupilikana kusyene ni kweleku pankuusalila.” <verse eid="GEN 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 21:27" />Nipele, che Ibulahimu ŵajigele ngondolo ni ng'ombe ni kwapa che Abimeleki nombe ŵaŵiliwo ŵapangenye lilangano. <verse eid="GEN 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 21:28" />Che Ibulahimu ŵasapwile ngondolo saba syankolo kutyochela mu nkutule wakwe. <verse eid="GEN 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 21:29" />Che Abimeleki ŵambusisye che Ibulahimu, “Ana ngondolo saba sinsapwile si malumbo gakwe ichichi?” <verse eid="GEN 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 21:30" />Che Ibulahimu ŵajanjile, “Mpochele ngondolo saba syankolo singumpa kwa nkono wangu uŵe umboni kuti uneji ni junachisokwele chisima chi.” <verse eid="GEN 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 21:31" />Kwayele peuto pala paŵilanjikwe Beli Sheba, malumbo gakwe gali chisima chakulumbila, pakuŵa peuto po wose ŵaŵili ŵalumbilile. <verse eid="GEN 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 21:32" />Nipele paŵamasile kuŵika lilangano lyao ku Beli Sheba ko, che Abimeleki ni che Fikoli jwankulu jwa ŵandu ŵa ngondo ŵakwe, ŵatyosile ni kuuja ku chilambo cha Ŵafilisti. <verse eid="GEN 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 21:33" />Che Ibulahimu ŵapandile chitela cha ukwesu ku Beli Sheba ko, ni peuto po ŵapopelele Ambuje, Akunnungu ŵa moŵa mose pangali mbesi. <verse eid="GEN 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 21:34" />Che Ibulahimu ŵatemi ku chilambo cha Ŵafilisti kwa moŵa gamajinji.<verse eid="GEN 21:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="GEN 22" />
  <para style="s">Akunnungu akunninga che Ibulahimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 22:1" />Pakumala yeleyo, Akunnungu ŵanlinjile che Ibulahimu, Akunnungu ŵammilasile, “Che Ibulahimu!” Nombejo ŵajitiche, “Une ndili apano.” <verse eid="GEN 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 22:2" />Nipele Akunnungu ŵansalile che Ibulahimu, “Munjigale mwanagwenu che Isaka, mwanagwenu jwa jikajika pe ni junkunnonyela kwannope, njaule ku chilambo cha Molia, nkantyosye nti mbopesi jakutinisya pa litumbi lichinganlosye.” <verse eid="GEN 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 22:3" />Malaŵi jakwe che Ibulahimu ŵajimwiche kundaŵipe, ŵasalulenye sasu ni kujitwika mbunda jakwe, ŵaajigele che Isaka ni ŵakutumichila ŵaŵili. Nipele ŵatandite ulendo kwaula kwiuto Akunnungu kuŵansalile ajaule. <verse eid="GEN 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 22:4" />Pa lyuŵa lya tatu lya ulendo wao, che Ibulahimu ŵajinamukwile meeso gakwe ni ŵaliweni liuto kwa kutalichila. <verse eid="GEN 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 22:5" />Ŵaasalile ŵakutumichila ŵakwe, “Ŵanyamwe nsigale apano pamo ni mbunda ji. Une ni nchanda jwangu ju tukwaula apala kwapopelela Akunnungu, nipele chitunsimane apano.”<verse eid="GEN 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 22:6" />Pelepo che Ibulahimu ŵajigele sasu sila ni kuntwika che Isaka mwanagwe, nsyene ŵajigele mooto pamo ni chipula mu nkono wakwe. Ni paŵaliji nkwaula, <verse eid="GEN 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 22:7" />Che Isaka ŵammilasile atatigwe, “Atati.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 22:7">Che Ibulahimu ŵajanjile, “Elo, nkuti uli.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 22:7">Che Isaka ŵausisye, “Mooto ni sasu ipali, ana mwanangondolo jwa mbopesi jakutinisya jo ali kwapi?” <verse eid="GEN 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 22:8" />Che Ibulahimu ŵanjanjile, “Mwanangu, Akunnungu nsyene chatupe mwanangondolo jwa kutyosya mbopesi.” Nipele wose ŵaŵili ŵajendelechele ni ulendo wao.<verse eid="GEN 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 22:9" />Paŵaiche kwele kuŵasalile ni Akunnungu kuti ajaule, che Ibulahimu ŵataŵile chilisa cha maganga ni ŵaŵisile sasu pachanya pakwe. Nipele ŵantaŵile che Isaka mwanagwe ni kungoneka pa sasu syasili pachanya pa chilisa. <verse eid="GEN 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 22:10" />Che Ibulahimu ŵajongwele nkono wakwe ŵasolomwele chipula kuti ansikite mwanagwe jo.<verse eid="GEN 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 22:11" />Nambo katumetume jwa kwinani jwa Ambuje ŵaŵilasile achitiji, “Che Ibulahimu! Che Ibulahimu!” Nombejo ŵajitiche, “Une ndili apano!” <verse eid="GEN 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 22:12" />Katumetume jwa kwinani jo ŵansalile, “Kasimummulasya mwanache jo namose kasimuntenda chachilichose mwanagwenu! Sambano manyilile kuti nkwete lipamba nkati Akunnungu, pakuŵa nganimunyima mwanagwenu, mwanagwenu jwa jikape.” <verse eid="GEN 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 22:13" />Nipele, che Ibulahimu ŵalolite lolite, ŵajiweni ngondolo tonde panyuma pao jili jitanjile misengo jakwe pa chisukutu. Nipele ŵajawile ni kujijigala ngondolo jila ni kujityosya mbopesi jakutinisya pamalo pa mwanagwe. <verse eid="GEN 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 22:14" />Kwayele, che Ibulahimu ŵapaŵilasile peuto po, “Ambuje chatupe.” Mpela ŵandu yakuti kusala mpaka lelo jino, “Pa litumbi lya Ambuje, Ambuje chatupe.”<verse eid="GEN 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 22:15" />Katumetume jwa kwinani jwa Ambuje ŵammilasile che Ibulahimu kaaŵili kutyochela kwinani, <verse eid="GEN 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 22:16" />ŵansalile, “Ambuje akuti yele ‘Une numbilile kwa liina lyangu nansyene kuti pakuŵa ntesile yeleyi, namose nganinkaana kuumba mwanagwenu jwa jikape junkunnonyela, <verse eid="GEN 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 22:17" />isyene chinampe upile, ni uŵelesi wenu chinauchuluye, chiuŵe wangaŵalanjikwa mpela ndondwa sya kwiunde, ni mpela nsanga wa kumbwani. Nombewo chajigale misi ja ŵammagongo ŵao jiŵe jao, <verse eid="GEN 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 22:18" />ni kutyochela ni uŵelesi wenu ŵandu ŵa ilambo yose chapegwe upile ligongo mmwe njiitichisye malajisyo gangu.’ ” <verse eid="GEN 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 22:19" />Nipele, che Ibulahimu ŵaaujilile ŵakutumichila ŵakwe, ni wose ŵatyosile kwa pamo ni kuuja ku Beli Sheba kuŵatamaga che Ibulahimu, nombejo ŵatemi ku Beli Sheba ko.<verse eid="GEN 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uŵelesi u che Naholi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 22:20" />Pakumala kutyochela yeleyo che Ibulahimu ŵasalilwe kuti che Milika nombe nawo ŵaŵelechele che Naholi mpwenu ŵanache ŵa chilume: <verse eid="GEN 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 22:21" />Che Usi juŵaliji jwakwitiwo, ni che Busi jwaŵili jwakwe ni che Kemueli jwaali atati ŵao che Alamu, <verse eid="GEN 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 22:22" />ni che Kesedi ni che Haso ni che Pilidashi ni che Yidilafu ni che Besueli. <verse eid="GEN 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 22:23" />Che Besueli ŵammeleche che Labeka. Che Milika ŵaŵelechele che Naholi mpwakwe che Ibulahimu ŵanache nane. <verse eid="GEN 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 22:24" />Che Leuma chilanga chao che Naholi, nombejo ŵaaŵelechele che Naholi ŵanache ncheche: Che Teba, ni che Gahamu, ni che Tahashi ni che Maaka.<verse eid="GEN 22:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="GEN 23" />
  <para style="s">Chiwa chi che Sala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 23:1" />Che Sala ŵatemi yaka mia moja ishilini na saba. <verse eid="GEN 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 23:2" />Che Sala ŵawilile ku Kiliasi Alaba, yaani ku Hebuloni mu chilambo cha Kanaani, ni che Ibulahimu ŵaalilile che Sala ŵankwawo ni kwalilila kwa malumbo. <verse eid="GEN 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 23:3" />Che Ibulahimu ŵajimwiche paŵagoneche malilo ga ŵankwawo, ŵajawile kwa Ŵahiti ni kwasalila, <verse eid="GEN 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 23:4" />“Une ndili jwanlendo ni sooni ngutama ni ŵanyamwe mu chilambo chenu chi. Musumichisye malo ga malembe kuti siche malilo ga ŵankwangu.” <verse eid="GEN 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 23:5" />Ŵahiti ŵanjanjile che Ibulahimu, <verse eid="GEN 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 23:6" />“Ntupilikanile, achimwene, mmwe nli chilongola jwakumanyika pasikati jetu. Mwaasiche ŵankwenu mu lilembe lyalililyose lyalili lyambone mwa gelega, ngapagwa mundu juchankanye namose kunsiŵila kuti munansiche ŵankwenu.” <verse eid="GEN 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 23:7" />Nipele che Ibulahimu ŵajimi ni kwakotamila achinsyene chilambo chila yaani Ŵahiti. <verse eid="GEN 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 23:8" />Ni ŵaasalile, “Iŵaga ŵanyamwe nkundile kuti naasiche ŵankwangu pelepa, choonde muumendele kwa che Efuloni mwanagwao che Sohali, <verse eid="GEN 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 23:9" />kuti aasumichisye mbugu jakwe ja ku Makipela jajili muumbesi mwa ngunda wakwe. Mwaŵende aasumichisye kwa ntengo wa usyenesyene paujo penu kuti napatende pakusiichila.”<verse eid="GEN 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 23:10" />Che Efuloni asyene ŵaliji jumo jwa Ŵahiti ŵaŵasimene pa nnango wekulungwa wa musi. Nipele che Efuloni ŵanjanjile che Ibulahimu, ŵandu wose ali nkupikana. <verse eid="GEN 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 23:11" />Ŵaasalile, “Ikawa yeleyo achimwene, une ngangunsumichisya, ngumpa ngunda pamo ni mbugu jajili mwelemo. Sooni ngumpa paujo pa ŵandu wose, kuti mwaasiche ŵankwenu mwelemo.”<verse eid="GEN 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 23:12" />Che Ibulahimu ŵakoteme sooni paujo pa ŵandu ŵa chilambo cho, <verse eid="GEN 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 23:13" />ni kwasalila che Efuloni, akuno ŵandu ali nkupikanila, “Choonde ngummenda mumbilikanile. Chiisume ngunda wenu, sooni nkunde kupochelea malipilo go, kuti naasiche ŵankwangu mwelemo.” <verse eid="GEN 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 23:14" />Che Efuloni ŵanjanjile che Ibulahimu, <verse eid="GEN 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 23:15" />“Achimwene jwangu mumbilikanile, ngunda wangu ntengo wakwe uli ipande mia nne ya feza, nambo feza chili chindu chanti uli pasikati ja mmwe ni une? Nkaasiche ŵankwenu mwelemo.” <verse eid="GEN 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 23:16" />Che Ibulahimu ŵakundile achila chiŵasasile che Efuloni paujo pa Ŵahiti, ŵampele che Efuloni ntengo wasasile, ipande mia nne ya feza, mpela iyatiji mapime ga ŵamalonda ŵa katema ko.<verse eid="GEN 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 23:17" />Nipele ngunda wa che Efuloni ku Makipela ko wauli kungopochelo lyuŵa kwa Mamule ni mbugu ni itela yose yaili mu ngunda wo, yaliji yakwe che Ibulahimu. <verse eid="GEN 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 23:18" />Ŵahiti wose ŵaŵasongangene pannango wakwinjilia musi wo, ŵaimanyilile kuti indu yose yo ili yakwe che Ibulahimu. <verse eid="GEN 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 23:19" />Pakumala yele, che Ibulahimu ŵaasichile ŵankwawo che Sala mu mbugu lyalili mwelemo mu ngunda wa Makipela, wauli chiŵandika ni Mamule yaani ku Hebuloni, mu chilambo cha Kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 23:20" />Kwayele ngunda uwaliji wa Ŵahiti ŵampele che Ibulahimu ni mbugu jajili mwelemo kuti paŵe malo gakwe ga kusiichila.<verse eid="GEN 23:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="GEN 24" />
  <para style="s">Che Isaka akulombela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 24:1" />Nipele che Ibulahimu ŵaliji achekulwipe nnope, nombe Ambuje ŵaliji amasile kwapa upile mu indu yose. <verse eid="GEN 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 24:2" />Lyuŵa limo che Ibulahimu ŵansalile jwakutumichila jwakwe jwachekulwipe kwapunda wose, juŵaliji jwakulindilila chipanje chakwe chose, “Mmiche nkono wenu pa iyiga yangu, <verse eid="GEN 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 24:3" />none chinannumbisye kwa liina lya Ambuje, Akunnungu ŵa kwinani ni chilambo, kuti ngasimunjigalila mwanangu ju jwankongwe jwakulombela kutyochela mwa achiŵali ŵa ku Kanaani ŵangutama nawo apano. <verse eid="GEN 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 24:4" />Nambo njaule ku chilambo chimbagwile une, kwa achalongo achinjangu, nkaanjigalile jwankongwe mwanangu che Isaka kweleko.” <verse eid="GEN 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 24:5" />Nipele jwakutumichila jula ŵausisye, “Iŵaga jwankongwe jo chakane kwika ni une mu chilambo chi, uli nammusye mwanagwenu ku chilambo kuntyochele?” <verse eid="GEN 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 24:6" />Che Ibulahimu ŵanjanjile jwakutumichila jo, “Ngwamba! Nlilolechesye kuti ngasimunjausya mwanangu kweleko. <verse eid="GEN 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 24:7" />Ambuje, Akunnungu ŵa kwinani, juŵandyosisye une kwa atati ŵangu ni ku chilambo chimbagwile, ŵanumbilile kuti chiŵape chilambo chi iŵelesi yangu. Akunnungu chachimtuma katumetume jwakwe annongolele, nkanjigalile mwanangu jwankongwe kutyochela kweleko. <verse eid="GEN 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 24:8" />Iŵaga jwankongwe jo chakane kwika akuno ni mmwe, nipele mmwejo ngantaŵikwa ni kulilumbilila kwangu. Nambo kwa yailiyose ngasimummusya mwanangu kweleko.” <verse eid="GEN 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 24:9" />Nipele jwakutumichila jula, ŵaŵisile nkono wakwe pa yiiga ya che Ibulahimu achimwene jwakwe, ŵalumbilile kuti chatende mpela iŵasachile che Ibulahimu.<verse eid="GEN 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 24:10" />Nipele jwakutumichila jula, ŵajigele inyama kumi yaikuŵilanjikwa ngamia ya achimwene jwao ni kwaula ali ajigele mituuka jejinji jambone. Ŵajawile mpaka mu musi uŵatamaga che Naholi mu chilambo cha Mesopotamia. <verse eid="GEN 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 24:11" />Paŵaiche, ŵasitindiŵesye ngamia sila mwingulugulu chisima chachili paasa pa musi. Lyaliji ligulo katema ka achakongwe kwaula ku chisima kukuteka meesi. <verse eid="GEN 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 24:12" />Nipele ŵapopesile, “Alakwe Ambuje, Akunnungu jwa achimwene jwangu che Ibulahimu, choonde mundendele yambone lelo, mwakolele chanasa achimwene jwangu che Ibulahimu. <verse eid="GEN 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 24:13" />Nnole, uneji nyimi apano chiŵandi ni chisima chi, ni achiŵali ŵa ŵandu ŵa musi wu akwika apano kukuteka meesi. <verse eid="GEN 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 24:14" />Mwali juchinaasalile ‘Ntule lulo lwenu lwa meesi, mumbe meesi ng'we.’ Nombejo ajilaga, ‘Ng'weje, sooni chinasing'wesye ngamia syenu,’ jwelejo ni jumunsagulile jwakutumichila jwenu che Isaka. Chelecho chichilosye kuti mwatendele yambone achimwene jwangu.”<verse eid="GEN 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 24:15" />Akanaŵe kumalisya kupopelela, che Labeka mwali ju che Besueli, mwanagwe che Milika, ŵankwawo che Naholi, mpwao che Ibulahimu, ŵaiche ali atwichile lulo lwakwe. <verse eid="GEN 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 24:16" />Mwali jo jwaliji jwakusalala nnope ni ŵaliji mwalimwalipe. Nipele ŵatuluchile pa chisima pala ni kuteka meesi mu lulo lwakwe ni kutyoka. <verse eid="GEN 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 24:17" />Nipele jwakutumichila jula ŵammutuchile ni kwasalila, “Choonde, muumbe meesi kanandi ng'we.” <verse eid="GEN 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 24:18" />Mwali jula ŵanjanjile, “Nng'weje achimwene jwangu.” Papopo mwali jula ŵatusile lulo lwakwe, ŵanng'wesisye. <verse eid="GEN 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 24:19" />Paŵamasile kwangwesya meesi, ŵansalile, “Iyoyopeyo chinasitechele meesi ngamia syenu, sing'we mpaka syaakwane.” <verse eid="GEN 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 24:20" />Nipele kwakwanguya ŵagatasile meesi pakung'wechesya inyama, ŵautuchile ku chisima kukuteka meesi ni kusing'wesya ngamia syose sya mundu jula. <verse eid="GEN 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 24:21" />Jwakutumichila jula ŵannolechesyaga yambone mwali jula pangaŵecheta chilichose, ŵatesile yele alole iŵaga Ambuje aupele upile ulendo wakwe pane ngaŵa.<verse eid="GEN 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 24:22" />Ngamia sila pasyakwanile meesi, mundu jula ŵampele mwali jula chipini cha sahabu cha ndalama jajikulungwa ni bangili siŵili sya sahabu sya ndalama jajikulungwa. <verse eid="GEN 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 24:23" />Jwakutumichila jula ŵammusisye mwali jula, “Choonde muusalile: Mmwe cheti ŵani? Ana ku nyuumba ja atati ŵenu kupali kwagone uweji?” <verse eid="GEN 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 24:24" />Che Labeka ŵajanjile, “Uneji ndili mwanache ju che Besueli, mwanagwe che Milika, ŵankwawo che Naholi. <verse eid="GEN 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 24:25" />Kumangwetu kwana yakulya yejinji yakulisisya inyama ni iyoyo papali pakugona mmwe.” <verse eid="GEN 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 24:26" />Mundu jula ŵakoteme ni kwapopelela Ambuje. <verse eid="GEN 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 24:27" />Ŵatite, “Achimbichikwe Ambuje, Akunnungu jwa achimwene jwangu che Ibulahimu, ŵanganaliŵalila kulosya unonyelo wao ni kukulupilichika kwao kwa achimwene jwangu. Ambuje asyene anongwesye une mu ulendo wangu mpaka kwa achalongo ŵao achimwene jwangu!”<verse eid="GEN 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 24:28" />Nipele mwali jula ŵautuchile ku nyuumba ja achikulugwe, ni kwasalila ŵandu yose yaikopochele. <verse eid="GEN 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 24:29" />Che Labeka ŵakwete achimwene jwakwe liina lyakwe che Labani. Che Labani ŵautuchile ku chisima kula kukusimana ni mundu jula. <verse eid="GEN 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 24:30" />Akanaŵe kwaula che Labani ŵachiweni chipini chila pa mbula ni bangili sila mmakono mwa che Labeka ni kupilikana yose yasalilwe che Labeka nkati mundu jula. Nipele che Labani wanjaulile mundu jula, ŵansimene ali ajimi ni ngamia syakwe chiŵandi ni chisima. <verse eid="GEN 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 24:31" />Che Labani ŵansalile mundu jula, “Twende kumangwetu mmwe ŵampele upile ni Ambuje, ana ligongochi nkwima pelepa? Une nansyene nanlinganyichisye chuumba ni liuto kwa ligongo lya ngamia syenu!” <verse eid="GEN 24:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 24:32" />Nipele jwakutumichila jula ŵajinjile nkati. Che Labani ŵagopolenye itutule pa ngamia sila ni kusipa masamba ni chakulya cha ilango, nipele ŵampele jwakutumichila jula ni ŵandu ŵakwe meesi ga kulikunda makongolo. <verse eid="GEN 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 24:33" />Nipele ŵaichenacho chakulya kuti alyanje, nambo ŵatite, “Nguundya mpaka saale chingusaka kusala.” Che Labani ŵansalile, “Sambano ntusalile.”<verse eid="GEN 24:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 24:34" />Nipele mundu jula ŵatite, “Une ndili jwakutumichila ju che Ibulahimu. <verse eid="GEN 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 24:35" />Ambuje ampele upile achimwene jwangu, ni antesile kuŵa jwakusichila. Ampele mipingo ja ngondolo ni mbusi ni ng'ombe, ni madini ga feza ni sahabu, ni ŵakutumichila achalume ni achakongwe, ni ngamia ni mbunda! <verse eid="GEN 24:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 24:36" />Che Sala ŵankwawo achimwene jwangu, mu uchekulu wao ŵakombwele kummelechela mwanache achimwene jwangu, ni achimwene jwangu ampele jwele mwanache jo ipanje yakwe yose. <verse eid="GEN 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 24:37" />Achimwene jwangu ŵanumbisye une achitiji, ‘Nkanjigalila nchanda jwangu jwankongwe mu chilambo cha Kanaani mungutama. <verse eid="GEN 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 24:38" />Nambo njaule mpaka kumusi kwa atati ŵangu ni kwa achalongo achinjangu, nkanjigalile mwanangu che Isaka jwankongwe.’ <verse eid="GEN 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 24:39" />Noneji naausisye achimwene jwangu, ‘Chiiŵe uli iŵaga jwankongwe jo chaakane kwika ni une?’ <verse eid="GEN 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 24:40" />Nambo jwelejo ŵanyanjile, ‘Ambuje jungwajitichisya moŵa gose, chantume katumetume jwa kwinani jwakwe alongane nomwe ni kunkamuchisya mu ulendo wenu. Nomwe munjigalile mwanangu jwankongwe kutyochela kwa achalongo achinjangu ni pa musi wa atati ŵangu. <verse eid="GEN 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 24:41" />Pachinyiche kwa achalongo achinjangu, iŵaga chakane kumpa mwali, nipele malumbi gangu ngagantaŵa.’<verse eid="GEN 24:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 24:42" />“Lelo jino panyiche pa chisima naapopelele njitiji, ‘Choonde Ambuje, Akunnungu jwa achimwene jwangu che Ibulahimu, ngummenda muungamusye mu ulendo wangu. <verse eid="GEN 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 24:43" />Uneji nyiimi pachiŵandi chisima chi. Mwali jwalijose juchaiche kukuteka meesi chinaaŵende ambe meesi kanandi ga kung'wa mu lulo lwakwe, <verse eid="GEN 24:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 24:44" />nombejo aambaga une ni kusitechela meesi ngamia syangu, nipele jwelejo ni jwasagulikwe ni Akunnungu kuŵa ŵankwakwe mwanache jwa achimwene jwangu che Ibulahimu.’<verse eid="GEN 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 24:45" />“Ngunaŵe kumalisya kupopela mu ntima, ŵaiche che Labeka ali ajigele lulo pekoyo, ŵatelemuchile pa chisima ni kuteka meesi. Noneji naasalile, ‘Choonde muumbe meesi ng'we.’ <verse eid="GEN 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 24:46" />Nombejo ŵatusile lulo lwakwe kwachitema ni kukamulila, ni ŵatite, ‘Nng'weje, iyoyopeyo chinasing'wesye meesi ngamia syenu.’ Nipele nang'wele meesi, ni iyoyo ŵasing'wesisye ngamia syangu. <verse eid="GEN 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 24:47" />Ni nammusisye kuti, ‘Ana mmwe cheti ŵani?’ Nombejo ŵanyanjile, ‘Uneji ndili cheti Besueli, mwanagwe che Milika, ŵankwawo che Naholi.’ Nipele nammwasisye chipini pambula ni bangili mmakono. <verse eid="GEN 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 24:48" />Nipele natindiŵele ni kwapopelela Ambuje. Naakusisye Ambuje, Akunnungu jwa achimwene jwangu che Ibulahimu, juŵanongwesye une mpaka kwa mwali jwa lukosyo lwa achimwene jwangu che Ibulahimu ni kweleko naasosele mwali jwakulombekwa ni mwanagwe. <verse eid="GEN 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 24:49" />Sambano muusalilanje iwaga chimwatendele achimwene jwangu, kwa kukulupilichika ni kwa wema iŵaga nkukananga muusalile manyilile chakutenda.”<verse eid="GEN 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 24:50" />Pakumala kupilikana yele, che Labani ni che Besueli ŵanjanjile, “Pakuŵa chelechi chikutyochela kwa Ambuje, uweji ngatukukombola kuŵecheta chilichose. <verse eid="GEN 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 24:51" />Che Labeka aŵaapa munjigale njaule nawo, akaŵeje ŵankwakwe mwanache jwa achimwene jwenu nti Ambuje iŵatite pakusala.” <verse eid="GEN 24:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 24:52" />Jwakutumichila ju che Ibulahimu paŵagapilikene maloŵe go, ŵatindiŵele ni kwapopelela Ambuje. <verse eid="GEN 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 24:53" />Nipele jwakutumichila jula ŵakopwesye indu yakulikwatula yekolosye kwa madini ga feza ni sahabu pamo ni nguo, ŵampele che Labeka. Iyoyopeyo ŵaapele indu ya ndalama jajikulungwa kakagwe che Labeka ni achikulugwe.<verse eid="GEN 24:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 24:54" />Jwakutumichila ju che Ibulahimu ni ŵandu uŵalongene nawo ŵalile ni kung'wa ni ŵagonile kukoko. Paŵajimwiche kundaŵi, jwakutumichila jula ŵatite, “Sambano muuneche nyaule kwa achimwene jwangu.” <verse eid="GEN 24:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 24:55" />Nambo achimwene jwakwe che Labeka ni achikulugwe ŵatite, “Munneche mwali ju atame noweji kwa moŵa kumi, nipele njaule najo.” <verse eid="GEN 24:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="GEN 24:56" />Nambo jwakutumichila jula ŵatite, “Choonde nkaasiŵila pakuŵa Ambuje angamuchisye mu ulendo wangu, ngummenda muuneche nyaule kwa achimwene jwangu.” <verse eid="GEN 24:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="GEN 24:57" />Ni ŵanyawo ŵajanjile, “Twende tummilanje mwali jo kuti tummusye nsyene.” <verse eid="GEN 24:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="GEN 24:58" />Kwayele ŵammilasile che Labeka ni kummusya, “Ana nkusaka kulongana ni mundu ju?” Ŵajanjile, “Elo, chinongane nawo.” <verse eid="GEN 24:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="GEN 24:59" />Nipele ŵannesile che Labeka ni yaaya jwakwe kuti alongane ni jwakutumichila ju che Ibulahimu ni ŵandu ŵakwe. <verse eid="GEN 24:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="GEN 24:60" />Nipele ŵampele upile che Labeka achitiji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 24:60">“Mmwe alumbu ŵetu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 24:60">Mme nangolo jwa ŵandu ŵajinji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 24:60">iŵelesi yenu ijigale misi ja ŵammagongo ŵao kuŵa jao.”<verse eid="GEN 24:60" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="GEN 24:61" />Nipele che Labeka pamo ni achiyaaya ŵakwe ŵaliŵisile chile, ŵakwesile ngamia syao ni kulongana ni jwakutumichila ju che Ibulahimu ni wose ŵajawile.<verse eid="GEN 24:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="GEN 24:62" />Kele katema ko, che Isaka ŵatyosile ku Beeli Lahai Loi, ni ŵaliji nkutama ku lujenda kwa Kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 24:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="GEN 24:63" />Lyuŵa limo, katema ka ligulo, che Isaka ŵajawile ku ngunda kukuganisyaganisya, paŵalolite ŵasiweni ngamia sili nkwika. <verse eid="GEN 24:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="GEN 24:64" />Che Labeka paŵammweni che Isaka, ŵatulwiche mu ngamia, <verse eid="GEN 24:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="GEN 24:65" />ni kummusya jwakutumichila ju che Ibulahimu jula, “Ana ŵaani ŵeŵala ŵakwenda mu ngunda, ŵaakwika kutuchingamila?” Jwakutumichila jula ŵajanjile, “Aŵaŵa ali achimwene jwangu.” Pelepo che Labeka ŵajigele mtandio wakwe ni kuliunichila kumeso. <verse eid="GEN 24:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="GEN 24:66" />Jwakutumichila jula ŵansalile che Isaka indu yose yatesile. <verse eid="GEN 24:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="GEN 24:67" />Nipele che Isaka ŵampeleche che Labeka mu lisakasa li che Sala achikulugwe, ni kuŵa ŵankwakwe. Che Isaka ŵannonyele nnope che Labeka, kwayele che Labeka wantulesye ntima che Isaka kwa chiwa cha achikulugwe.<verse eid="GEN 24:67" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="GEN 25" />
  <para style="s">Iŵelesi ine i che Ibulahimu (1 Indu ya katema 1:32-33)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 25:1" />Che Ibulahimu ŵalombele ŵakongwe ŵane liina lyao che Ketula. <verse eid="GEN 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 25:2" />Che Ketula ŵaŵelechele che Ibulahimu ŵanache: Che Simulani ni che Yokishani ni che Medani ni che Midiani ni che Ishibaki ni che Shua. <verse eid="GEN 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 25:3" />Che Yakishani ŵaŵeleche che Sheba ni che Dedani. Ŵanache ŵa che Dedani ŵaliji Ŵaashulu ni Ŵaletushi ni Ŵaleumi. <verse eid="GEN 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 25:4" />Ŵanache ŵa che Midiani ŵaliji che Efa ni che Efeli ni che Hanoki ni che Abida ni che Elidaa. Ŵeleŵa wose ŵaliji uŵelesi u che Ketula.<verse eid="GEN 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 25:5" />Che Ibulahimu ŵapele che Isaka kila chindu chiŵakwete. <verse eid="GEN 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 25:6" />Katema che Ibulahimu ali ŵajumi, ŵapele mituuka achiŵanagwe ŵachilume uŵaŵeleche ku ilanga yakwe. Nipele ŵaapeleche ŵanache ŵa upande wa kungopochelo lyuŵa, atalikangane ni che Isaka mwanagwe.<verse eid="GEN 25:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chiwa chi che Ibulahimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 25:7" />Che Ibulahimu ŵatemi yaka mia moja sabini na tano. <verse eid="GEN 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 25:8" />Nipele che Ibulahimu ŵajasiche ali atemi yaka yejinji yakupoka ni kupunda ni kugona ni achachekulu ŵakwe ŵaŵawile. <verse eid="GEN 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 25:9" />Che Isaka ni che Ishumaeli ŵanache ŵa che Ibulahimu ŵaasichile atati ŵao mu mbugu ja Makipela, jajili kungopochelo lyuŵa kwa Mamle mu ngunda uwaliji wa che Efuloni mwanagwe che Sohali jwali Muhiti. <verse eid="GEN 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 25:10" />Che Ibulahimu ŵasumile ngunda wo ku Ŵahiti. Mwelemo che Ibulahimu ni che Sala ni muŵasichikwe. <verse eid="GEN 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 25:11" />Che Ibulahimu paŵaŵile, Akunnungu ŵampele upile che Isaka mwanagwe. Nombe che Isaka ŵaliji nkutama chiŵandi ni chisima cha Beeli Lahai Loi.<verse eid="GEN 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uŵelesi u che Ishumaeli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 1:28-31">1 Indu ya katema 1:28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 25:12" />Au uli uŵelesi u che Ishumaeli mwanagwe che Ibulahimu juŵammeleche kwa che Hajili jwa ku Misili juŵaliji yaaya ju che Sala. <verse eid="GEN 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 25:13" />Aga gali meena ga ŵanache ŵa che Ishumaeli malinga ni iŵatite pakupagwa: Che Nebayoti juŵaliji jwa kwitiwo ni che Kedali ni che Adibeeli ni che Mibisamu, <verse eid="GEN 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 25:14" />ni che Mishima ni che Duma ni che Masa, <verse eid="GEN 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 25:15" />ni che Hadadi ni che Tema ni che Yetuli ni che Nafishi ni che Kedema. <verse eid="GEN 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 25:16" />Welewo ali ŵanache ŵachilume ŵa che Ishumaeli ŵaŵaliji ilongola wa ngosyo kumi na mbili. Misi jao ni misinda jao jaŵilanjikwe malinga ni meena gao. <verse eid="GEN 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 25:17" />Yaka yose yatemi che Ishumaeli yaliji yaka mia moja selasini na saba, ni ŵawile, nombejo ŵagonile pamo ni achachekulu ŵao. <verse eid="GEN 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 25:18" />Iŵelesi i che Ishumaeli yatemi mu chilambo cha pasikati ja Haŵila ni Shuli, kungopochelo lyuŵa kwa Misili kwaula ku Ashuli. Ŵanyawo ŵatemi pangali kwilana ni iŵelesi ine i che Ibulahimu.<verse eid="GEN 25:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kupagwa ku che Esau ni che Yakubu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 25:19" />Au uli uŵelesi u che Isaka mwanache ju che Ibulahimu. <verse eid="GEN 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 25:20" />Che Isaka paŵaliji ni yaka alobaini ŵannombele che Labeka mwanache ju che Besueli, Muhalamu jwa musi wa ku Padini Halamu. Che Labeka ŵaliji mlumbugwe che Labani. <verse eid="GEN 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 25:21" />Che Isaka ŵaapopelele Ambuje kwa ligongo lya ŵankwawo, pakuŵa ŵaliji ngakuŵeleka. Nombe Ambuje ŵagakundile mapopelo gakwe, ni che Labeka ŵakwete chitumbo. <verse eid="GEN 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 25:22" />Chitumbo cho chaliji cha maŵila. Ŵanache wo ŵaliji nkututana mu lutumbo mwa che Lebeka, nombejo ŵatite, “Kwachichi chindu chi chikungopochela une?” Nipele che Labeka ŵajawile kwawusya Ambuje. <verse eid="GEN 25:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 25:23" />Ambuje ŵanjanjile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 25:23">“Mu lutumbo mwenu mwana ngosyo siŵili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 25:23">ngosyo siŵili sisimmeleche chisitindane.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 25:23">Jumo chaŵe ni machili kumpunda jwine;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 25:23">jwankulungwa chachintumichila jwannondi.”<verse eid="GEN 25:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 25:24" />Moŵa gakwe ga kuligopola pagaiche, che Labeka ŵaligopwele maŵila ŵachilume. <verse eid="GEN 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 25:25" />Mwanache jwandanda ŵaliji jwanchejeu, ni chiilu chakwe chose chaliji ni umbo, ni ŵaŵilasile liina lyakwe a Esau. <verse eid="GEN 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 25:26" />Mwanache jwaŵili ŵapagwile ali achikamulile chindende cha a Esau, nombejo ŵaŵilasile liina lyakwe a Yakubu. Katema paŵapagwile ŵanache wo, che Isaka ŵaliji ni yaka sitini.<verse eid="GEN 25:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Esau akusumisya ukulungwa wakwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 25:27" />Ŵanache ŵala ŵakusile, che Esau ŵaliji jwa kusakula inyama jwambone, mundu jwakunonyelwa kwendajenda mmatinji, nambo che Yakubu ŵaliji jwakulitimalika, mundu jwakunonyelwa kutama pamusi. <verse eid="GEN 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 25:28" />Nipele, che Isaka ŵannonyele che Esau ligongo ŵanonyelwe nnope kulya nyama yaisakulikwe ni che Esau, nambo che Labeka ŵannonyele che Yakubu.<verse eid="GEN 25:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 25:29" />Lyuŵa limo che Yakubu ŵaliji nkuteleka dengu, che Esau ŵausile kumusi kutyochela kukusakula inyama jili jakwete sala kwannope. <verse eid="GEN 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 25:30" />Ŵansalile che Yakubu, “Nguwa sala, choonde muumbe kanandi nsusi wechejeu.” Lyeleli ni ligongo ŵaŵilanjikwaga Edomu, malumbo gakwe jwanchejeu. <verse eid="GEN 25:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 25:31" />Che Yakubu ŵajanjile, “Chinampe naga chimusumichisye kaje ukulungwa wenu wa kuŵa mwanache jwa kwitiwo.” <verse eid="GEN 25:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 25:32" />Che Esau ni ŵatite, “Ayaga! Une nguŵandichila kuwa, ana ukulungwa wangu wa kuŵa mwanache jwa kwitiwo uli chichi kwa une?” <verse eid="GEN 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 25:33" />Che Yakubu ni ŵatite, “Mulumbilile kaje iŵaga chimuumbe ukulungwa wo.” Nipele che Esau ŵanlumbilile che Yakubu ni kunsumichisya ukulungwa wakwe wa kuŵa mwanache jwa kwitiwo. <verse eid="GEN 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 25:34" />Nipele che Yakubu ŵampele che Esau nkate ni dengu sila. Che Esau ŵalile ni kung'wa, nipele ŵajimwiche ni kwaula. Yeleyi ni iŵatite che Esau pakuunyelusya ukulungwa wakwe wa kuŵa mwanache jwa kwitiwo.<verse eid="GEN 25:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="GEN 26" />
  <para style="s">Che Isaka akusamila ku Gelali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 26:1" />Nipele patyochele sala jekulungwa mu chilambo mula, kujipunda sala jijatyochele katema ka che Ibulahimu. Che Isaka ŵajawile kwa mwenye jwa Ŵafilisi jwakuŵilanjikwa che Abimeleki jwaŵatamaga ku Gelali. <verse eid="GEN 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 26:2" />Ambuje ŵankopochele che Isaka ni kunsalila, “Ngasinjaula chilambo cha ku Misili, nambo ntame mu chilambo mu muchinansalile. <verse eid="GEN 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 26:3" />Ntame mu chilambo chi kwa katema, ni une chinjiŵa ni mmwe ni kumpa upile. Chimalichisye chilanga chinaapele atati ŵenu che Ibulahimu, pakuŵa chinampe mmwe ni iŵelesi yenu ilambo yose. <verse eid="GEN 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 26:4" />Chinaatende iŵelesi yenu kuŵa ŵajinji mpela ndondwa sya mwinani ni kwapa ilambo yose yi. Kutyochela mu uŵelesi wenu, ŵandu wose pachilambo chapegwe upile, <verse eid="GEN 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 26:5" />ligongo che Ibulahimu ŵambikanile une, ni ŵagakamulisye malajisyo gangu, ni makanyo gangu ni malamulo gangu.”<verse eid="GEN 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 26:6" />Kwayele che Isaka ŵatemi ku Gelali ko. <verse eid="GEN 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 26:7" />Ŵandu ŵa kwele paŵaausisye ngani jankati ŵankwawo, nombejo ŵajanjile, “Aju ali nlumbwangu.” Ŵajogwepe kusala isyene kuti che Lebeka ali ŵankwawo kwa ligongo lyakwajogopa ŵandu ŵa chilambo chila akammuleje. Pakuŵa ŵaliji ŵakusalala nnope. <verse eid="GEN 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 26:8" />Paŵatemi kweleko kwa katema kakaleu, che Abimeleki mwenye jwa Ŵafilisiti ŵalingulile pedilisha, ŵammweni che Isaka ali ŵaakumbete che Labeka ŵankwawo. <verse eid="GEN 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 26:9" />Che Abimeleki ŵammilasile che Isaka ni kunsalila, “Ana kumbe che Labeka ŵa ali ŵankwenu! Kwachichi mwasasile unami kuti ali alumbu ŵenu?” Che Isaka ŵajanjile, “Ligongo najogopaga kuulagwa kwa ligongo lyakwe.”<verse eid="GEN 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 26:10" />Che Abimeleki ŵausisye, “Ana chichi chelechi chintutesile? Jumo jwa ŵandu ŵangu pangaganisya akakombwele kugona ni ŵankwenu, nomwe nkatuleŵasisye.” <verse eid="GEN 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 26:11" />Nipele che Abimeleki ŵaajamwiche ŵandu wose achitiji, “Mundu jwalijose juchankwaye mundu ju pane ŵankwakwe, isyene chaulajikwe.”<verse eid="GEN 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 26:12" />Chele chaka cho che Isaka ŵalimile mu chilambo mula, nipele ŵawunile yakulya yejinji nnope, pakuŵa Ambuje ŵampele upile. <verse eid="GEN 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 26:13" />Pelepo che Isaka ŵakwete ipanje yejinji, ŵapatile indu yejinji mpaka ŵaliji jwakusichila nnope. <verse eid="GEN 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 26:14" />Ŵakwete ngondolo, ni ng'ombe, ni ŵakutumichila achajinji, mpaka Ŵafilisiti ŵaakolele wiu. <verse eid="GEN 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 26:15" />Nipele Ŵafilisiti ŵaliji asilile isima yose iŵasolite ŵakutumichila ŵa che Ibulahimu, atati ŵao che Isaka, iŵasolite katema che Ibulahimu ali ŵajumi. <verse eid="GEN 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 26:16" />Che Abimeleki ŵansalile che Isaka, “Ntyoche pamangwetu pano, pakuŵa mmwejo sambano nkwete machili kutupunda uwe.”<verse eid="GEN 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 26:17" />Nipele che Isaka ŵatyosile kweleko, ŵajawile ni kuŵika chigono pa lichemba lya Gelali ni kutama kweleko. <verse eid="GEN 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 26:18" />Che Isaka ŵaukwile sooni isima iŵasosile che Ibulahimu atati ŵao katema ali ŵajumi, isima iŵasilile Ŵafilisiti katema paŵajasiche che Ibulahimu. Ŵaipele meena galagala giŵaipele atati ŵao. <verse eid="GEN 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 26:19" />Ŵakutumichila ŵa che Isaka paŵasosile mu chiŵata ŵapatile chisima chana meesi gagakuilima. <verse eid="GEN 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 26:20" />Ŵakuchinga ilango ŵa ku Gelali ni ŵakuchinga ŵa che Isaka ŵatandite kangana achitiji, “Meesi ga gali getu.” Kwayele che Isaka ŵachiŵilasile chisima cho Eseki, malumbo gakwe kukangana, pakuŵa ŵaliji nkukangana ni che Isaka. <verse eid="GEN 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 26:21" />Ŵakutumichila ŵa che Isaka ŵasosile chisima chine, pelepo sooni ŵandu ŵala ŵatandite kangana nawo, kwayele che Isaka ŵachiŵilasile chisima cho Sitina, malumbo gakwe kuŵengana. <verse eid="GEN 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 26:22" />Nipele che Isaka ŵatyosile kweleko ni kwaula kukusola chisima chine. Nambo pa chele chisima cho nganikupagwa kukangana kwakuli kose, kwayele che Isaka ŵachiŵilasile chisima cho Lehobosi achitiji, “Sambano Ambuje atulechele lipesa, noweji tukoonde mu chilambo muno.”<verse eid="GEN 26:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 26:23" />Kutyochela kweleko che Isaka ŵajawile ku Beli Sheba. <verse eid="GEN 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 26:24" />Chilo cha lyuŵa lilyolyo Ambuje Akunnungu ŵankopochele che Isaka ni kunsalila, “Une ndili Akunnungu jwa che Ibulahimu atati ŵenu. Nkajogopa pakuŵa une ndili pamo ni mmwe, chinampe upile ni kuichuluya iŵelesi yenu kwa ligongo lya jwakutumichila jwangu che Ibulahimu.” <verse eid="GEN 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 26:25" />Nipele, che Isaka ŵataŵile chilisa, ni ŵaapopele Ambuje. Ŵaŵisile chigono ni kutama kweleko, ŵakutumichila ŵao ŵasolite sooni chisima chine.<verse eid="GEN 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Isaka ni che Abimeleki akwilana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 26:26" />Che Abimeleki ŵatyosile ku Gelali pamo ni che Ahusati mshauli jwakwe ni che Fikoli jwankulu jwa ŵandu ŵakwe ŵangondo, ni kwajaulila che Isaka. <verse eid="GEN 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 26:27" />Che Isaka ŵausisye, “Kwachichi nnyichenje kukwangu nli nkuumenga ni akuno mwandopwele kukwenu?” <verse eid="GEN 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 26:28" />Nombewo ŵajanjile, “Uwe tuiweni kuti Ambuje ali pamo nomwe. Kwayele, tuganisisye kuti ili yambone chipagwe chilumbilo pasikati jetu ni mmwe ni kutenda lilangano, <verse eid="GEN 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 26:29" />lyakuti mmwejo ngasintutenda chachili chose chakusakala nowe ŵakwe ngatutenda chakusakala kukwenu. Uweji twantendele indu yambone, nombe twakundile kuti ntyoche mu chilambo chetu kwa chitendewele pangantendela yangalumbana yaili yose. Ni sambano mmwe mpatile upile kutyochela kwa Ambuje.” <verse eid="GEN 26:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 26:30" />Nipele che Isaka ŵatesile chindimba cha yakulya, nombewo ŵalile ni kung'wa. <verse eid="GEN 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 26:31" />Malaŵi jakwe ŵajimwiche kundaŵindaŵipe ni kulumbililana ŵana ŵaŵili. Nipele che Isaka ŵapeleche ni kulanganana nawo kwa chitendelewe. <verse eid="GEN 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 26:32" />Lyuŵa lilalila ŵakutumichila ŵa che Isaka ŵaiche ni kwasalila ngani ja chisima chiŵasosile chila, ŵatite, “Tugapatile meesi!” <verse eid="GEN 26:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 26:33" />Pelepe che Isaka ŵachiŵilasile chisima cho Shiba, kwayele musi wauli chisima cho ukuŵilanjikwa Beli Sheba mpaka lelo jino.<verse eid="GEN 26:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Achiŵankwakwe che Esau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 26:34" />Che Esau paŵaliji ni yaka alobaini, ŵalombele achakongwe ŵaŵili ŵa lukosyo lwa Ŵahiti, che Judisi mwali ju che Beeli ni che Basemati mwali ju che Eloni. <verse eid="GEN 26:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 26:35" />Ŵele achakongwe wo ŵaatendekasisye che Isaka ni che Labeka atame mu kusongoneka.<verse eid="GEN 26:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="GEN 27" />
  <para style="s">Che Isaka akumpa upile che Yakubu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 27:1" />Che Isaka ŵachekulwipe ni meeso gao galiji ngagakulola. Nipele ŵammilasile che Esau mwanagwe jwakwitiwo, achitiji, “Mwanangu!” Nombejo ŵajitiche, “Ndili apano atati!” <verse eid="GEN 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 27:2" />Che Isaka ŵatite, “Mpilikane, une sambano njekulwipe, ni ngangulimanyilila lyuŵa lya kuwa kwangu. <verse eid="GEN 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 27:3" />Kwayele, njigale yakumenyanila yenu, yaani ukunje ni mipamba, njaule mwitinji nkaamulajile chinyama. <verse eid="GEN 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 27:4" />Mundelechele une chakulya chakunong'a, achila chinguchinonyela kwannope, muumbe kuti ngombole kumpa upile ngunaŵe kuwa.”<verse eid="GEN 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 27:5" />Che Labeka ŵaliji nkupikana katema che Isaka paŵakungulukaga ni che Esau. Kwayele, che Esau paŵajawile kwitinji kukusakula, <verse eid="GEN 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 27:6" />che Labeka ŵansalile che Yakubu mwanagwe kuti, “Naapikene atati ŵenu ali nkwasalila akulu ŵenu che Esau kuti, <verse eid="GEN 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 27:7" />akaaulajile nyama ni kwatelechela chakulya chakunong'a kuti alye ni pakumala kulya akombole kwapa upile paujo pa Ambuje akanaŵe kuwa. <verse eid="GEN 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 27:8" />Sambano mwanangu, Mumbilikanichisye ni kunyitichisya ichinansalile. <verse eid="GEN 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 27:9" />Njaule kuili ilango nkanyigalile tundeembe twambusi tuŵili twakwimbala, kuti naatelechele atati ŵenu chakulya chakunong'a chaakuchinonyela. <verse eid="GEN 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 27:10" />Nipele chimwapelechele atati ŵenu akalye, akombole kumpa upile akanaŵe kuwa.”<verse eid="GEN 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 27:11" />Nambo che Yakubu ŵansalile achikulugwe, “Nkumbuchile kuti che Esau akulu ŵangu akwete malaika gamajinji pa chiilu pakwe nambo une nganingola. <verse eid="GEN 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 27:12" />Panepa atati ŵangu chaakasache kuumbapasya, ngati chamanyilile kuti ngwalambusya, kwayele, chakambe une malweso pamalo pa kuumba upile.” <verse eid="GEN 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 27:13" />Achikulugwe ŵansalile, “Malweso genu gambate une, mmwe ntendekanye ingunsalila yi. Njaule nkanyigalile tumbusi to.”<verse eid="GEN 27:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 27:14" />Nipele che Yakubu ŵajawile, ŵatujigele tundembe twambusi tuŵili tula ni kwapelechela achikulugwe. Nombe achikulugwe ŵala ŵachiteleche chakulya chakunong'a chakuchinonyela che Isaka atatigwe cha Yakubu. <verse eid="GEN 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 27:15" />Che Labeka ŵajigele yakuwala yambone ya che Esau, mwanagwe jwankulungwa iyaliji mu nyuumba ni kwawasya che Yakubu, mpwakwe. <verse eid="GEN 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 27:16" />Ŵammwasisye sooni mapende ga tundembe twambusi tula, mmakono ni pa lukosi pakwe. <verse eid="GEN 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 27:17" />Nipele ŵampele che Yakubu chakulya chakunong'a chiŵachiteleche chila ni nkate kuti akaapelechele atatigwe.<verse eid="GEN 27:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 27:18" />Che Yakubu ni ŵapite kuŵaliji atatigwe, ni ŵaaŵilasile, “Atati!” Nombewo ŵajitiche, “Naamu! Ana ŵaani mmwe? Ana mwanangu?” <verse eid="GEN 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 27:19" />Che Yakubu ŵajanjile, “Ndili une che Esau, mwanagwenu jwankulungwa. Ndesile mpela intite pakuusalila. Choonde atati ntaame ni kulya nyama jinajawile kukusakula kuti nkombole kuumba upile.” <verse eid="GEN 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 27:20" />Nambo che Isaka ŵammusisye mwanagwe jo, “Mwanangu, ikomboleche uli kuti njipatile nyama mwakwanguya?” Che Yakubu ŵajanjile, “Ligongo Ambuje Akunnungu ŵenu angamuchisye najipate mwakwanguya.”<verse eid="GEN 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 27:21" />Nipele che Isaka ŵansalile che Yakubu, “Mmandichile apano mwanangu nampapasye kuti manyilile naga kusyene mmwe nli mwanangu che Esau.” <verse eid="GEN 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 27:22" />Che Yakubu ŵajawile chiŵandika ni che Isaka atatigwe, nombewo ŵampapesye ni kuti, “Liloŵe lyenu likupikanika mpela lya che Yakubu nambo makono genu gali mpela che Esau.” <verse eid="GEN 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 27:23" />Nganiŵamanyilila kuti ŵaliji che Yakubu, ligongo makono gakwe galiji ni manyunya gamajinji mpela che Esau nkulugwe. Kwayele, ŵampele upile che Yakubu. <verse eid="GEN 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 27:24" />Nambo ŵammusisye sooni, “Ana isyene mmwejo nli mwanangu che Esau?” Nombejo ŵajanjile, “Elo, ndili une che Esau.” <verse eid="GEN 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 27:25" />Atati ŵao ŵatite, “Mumbelechele nyama jo kuti ndye, nipele chinampe upile mwanangu.” Pelepo che Yakubu ŵapeleche chakulya, nombewo ŵalile. Ŵaapelechele ni divai, ŵang'wele. <verse eid="GEN 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 27:26" />Nipele che Isaka atatigwe, ŵatite, “Mumandichile mwanangu kuti mungumbatile.” <verse eid="GEN 27:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 27:27" />Kwayele, che Yakubu ŵammandichile atatigwe kuti ŵaakumbatile, ni atatigwe paŵakupikene kununjila kwa yakuwala yakwe, ŵampele upile achitiji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:27">“Nnole, kununjila kwambone kwa mwanangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:27">kuli mpela kununjila kwa ngunda wati Ambuje Akunnungu aupele upile!<verse eid="GEN 27:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 27:28" />Akunnungu antuluchisye ula kutyochela kwinani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:28">ampe ngunda waukwete chajila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:28">ni yakulya ni divai kwa winji.<verse eid="GEN 27:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 27:29" />Ŵandu ŵa ilambo yose antumichileje mmwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:29">ni ŵandu ŵa ngosyo sine antindiŵalileje kwa luchimbichimbi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:29">Mmwejo mme chilongola jwa achalongo ŵenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:29">ŵanache ŵa chilume ŵa achikulu ŵenu antindiŵalileje kwa luchimbichimbi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:29">Alweseche ŵandu wose ŵakunlwesya mmwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:29">Akole upile ŵandu wose uchampe mmwe upile!”<verse eid="GEN 27:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Esau akuŵenda upile ku che Isaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 27:30" />Che Isaka paŵamasile kwapa upile che Yakubu ni che Yakubu natyoka pe paŵaliji atatigwe, che Esau nkulugwe che Yakubu ŵausile kutyochela kwitinji akula kuŵaliji nkusakula. <verse eid="GEN 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 27:31" />Che Esau nombe ŵateleche chakulya chakunong'a, ŵampelechele atatigwe achitiji, “Atati ŵangu, choonde ntame ni kulya nyama jinajawile kukusakula une mwanagwenu, kuti nkombole kuumba upile!” <verse eid="GEN 27:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 27:32" />Che Isaka ŵausisye, “Ana mmwejo ŵaani?” Nombe che Esau ŵajanjile, “Ndili une mwanagwenu jwankulungwa che Esau.” <verse eid="GEN 27:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 27:33" />Pelepo che Isaka ŵatetemele nnope, ni ŵatite, “Ana nduni jwejula juŵapite kukusakula ni kwikanajo nyama none lile nkanaŵe kuuja? Sooni masile kumpa upile jwelejo; elo, nombejo amasile kupegwa upile!”<verse eid="GEN 27:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 27:34" />Che Esau paŵagapikene maloŵe ga atatigwe, ŵalisile kwannope mwakupetesya ntima. Nipele ŵansalile atatigwe, “Choonde atati ŵangu, mumbe upile none jwakwe!” <verse eid="GEN 27:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 27:35" />Nambo che Isaka ŵatite, “Mpwenu ŵaiche ni kuunambusya, ŵelewo ni ŵajigele upile wenu.” <verse eid="GEN 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 27:36" />Che Esau ŵatite, “Lyeleli lili ligongo akuŵilanjikwa che Yakubu! Anyenjile une kaŵili. Kaandanda ŵaasumwile ukulungwa wangu wa kupagwa, ni sambano aujigele upile wangu.” Nipele ŵausisye atatigwe, “Ana atati nganimusigachisya upile wauliwose?” <verse eid="GEN 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 27:37" />Che Isaka ŵajanjile, “Masile kwatenda che Yakubu kuŵa chilongola jwenu, ni kwapa achapwenu wose kuŵa ŵakutumichila ŵakwe. Naapele yakulya ni divai. Ana sambano nantendele ichichi mmwejo mwanangu?” <verse eid="GEN 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 27:38" />Che Esau ŵammusisye atatigwe, “Ana atati, nkwete upile umo pe? Choonde atati mumbe upile noneji jwakwe!” Pelepo che Esau ŵatandite kulila kwa liloŵe lyekulungwa. <verse eid="GEN 27:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 27:39" />Nipele che Isaka, ŵansalile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:39">“Chintame pamalo pangali chajila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:39">ni ula ngajinya kutyochela kwinani.<verse eid="GEN 27:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 27:40" />Timme mundu jwakuputana ngondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:40">ni chinchiŵa jwakutumichila jwa mpwenu;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:40">nambo pachinkane kwitichisya malajisyo gakwe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 27:40">chinchityoka paasi pa ulamusi wa mpwenu jo.”<verse eid="GEN 27:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 27:41" />Pelepo, che Esau ŵatandite kunchima mpwakwe jo kwaligongo lya upile uwaliji apegwile ni atatigwe. Che Esau ŵaganisisye mu ntima, “Pachigamale matanga ga atati, ni pachinaulaje mpwangu che Yakubu.” <verse eid="GEN 27:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 27:42" />Nambo che Labeka paŵaumanyi nningwa wa mwanagwe jwankulungwa jo, nipele ŵammilasile che Yakubu, mwanagwe jwannondi, ŵansalile, “Nlilolechesye, che Esau nkulugwenu akuganisya ichajile pakummulaga mmwejo. <verse eid="GEN 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 27:43" />Kwayele, mwanangu, ngapikanile maloŵe gangu. Ntyoche, mmutuchile ku Halani kwa achimwene che Labani. <verse eid="GEN 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 27:44" />Nkatame kweleko kwa moŵa gampepe, mpaka kutumbila kwa nkulugwenu jo pachikumale. <verse eid="GEN 27:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 27:45" />Lutumbilo lwakwe pachilumale, nombe pachamale kunlechelela, chinanlajisye mundu aiche kukunjigala. Ligongo chi njasiche wose ŵaŵili kwa lyuŵa limo?”<verse eid="GEN 27:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Isaka akunjausya che Yakubu ku che Labani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 27:46" />Che Labeka ŵansalile che Isaka, “Achakongwe ŵa Chihiti ŵa che Esau ŵa, aandesile me jwasongoneka mu utame wangu. Naga che Yakubu chalombele jumo mwa achakongwe ŵa Chihiti ŵa, mmbaya mwe.”<verse eid="GEN 27:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="GEN 28" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 28:1" />Kwayele che Isaka ŵammilasile che Yakubu, ŵampele upile ni kwalajisya achitiji, “Nkalombela jwankongwe jwa ku Kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 28:2" />Njaule ku Padani Alamu, ku che Besueli ambuje ŵenu, nkalombele jumo jwa achiŵali ŵa che Labani, achimwene jwa achikulu ŵenu. <verse eid="GEN 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 28:3" />Akunnungu ŵakwete ukombole ampe upile nkole uŵelesi wejinji, kuti mme atati ŵa ŵandu ŵa ilambo yejinji. <verse eid="GEN 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 28:4" />Ampe upile mmwejo pamo ni iŵelesi yenu mpela yatite kwapa upile che Ibulahimu, kuti chilambo chinkutama chino nti jwanlendo chiŵe chenu; chilambo chiŵapegwile che Ibulahimu ni Akunnungu!” <verse eid="GEN 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 28:5" />Nipele, che Isaka ŵantumile che Yakubu, nombewo ŵajawile ku Padani Alamu ku che Labani, mwanache ju che Besueli mualamu, achimwene jwa che Labeka, achikulugwe che Yakubu ni che Esau.<verse eid="GEN 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Esau akulombela mwali ju che Ishumaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 28:6" />Che Esau ŵaimanyilile kuti che Isaka ŵampele upile che Yakubu ni kwasalila kuti ajaule ku Padani Alamu kukulombela, ni yakuti paŵampele upile ŵankanyisye kuti akalombela jwankongwe jwa ku Kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 28:7" />Sooni ŵaimanyilile kuti che Yakubu ŵajitichisye atatigwe pamo ni achikulugwe, nipele ŵajawile ku Padani Alamu. <verse eid="GEN 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 28:8" />Nipele, che Esau ŵaimanyilile kuti atatigwe ŵaachimile achakongwe ŵa ku Kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 28:9" />Kwayele, pamo ni achakongwe ŵane ŵala, che Esau ŵajawile ku che Ishumaeli, mwanache ju che Ibulahimu, ni kulombela mwali ju che Ishumaeli liina lyakwe che Mahalati, nlumbugwe che Nebayoti.<verse eid="GEN 28:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sagamisi ji che Yakubu ku Beseli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 28:10" />Che Yakubu ŵatyosile ku Beli Sheba, ni kwaula ku Halani. <verse eid="GEN 28:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 28:11" />Paŵaiche pamalo pampepe, ŵaganisisye yakugona pelepo pakuŵa kwaliji kuswele. Paŵagonaga ŵajigele liganga ŵaliŵisile pantwe kutenda msamilo. <verse eid="GEN 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 28:12" />Ŵasagamile ali nkujiwona ngazi jikutyochela palisi mpaka kwinani. Achikatumetume ŵa kwinani ali nkukwela ni kutuluka pa ngazi pala. <verse eid="GEN 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 28:13" />Ambuje ŵaliji ajimi pachanya ngazi jila, ŵansalile, “Une ndili Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵa che Ibulahimu atati ŵenu, ni Akunnungu ŵa che Isaka. Chilambo chingonile chi chinampe mmwejo pamo ni iŵelesi yenu. <verse eid="GEN 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 28:14" />Iŵelesi yenu chiiŵe yejinji mpela luundu lwa pachilambo ni chiijenele posepose kutandilila kulikuswela lyuŵa mpaka kulikukopochela lyuŵa ni kumpoto mpaka kulujenda. Kwa litala lyenu pamo ni iŵelesi yenu, ŵandu wose ŵa pachilambo chakole upile. <verse eid="GEN 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 28:15" />Uneji ndili pamo ni mmwejo, chinanlindile kuchinjaule kose ni kummusya mu chilambo chino. Ngangunneka mpaka pachichimalile chilanga changu chinampele.”<verse eid="GEN 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 28:16" />Papopo che Yakubu ŵajimwiche kutyochela mu lugono, ŵatite, “Isyene Ambuje ali pelepa, une nganimanyililaga!” <verse eid="GEN 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 28:17" />Nipele, ŵajogwepe ni ŵatite, “Pelepa pakutesya woga nnope! Isyene apano pali nyuumba ja Akunnungu ni nnango wakwinjilila kwinani.”<verse eid="GEN 28:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 28:18" />Che Yakubu ŵajimwiche kundaŵipe, ŵajigele liganga liŵatesile nsamilo lila, ni ŵalijimiche kuti liŵe liganga lya chikumbuchisyo. Nipele, ŵalitasile mauta liganga lyo. <verse eid="GEN 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 28:19" />Nipele, che Yakubu ŵapaŵilasile pelepo Beseli, nachiŵamuno liina lya wele musi lyaliji Lusi. <verse eid="GEN 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 28:20" />Kwayele che Yakubu ŵaŵisile nasili achitiji, “Mmwejo Akunnungu ŵangu, naga chimme pamo ni une ni kuulinda pa ulendo wangu, ni sooni kuumba chakulya ni yakuwala, <verse eid="GEN 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 28:21" />kuti mujile kwa atati ŵangu kwa chitendewele, nipele, mmwe Ambuje Akunnungu, chinchiŵa Akunnungu ŵangu. <verse eid="GEN 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 28:22" />Liganga lya chikumbuchisyo linyimiche apano li, chipaŵe malo gakumpopelela mmwe Akunnungu, ni une chinjimpa mmwejo liunji limo lya likumi lya indu yose ichimumbe.”<verse eid="GEN 28:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="GEN 29" />
  <para style="s">Che Yakubu akwika ku che Labani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 29:1" />Che Yakubu ŵajendelechele ni ulendo wakwe, nipele ŵaiche ku chilambo cha ŵandu ŵa kungopochelo lyuŵa. <verse eid="GEN 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 29:2" />Kwele ŵachiweni chisima chichaliji mungunda, mumbali mwakwe ŵajiweni mipingo jitatu ja ngondolo sili sipumulile. Ngondolo syo syaliji nkung'wa meesi kutyochela pachisima cho chichaliji cheunichikwe liganga lyekulungwa. <verse eid="GEN 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 29:3" />Katema mipingo jose ja ngondolo pajikusongangana, ŵakuchinga ngondolo kwapamo ŵaligalambulaga liganga liŵaliunichile pa chisima ni kuteka meesi ni kusing'wesya ngondolo. Nipele, ŵachiunichile sooni chisima ni lyele liganga.<verse eid="GEN 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 29:4" />Che Yakubu ŵaausisye ŵakuchinga ŵala, “Ana achalongo achinjangu, kumangwenu kwapi?” Ŵanjanjile, “Uwe kumangwetu ku Halani.” <verse eid="GEN 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 29:5" />Nombejo ŵaausisye sooni, “Uli, nkwamanyilila che Labani mwanagwao che Naholi?” Ŵanjanjile, “Elo tukwamanyilila.” <verse eid="GEN 29:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 29:6" />Ŵapundile kwausya achitiji, “Ana ali uli ŵele mwanjawo?” Nombewo ŵanjanjile, “Ŵele mwanjawo ali uchenene. Nnole, che Laheli mwaligwe akwika ni ngondolo syakwe!” <verse eid="GEN 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 29:7" />Pelepo che Yakubu ŵaasalile, “Au uli muusi wantundu ni katema ka kusisonganganya ngondolo pamo kakanaŵe kwika. Kwayele, ngambe kusing'wesya meesi ni kuuja kukusilisya sooni.” <verse eid="GEN 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 29:8" />Nambo ŵansalile che Yakubu, “Ngatukukombola kutenda yele mpaka mipingo jose ja ngondolo sisongangane pamo, ni kuligalambula liganga kutyochela pachisima, nipele pachitukombole kuteka meesi ni kusing'wesya.”<verse eid="GEN 29:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 29:9" />Katema che Yakubu ali chiŵela nkuŵecheta ni ŵakuchinga ŵala, che Laheli ŵaiche pachisima pala ni ngondolo siŵachingaga sya atatigwe. <verse eid="GEN 29:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 29:10" />Che Yakubu paŵammweni che Laheli, mwali ju che Labani, achimwene ŵa achikulugwe, ni paŵasiweni ngondolo sya che Labani njombagwe, ŵajawile kukuligalambula liganga liŵaliunichile pachisima pala, ni kuung'wesya meesi mpingo wa ngondolo wa che Labani. <verse eid="GEN 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 29:11" />Nipele che Yakubu ŵankumbete che Laheli ni kutanda kulila. <verse eid="GEN 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 29:12" />Che Yakubu ŵansalile che Laheli, “Une ndili nlongo njawo atati ŵenu. Une ndili mwanagwao che Labeka. Che Laheli ŵautwiche kuuja kukwasalila atatigwe.”<verse eid="GEN 29:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 29:13" />Che Labani paŵapikene ngani si che Yakubu, mwanache jwa alumbugwe, ŵautwiche kukwachingamila, ŵankumbete ni kwakomasya kwaunonyelo, ni kwajigala ku nyuumba jao. Nipele, che Yakubu ŵansalile che Labani indu yose iyatendekwe. <verse eid="GEN 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 29:14" />Nombe che Labani ŵatite, “Isyene, mmwejo nli nlongo njangu wa miasi!” Che Yakubu ŵatemi kweleko mwesi umo.<verse eid="GEN 29:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yakubu akulombela achiŵali ŵa che Labani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 29:15" />Lyuŵa limo che Labani ŵansalile che Yakubu, “Mmwe nli nlongo njangu, nambo ngaŵa chindu chambone kuti mpanganye masengo kwangune pangali malipilo. Muusalile malipilo genu chigaŵe chichi!” <verse eid="GEN 29:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 29:16" />Che Labani ŵakwete achiŵali ŵaŵili. Jwankulugwa ŵaŵilanjikwe che Lea, ni jwannondi ŵaŵilanjikwe che Laheli. <verse eid="GEN 29:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 29:17" />Che Lea ŵakwete meeso gakulembula ganganonyelesya, nambo che Laheli ŵaliji ŵakutindigala ni kusalala nnope. <verse eid="GEN 29:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 29:18" />Che Yakubu ŵannonyele che Laheli, kwayele ŵansalile che Labani, “Chinantumichile yaka saba kuti muumbe che Laheli mwanagwenu jwannondi nombele.” <verse eid="GEN 29:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 29:19" />Che Labani ŵatite, “Mmbaya kuti une nampe mmwejo che Laheli aŵe ŵankwenu kupunda kwapa mundu jwine. Njendelechele kutama ni une apano.” <verse eid="GEN 29:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 29:20" />Nipele che Yakubu ŵantumichile che Labani kwa yaka saba kwaligongo lya che Laheli, nambo che Yakubu ŵaiweni yaka saba mpela moŵa kanandipe ligongo ŵannonyele nnope che Laheli.<verse eid="GEN 29:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 29:21" />Nipele, che Yakubu ŵaasalile che Labani, Mumbeje ŵankwangu, pakuŵa ndaŵi jitwalangene jimalile. <verse eid="GEN 29:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 29:22" />Che Labani ŵalinganyisye chindimba cha ulombela ni kwalalika ŵandu ŵakweleko. <verse eid="GEN 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 29:23" />Nambo chilo, che Labani ŵanjigele che Lea mwali jwakwe jwankulungwa ni kunjausya ku che Yakubu. Che Yakubu ŵagonile nawo. <verse eid="GEN 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 29:24" />Che Labani ŵampeleche che Silipa jwakutumichila jwakwe jwankongwe kuti aŵe jwakutumichila jwa che Lea. <verse eid="GEN 29:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 29:25" />Pakwachele, che Yakubu ŵaiweni kuti jwankongwe jo ŵaliji che Lea. Nipele che Yakubu ŵammusisye che Labani, “Kwachichi mundesile yeleyi? Ana nganinantumichila kwaligongo li che Laheli? Kwachichi munambwisye?”<verse eid="GEN 29:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 29:26" />Che Labani ŵajanjile “Mu chilambo mwetu ngatukupanganya yeleyo, kunlombekasya jwannondi jwankulungwa akanalombelwe. <verse eid="GEN 29:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 29:27" />Mmalisye kaje moŵa saba ga chindimba cha ulombela wa mwali ju, ni uweji chitumpe che Laheli jo, nambo chimumbanganyichisye masengo kwa yaka saba ine.”<verse eid="GEN 29:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 29:28" />Che Yakubu ŵakundile, ni paŵamalisisye moŵa saba ga chindimba cha ulombela wa che Lea, che Labani ŵampeleche che Laheli ku che Yakubu kuti aŵe ŵankwakwe. <verse eid="GEN 29:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 29:29" />Che Labani ŵampeleche che Biliha jwamasengo jwakwe jwankongwe ku che Laheli kuti antumichile. <verse eid="GEN 29:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 29:30" />Kwapele, che Yakubu ŵagonile ni che Laheli, nipele ŵannonyele nnope kumpunda che Lea. Che Yakobo ŵantumichile che Labani kwa yaka saba ine.<verse eid="GEN 29:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wanache ŵa che Yakubu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 29:31" />Ambuje Akunnungu paŵaiweni kuti che Yakubu ngakunnonyela che Lea kwannope, ŵampele che Lea jo ŵanache, nambo che Laheli ŵaliji ngaakuŵeleka. <verse eid="GEN 29:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 29:32" />Che Lea ŵakwete chitumbo, ŵaligopwele mwanache jwannume, ŵammilasile Lubeni achitiji, “Ambuje Akunnungu aiweni ipwetesi yangu, panepa ŵankwangu tachiinonyela.” <verse eid="GEN 29:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 29:33" />Che Lea ŵakwete sooni chitumbo, ŵaligopwele mwanache jwannume, ŵammilasile Simoni achitiji, “Pakuŵa Ambuje Akunnungu apilikene kuti ŵankwangu ngakunonyela une, ambele mwanache ju nombe.” <verse eid="GEN 29:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 29:34" />Ŵakwete chitumbo chine, ŵaŵeleche mwanache jwannume jwine ŵammilasile Lawi. Ni ŵatite, “Sambano ŵankwangu talumbikane ni une pakuŵa naŵelechele ŵanache ŵachilume ŵatatu.” <verse eid="GEN 29:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 29:35" />Ŵakwete chitumbo chine, ŵaŵeleche sooni mwanache jwannume ŵammilasile Yuda. Ni ŵatite, “Sambano tinaalape Ambuje.” Pelepo ŵalesile kaje kuŵeleka.<verse eid="GEN 29:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="GEN 30" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 30:1" />Che Laheli paŵaiweni kuti nganammelechela che Yakubu ŵanache, ŵankolele wiu che Lea nlumbugwe jula, nipele ŵansalile che Yakubu, “Mumbe ŵanache, iŵaga ngankumba, une chimwe.” <verse eid="GEN 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 30:2" />Che Yakubu ŵantumbilile che Laheli kwannope ni kunsalila, “Ana une mele pamalo pa Akunnungu jwanlekasisye kuŵeleka?” <verse eid="GEN 30:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 30:3" />Che Laheli ŵatite, “Munjigale che Biliha jwakutumichila jwangu. Ngoneje nawo kuti aŵelechele mwanache pamalo pangu, ni kwanti yele none ngombole kuŵa amao kwakupitila kwa ŵelewo.” <verse eid="GEN 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 30:4" />Kwapele che Laheli ŵampeleche che Biliha kwa che Yakubu ŵankwakwe kuti agone nawo. <verse eid="GEN 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 30:5" />Nombe che Biliha ŵakwete chitumbo, ni ŵammelechele che Yakubu mwanache jwannume. <verse eid="GEN 30:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 30:6" />Che Laheli ŵatite, “Akunnungu ambanganyichisye mwambone, apilikene kulila kwangu ni kumba mwanache jwannume.” Mwanache jo ŵammilasile Dani. <verse eid="GEN 30:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 30:7" />Che Biliha jwakutumichila ju che Laheli ŵakwete sooni chitumbo, ni ŵammelechele che Yakubu mwanache jwannume jwaaŵili. <verse eid="GEN 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 30:8" />Pelepo che Laheli ŵatite, “Limbene nawo kwannope nlumbwangu, none mbundile.” Kwayele ŵammilasile mwanache jo Nafutali.<verse eid="GEN 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 30:9" />Che Lea ali aiweni kuti alesile kuŵeleka, ŵanjigele che Silipa jwakutumichila jwakwe, ŵampeleche ku che Yakubu kuti nombewo aŵeje ŵankwakwe. <verse eid="GEN 30:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 30:10" />Che Silipa ŵammelechele che Yakubu mwanache jwannume. <verse eid="GEN 30:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 30:11" />Che Lea ni ŵatite, “Ngwete bahati.” Kwayele mwanache jo ŵammilasile Gadi. <verse eid="GEN 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 30:12" />Che Silipa jwakutumichila ju che Lea ŵammelechele che Yakubu mwanache jwannume jwaaŵili. <verse eid="GEN 30:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 30:13" />Che Lea ŵatite, “Sengwile nnope, sambano achakongwe wose chamilanje une sangalala.” Kwayele mwanache jula ŵammilasile Asheli.<verse eid="GEN 30:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 30:14" />Katema ka magungulo ga ngano, Lubeni ŵapite kumigunda ni kweleko ŵapatile mbatata syamwitinji, ŵaichenawo ku che Lea achikulugwe. Che Laheli ŵansalile che Lea “Choonde mung'aŵile kanondi mbatata jo janjigalile mwanagwenu.” <verse eid="GEN 30:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 30:15" />Nambo che Lea ŵanjanjile kuti, “Ana nginikwana kuusumula ŵankwangu? Ni sooni nkusaka musumule mbatata janyigalile mwanangu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 30:15">Che Laheli ŵansalile, “Iŵaga chimung'aŵile mbatata ya mwitinji ya mwanagwenu, che Yakubu tagone kumangwenu chilo chino.”<verse eid="GEN 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 30:16" />Che Yakubu paŵaujaga kutyochela kumigunda ligulo, che Lea ŵajile kukwachingamila, ni ŵaasalile, “Lelo ngoneje mu nyuumba jangu pakuŵa naalipile che Laheli kwa ligongo lyenu mbatata ja mwitinji janyigalile mwanangu.” Kwapele che Yakubu ŵagonile ni che Lea chilo cho. <verse eid="GEN 30:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 30:17" />Akunnungu ŵapilikene mapopelo ga che Lea, ni che Lea ŵakwete chitumbo, ni ŵammelechele che Yakubu mwanache jwa nsano jwachilume. <verse eid="GEN 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 30:18" />Che Lea ŵatite, “Akunnungu andipile pakuŵa nampeleche jwakutumichila jwangu kwa ŵankwangu.” Kwayele mwanache jo ŵampele liina lyakwe Isakali. <verse eid="GEN 30:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 30:19" />Che Lea ŵakwete chitumbo chiine, ŵammelechele che Yakubu mwanache jwa sita jwachilume. <verse eid="GEN 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 30:20" />Ŵatite, “Akunnungu ambele ntuuka wakusalala. Sambano ŵankwangu chanjimbichisye pakuŵa naaŵelechele ŵanache ŵachilume sita.” Mwanache jo ŵampele liina lyakwe Sabuloni. <verse eid="GEN 30:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 30:21" />Kanyuma ŵaŵeleche mwanache jwankongwe, ŵampele liina lyakwe Dina.<verse eid="GEN 30:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 30:22" />Nipele, Akunnungu ŵankumbuchile che Laheli, ŵapilikene mapopelo gakwe ni ŵantesile aŵeleche ŵanache. <verse eid="GEN 30:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 30:23" />Che Laheli ŵakwete chitumbo, ŵaŵeleche mwanache jwannume ni ŵatite, “Akunnungu andyosisye soni syangu.” <verse eid="GEN 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 30:24" />Mwanache jo ŵampele liina lyakwe Yusufu achitiji, “Ambuje Akunnungu ambe mwanache jwine jannume.”<verse eid="GEN 30:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yakubu akusichila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 30:25" />Che Laheli paŵaaŵeleche Yusufu, che Yakubu ŵaasalile che Labani, “Mungunde nyaule kumangwetu, mu chilambo changu. <verse eid="GEN 30:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 30:26" />Mumbe achiŵankwangu ni achiŵanangu ŵanapatile pakuntumichila mmwe, nyauleje pakuŵa mmwejo nkumanyilila kuti nantumichile uchenene.”<verse eid="GEN 30:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 30:27" />Nambo che Labani ŵansalile che Yakubu, “Iŵaga mungundile, choonde nkatyoka. Naimanyi kwa chisango kuti, Ambuje ambele upile une ligongo lya mmwejo. <verse eid="GEN 30:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 30:28" />Musalile malipilo gankugasaka none tinampe.” <verse eid="GEN 30:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 30:29" />Che Yakubu ŵansalile che Labani, “Mmwejo mwasyene nkumanyilila indite pakuntumichila ni indite pakuigosa ilango yenu. <verse eid="GEN 30:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 30:30" />Pakuŵa ngunaŵe kwika mwakwete ipanje kanandi, nambo sambano itupile nnope, ni Ambuje ŵapapele upile palipose pambite. Sambano ana chakachi chinjenjeuchile ya mu nyuumba jangu nansyene?”<verse eid="GEN 30:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 30:31" />Che Labani ŵammusisye, “Ana nampe ichichi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 30:31">Che Yakubu ŵajanjile, “Une ngangusaka malipilo galigose. Nambo tinyendelechele kulanga ilango yenu iŵaga chinjitichisye ingusala yi. <verse eid="GEN 30:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 30:32" />Lelo angunde kuti nyaule pasikati pa ilango yenu yose, ngasagule ngondolo jajili ni maŵalamaŵala pane madomedome ni kila ngondolo jepiliu ni kila mbusi jajili ni maŵalamaŵala pane madomedome. Gelego ni chigaŵe malipilo gangu. <verse eid="GEN 30:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 30:33" />Pa moŵa gagakwika, chinkuone kukulupilichika kwangu pangasisika, pachinnyiche kukulola malipilo gamumbele. Iŵaga chalole kuti ngwete mbusi jilijose jangali madomedome pane maŵalamaŵala ni ngondolo jilijose jangaŵa jepiliu chamanyilile kuti jele mbusi jo pane ngondolo jo jili jakwiŵa.”<verse eid="GEN 30:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 30:34" />Che Labani ŵatite, “Mwambone! Itendekwe mpela intite kuŵecheta.” <verse eid="GEN 30:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 30:35" />Nambo pa lyuŵa lilyolyo che Labani ŵatyosisye tonde syose sya maŵalamaŵala pane madomedome. Watyosisye sooni mbusi syose syasikongwe sya maŵalamaŵala pane madomedome, ni jilijose jijakwete liŵala lyeswela pachiilu pakwe, sooni ngondolo syepiliu syose, ŵasipeleche kwa achiŵanagwe kuti asiloleje. <verse eid="GEN 30:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 30:36" />Che Labani ŵalekangene ni che Yakubu, ŵajesile lwendo lwa moŵa gatatu, ni che Yakubu ŵasigalile achilolesyaga ilango isigalile.<verse eid="GEN 30:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 30:37" />Che Yakubu ŵajigele fito syasiŵisi sya itela yaikuŵilankikwa mlubina ni mlozi ni mwalamoni, ŵagwagwile kuti maŵalamaŵala gawoneche mu fito syo. <verse eid="GEN 30:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 30:38" />Ŵasijimiche fito syo paujo pa ilango pamalo gaakung'welela meesi kuti ilango yo iloleje pakung'wa meesi. Ni pakuŵa ilango yo payaikaga kug'wa meesi ni katema payaliji nkumemesya, <verse eid="GEN 30:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 30:39" />ŵatendaga yeleyo paujo pa syele fito syo ni inyama yajigele itumbo, yaŵeleche inyama ya maŵalamaŵala pane madomedome. <verse eid="GEN 30:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 30:40" />Ngondolo sine syati che Yakubu ŵasilangaga si che Labani syaliji ni maŵalamaŵala ni sine madomedome. Aŵala ŵane paŵaliji mu katema ka kumemesya ŵatesile asilole asila syasili mi maŵalamaŵala ni madomedome. Kwa litala lyo, che Yakubu ŵapatile ngondolo syakwe nsyene, nganasiwanganya ni mpingo wa inyama ya che Labani. <verse eid="GEN 30:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 30:41" />Katema inyama yaili ni machili payamemesyaga, che Yakubu ŵajimikaga fito syo pakungw'esyesya meesi inyama, kuti ikole itumbo pa fito syo. <verse eid="GEN 30:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 30:42" />Nambo inyama yangali machili payamemesyaga nganaŵika fito paujo pao. Kwayele, inyama yangali machili yaliji ya che Labani, ni yaikwete machili yaliji ya che Yakubu. <verse eid="GEN 30:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 30:43" />Nipele, che Yakubu ŵaliji ŵakusichila nnope, nombe ŵakwete mipingo jajikulungwa ja ngondolo ni mbusi ni ngamia ni mbunda, iyoyo ŵaliji ni ŵakutumichila achakongwe ni achalume.<verse eid="GEN 30:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="GEN 31" />
  <para style="s">Che Yakubu akwatila che Labani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 31:1" />Nipele, ŵandu ŵasasile kuti ŵanache achalume ŵa che Labani ŵaliji nkudandaula ni kuti, “Che Yakubu ajigele indu yose ya atati ŵetu, yele ni yatite kuŵa ŵakusichila.” <verse eid="GEN 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 31:2" />Che Yakubu ŵaimanyi kuti che Labani ngaakundendela mpela iŵandendelaga kuundanda. <verse eid="GEN 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 31:3" />Nipele, Ambuje Akunnungu ŵansalile che Yakubu, “Mmujile ku chilambo cha achachekulu ŵenu ni kwa achalongo ŵenu, none chilongane pamo ni mmwe.”<verse eid="GEN 31:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 31:4" />Kwayele che Yakubu ŵaalajisye ŵandu kuti akaŵilanje che Laheli ni che Lea, nombewo ŵajaulile kwikonde kuŵaliji alinkuchinga inyama. <verse eid="GEN 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 31:5" />Che Yakubu ŵaasalile, “Nguwona atati ŵenu ngakundendela sooni mpela iŵandendelaga kuundanda. Nambo Akunnungu ŵa atati ŵangu ali pamo ni une. <verse eid="GEN 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 31:6" />Ngati nkumanyilila kuti naatumichile atati ŵenu ni machili gangu gose. <verse eid="GEN 31:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 31:7" />Nambo aanambwisye une ni kugagalausya malipilo gangu kakumi. Nambo Akunnungu nganaŵalechela atati ŵenu andendele une chindu changalumbana. <verse eid="GEN 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 31:8" />Katema kose atati ŵenu paŵatite, ‘Inyama ya madomedome ni ichiiŵe malipilo genu,’ nipele mpingo wose waŵeleche ŵanache ŵakwete madomedome. Sooni paŵatite, ‘Inyama ya maŵalamaŵala ni ichiiŵe malipilo genu,’ nipele mpingo wose waŵeleche ŵanache ŵakwete maŵalamaŵala. <verse eid="GEN 31:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 31:9" />Yele Akunnungu ni yatite kuijigala inyama ya atati ŵenu ni kuumba une.<verse eid="GEN 31:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 31:10" />“Katema ka inyama kuŵelekana nasagamile sagamisi, mu jele sagamisi jo, najiweni mikambaku jose ja mbusi jijaliji nkukwela jaliji ni maŵalamaŵala, ni madomedome, ni misitalimisitali. <verse eid="GEN 31:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 31:11" />Katumetume jwa kwinani jwa Akunnungu ŵakungulwiche ni une musagamisi, ŵamilasile une, ‘Che Yakubu,’ ni une najitiche, ‘Ndili apano!’ <verse eid="GEN 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 31:12" />Nombewo ŵatite, ‘Nnole, mikambaku jose jajikukwela jikwete maŵalamaŵala, ni madomedome, ni misitalimisitali. Une ni jundesile yeleyi ligongo lolite yantesile che Labani. <verse eid="GEN 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 31:13" />Une ni ŵeŵala Akunnungu juŵankopochele ku Beseli kula, pamalo pumwaliŵisile liganga liŵe chikumbuchisyo ni kulijitila mauta ni kuŵika nasili. Sambano ntyoche mu chilambo chino njaule kumangwenu mu chilambo chimpagwilwe.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 31:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 31:14" />Che Laheli ni che Lea ŵanjanjile che Yakubu, “Uweji nganitukola sooni chipanje chachili chose chachisigele kutyochela kwa atati ŵetu chati chichiŵe chetu! <verse eid="GEN 31:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 31:15" />Sooni atati ŵetu ŵa akutuwona mpela achalendo, pakuŵa amasile kutusumisya, ni mbiya silasila syapatile kwa kutusumisya uwe akulya jikape. <verse eid="GEN 31:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 31:16" />Chipanje chose chiŵachijigele Akunnungu kutyochela kwa atati ŵetu chili chetu uwe pamo ni achiŵana ŵetu. Kwayele mpanganye yele yannajisye Akunnungu!”<verse eid="GEN 31:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 31:17" />Nipele, che Yakubu ŵaliji chile kwaula ulendo, ŵakwesisye achiŵanagwe ni achiŵankwakwe pa inyama yaikuŵilanjikwa ngamia. <verse eid="GEN 31:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 31:18" />Ŵajigele inyama yakwe yose pamo ni chipanje chose yapatile kweleko ku Padani Alamu, ni kutanda ulendo wa kuuja ku chilambo cha Kaanani kwa che Isaka atatigwe. <verse eid="GEN 31:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 31:19" />Kele katema che Labani ŵaliji apite kukusikata manyunya ngondolo syakwe. Kwayele che Laheli ŵakwete lipesa lya kwiŵa inyago ya minungu ja atatigwe. <verse eid="GEN 31:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 31:20" />Che Yakubu ŵanlambwisye che Labani mundu jwa kualamu, kwa kwaula ulendo pangalanga. <verse eid="GEN 31:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 31:21" />Nipele, che Yakubu ŵaijigele ipanje yakwe yose iŵakwete, ni ŵatyosile kwa kutila. Paŵamasile komboka lusulo lwa Efulate, ŵajawile upande wa ku Gileadi chilambo cha matumbi.<verse eid="GEN 31:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Labani akwakuya che Yakubu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 31:22" />Pagapitile moŵa gatatu, ŵandu ŵaasalile che Labani kuti che Yakubu atisile. <verse eid="GEN 31:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 31:23" />Nipele, che Labani ŵaajigele achalongo achinjakwe, ni ŵankuiye che Yakubu kwa moŵa saba, ŵaasimene ku Gileadi chilambo cha matumbi. <verse eid="GEN 31:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 31:24" />Nambo, chilo Akunnungu ŵankopochele che Labani musagamisi, ŵansalile, “Nlilolechesye! Ngasimwasalila che Yakubu liloŵe lyalili lyose, lyambone pane lyangalimate.”<verse eid="GEN 31:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 31:25" />Che Yakubu ŵaliji aŵisile chigono pa chilambo cha matumbi pa Gileadi, katema che Labani paŵaasime. Che Labani nombe, pamo ni achalongo achinjakwe, ŵaŵisile chigono kweleko. <verse eid="GEN 31:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 31:26" />Pele che Labani ŵansalile che Yakubu, “Ntesile chichi? Kwachichi muunambwisye, mwajigele achiŵali ŵangu mpela ŵandu ŵakamwilwe kwa machili kungondo? <verse eid="GEN 31:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 31:27" />Ana kwachichi mwatyosile kwa kutila, ni kuunambusya, natamuno nganimuusalila kuti ngombole kunlanga kwa kusengwa, ni nyimbo ni ngoma ni mabango? <verse eid="GEN 31:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 31:28" />Kwachichi nganimumba lipesa lyakwakumbata kwa kwalanga achiŵali ŵangu ni isukulu yangu? Isyene ntesile mwakuloŵela! <verse eid="GEN 31:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 31:29" />Une ngwete ulamusi wakuntenda yangalimate, nambo Akunnungu ŵa atati ŵenu ŵangopochele chilo cha lelo jino, ŵaasalile achitiji, ‘Nlilolechesye! Ngasimwasalila che Yakubu liloŵe lyalililyose, lyambone pane lyangalimate.’ <verse eid="GEN 31:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 31:30" />Ngumanyilila kuti mwatyosile kwa kutila ligongo mwalajile kuuja kwa atati ŵenu. Nambo kwachichi mwajiŵile minungu jangu?” <verse eid="GEN 31:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 31:31" />Che Yakubu ŵajanjile, “Najogwepe ligongo naganisisye kuti chimuusumule une achiŵali ŵenu. <verse eid="GEN 31:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 31:32" />Nambo uchimunsimane ni inyago ya minungu jenu aulajikwe! Paujo pa achalongo achinjetu ŵa, nlosye chilichose chachili chenu, njigale.” Che Yakubu nganamanyililaga kuti che Laheli ŵaliji ajigele inyago ya minungu ja che Labani.<verse eid="GEN 31:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 31:33" />Nipele, Che Labani ŵasosile inyago ya minungu mu lisakasa lya che Yakubu, ni lya che Lea ni lya ŵakutumichila ŵaŵili; nambo nganaiwona, npele ŵapite mu lisakasa lya che Lea ni kwinjila mu lisakasa lya che Laheli. <verse eid="GEN 31:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 31:34" />Che Laheli ni ŵaŵajijigele minungu jo, ŵajisisile kuusi kwa chindu chakutamila pangongo wa ngamia. Che Labani ŵasosile mose mu lisakasa, nambo nganaiwona. <verse eid="GEN 31:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 31:35" />Pelepo che Laheli ŵansalile atatigwe, “Choonde atati ngasimundumbilila une, pakuŵa ngangukombola kwima paujo penu ligongo ndili mmagono.” Nipele, che Labani ŵasosile minungu jakwe, nambo nganaiwona.<verse eid="GEN 31:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 31:36" />Pelepo che Yakubu ŵatumbile kwannope, ŵausisye che Labani achitiji, “Ana leŵile chichi? <verse eid="GEN 31:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 31:37" />Mmasile kuwunukula misigo jose, ana nchiweni chichi chachili chenumwe? Mmiche pakuloleka paujo pa ŵandu ŵangu ni ŵandu ŵenu, kuti alamule ŵaani ŵakwete ulemwa pasikati jetu! <verse eid="GEN 31:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 31:38" />Ndemi ni mmwe kwa yaka ishilini, ni yaka yose yo ngaŵa ngondolo syenu atamuno mbusi syenu nganisipolosya namose jimo. Une nganimwahi kulya ngondolo jankambako jajilijose ja mwachinga mwenu. <verse eid="GEN 31:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 31:39" />Une nganinanyichisya ata kamo chinyama chachiulajikwe ni inyama ya mwikonde, nambo nanlipile hasala jo nansyene. Mwasachile ndende malipilo pangaikosya chinyama chijiŵikwe muusi pane chilo! <verse eid="GEN 31:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 31:40" />Yelei ni inatamaga, muusi lyuŵa lyambutile ni chilo malili gambutile mpaka nginingombola kugona. <verse eid="GEN 31:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 31:41" />Yele ni inatamaga kwa yaka ishilini mu nyuumba jenu. Nantumichile kwa yaka kumi na nne kwa ligongo lya achiŵali ŵenu ŵaŵili, ni yaka sita naliji nkuchinga ilango yenu. Nambo mmwe mwagalawisye malipilo gangu kakumi. <verse eid="GEN 31:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 31:42" />Naga Akunnungu ŵa ambuje ŵangu che Ibulahimu, Akunnungu uŵantesile atati ŵangu che Isaka atetemele, ngakaŵe upande wangu, isyene nkaanesile nyaule makono pe. Nambo Akunnungu ŵakuweni kulaga kwangu ni masengo gimbangenye ni makono gangu, ŵankalipile mmwe chilo cha lelo jino.”<verse eid="GEN 31:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 31:43" />Pelepo che Labani ŵanjanjile che Yakubu kuti, “Achiŵali ŵa ŵangu une, ni ŵanache ŵao ali ŵangu, ni inyama yi yangu une, ni yose inkwiwona pelepa ili yangu une. Nambo ana ngukombola kwatenda chichi achiŵali ŵangu ni ŵanache ŵao? <verse eid="GEN 31:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 31:44" />Nipele, une ndili chile kuŵika lilangano ni mmwejo, kuti liŵe umboni pasikati jetu.”<verse eid="GEN 31:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 31:45" />Pelepo che Yakubu ŵajigele liganga lyekulungwa ni ŵalijimiche kuti liŵe mpela luchanamila lwa chikumbusyo. <verse eid="GEN 31:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 31:46" />Sooni che Yakubu ŵaasalile ŵandu ŵakwe, “Nlokotanye maganga ni kuwunjika liunjili limo.” Ni ŵanyawo ŵalokotenye maganga ni kuwunjika liunjili. Nipele che Yakubu ni che Labani ŵalile pamo yakulya mungulugulu liunjili lyo. <verse eid="GEN 31:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 31:47" />Che Labani ŵaliŵilasile liunjili lya maganga lyo Yegali Sahaduta, nambo che Yakubu ŵaliŵilasile Galedi. <verse eid="GEN 31:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 31:48" />Che Labani ŵatite, “Liunjili lya magangali chilitukumbusye malangano getu.” Kwayele che Labani pamalo po ŵapaŵilasile Galedi, <verse eid="GEN 31:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 31:49" />ni liunjili lila ŵaliŵilasile sooni Misipa achitiji, “Ambuje Akunnungu atugose uwe pa katema kangatukuwonegana. <verse eid="GEN 31:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 31:50" />Naga chimwalagasye achiŵali ŵangu, ni naga chinlombele achakongwe ŵane, nipele mmanyilile kuti ngapagwa jwali jwaumboni pasikati jetu nambo Akunnungu asyenepe.” <verse eid="GEN 31:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 31:51" />Che Labani ŵansalile che Yakubu, “Nnole liunjili lya maganga giunjiche ni sooni pana liganga lyekulungwa linyimiche pasikati jenu ni une. <verse eid="GEN 31:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 31:52" />Liunjili lya maganga ni luchanamila ili umboni kuti ngunyomboka liunjili li kwika kukumputa, ni mmwe nganjomboka liunjili ni luchanamila kwika kukuumbuta une. <verse eid="GEN 31:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 31:53" />Akunnungu ŵa che Ibulahimu ni Akunnungu ŵa che Naholi, chalamule pasikati jetu.” Nipele, che Yakubu ŵalumbilile kwa Akunnungu juŵantesile che Isaka atati ŵao, atetemele. <verse eid="GEN 31:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 31:54" />Iyoyo che Yakubu ŵatyosisye mbopesi ku chitumbi ni kwalalika ŵandu ŵao kulya chakulya. Paŵamasile kulya, ŵatemi kweleko chilo chosye.<verse eid="GEN 31:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 31:55" />Che Labani ŵajimwiche kundaŵipe, ŵakumbete ŵanache ŵao ni isukulu, ni kwapa upile. Nipele ŵawusile kumangwao.<verse eid="GEN 31:55" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="GEN 32" />
  <para style="s">Che Yakubu akuliŵika chile kusimana ni che Esau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 32:1" />Che Yakubu ŵajendelechele ni ulendo wao. Nipele achikatumetume ŵa kwinani ŵa Akunnungu ŵasimene nawo. <verse eid="GEN 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 32:2" />Che Yakubu paŵaweni achikatumetume ŵa kwinani ŵala, ŵatite, “Awuwu uli mpingo wa ŵangondo ŵa Akunnungu!” Kweyele pachigono pala ŵapaŵilasile Mahanaimu.<verse eid="GEN 32:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 32:3" />Che Yakubu ŵaatumile ŵandu ku Seili mu chilambo cha Edomu, kuti ajaule ku che Esau achimwene jwao kukupeleka utenga. <verse eid="GEN 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 32:4" />Ŵaasalile ŵandu ŵala, “Nkaasalile che Esau ambuje ŵangu kuti, une che Yakubu jwakutumichila jwenu nguti, natamaga ku che Labani, nalonjele kweleko mpaka sambano. <verse eid="GEN 32:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 32:5" />Ngwete ng'ombe, ni mbunda, ni mipingo ja ngondolo, ni ŵakutumichila achalume ni achakongwe. Ngumpelechela utenga wu alakwe ambuje ŵangu, kuti ngundikwe pameso penu.”<verse eid="GEN 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 32:6" />Wandu ŵala ŵajawile ni utenga ula, nipele ŵausile ni kwasalila che Yakubu, “Twaiche kwa che Esau achimwene jwenu, nombejo ali mwitala pamo ni ŵandu mia nne kukunchingamila.” <verse eid="GEN 32:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 32:7" />Nipele, che Yakubu ŵajogwepe nnope ni kukola lipamba. Ŵandu ŵaŵaliji pamo nawo ŵala pamo ni ngondolo ni ilango ine ni ngamia ŵaagaŵenye maunjili gaŵili, <verse eid="GEN 32:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 32:8" />achiganisyaga mu ntima, “Naga chaiche che Esau ni kuulaga mpingo umo, nipele mpingo uchiusigalile chiutile ni kulama.”<verse eid="GEN 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 32:9" />Pelepo che Yakubu ŵatandite kupopela achitiji, “Akunnungu jwa ambuje ŵangu che Ibulahimu, sooni Akunnungu jwa atati ŵangu che Isaka! Ambuje Akunnungu jumuusalile muje ku chilambo changu kwa achalongo achinjangu, mwambele chilanga kuti chimundendele indu yambone, <verse eid="GEN 32:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 32:10" />nganguŵajilwa namose kanandi indu yambone yo imumbele une jwakutumichila jwenu jwakukulupilichika. Panajombweche lusulo lwa Yolodani, naliji jwangali chindu ikaŵe lubokola pe mmakono, nambo sambano ngwete mipingo jiŵiliji. <verse eid="GEN 32:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 32:11" />Ngunchondelela mungulupusye kutyochela kwa achimwene jwangu che Esau, pakuŵa ngwete lipamba lyakuti chatujimilile ŵanawose, ni achakongwe pamo ni ŵanache. <verse eid="GEN 32:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 32:12" />Nambo mwalanjile kumbanganyichisya indu yambone ni kuutenda achaŵelesi wangu aŵe achajinji nnope mpela nsanga wa kumbwani.”<verse eid="GEN 32:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 32:13" />Nipele, che Yakubu ŵagonile pelepo chele chilo cho. Nipele ŵajigele liunjili lya indu iŵakwete, iŵe ntulilo kwa che Esau nnung'unagwe: <verse eid="GEN 32:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 32:14" />Mikolo ja mbusi mia mbili ni mikambaku ishilini, mikolo ja ngondolo mia mbili ni mikambaku ishilini, <verse eid="GEN 32:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 32:15" />ngamia selasini syasikonjesya pamo ni ŵanache ŵao, mikolo ja ng'ombe alobaini ni mikambaku kumi, ni mikolo ja mbunda ishilini ni mikambaku kumi. <verse eid="GEN 32:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 32:16" />Ŵaapele ŵakutumichila ŵakwe, kila mundu ni mpingo wakwe, ŵaasalile, “Munongolele ni kusigasya lipesa pasikati ja mpingo ni mpingo.” <verse eid="GEN 32:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 32:17" />Ŵanlajisye juŵalongolele jula, “Mwasimanaga nao achimwene ŵangu che Esau nombejo ammusyaga, ‘Mmwe ndi jwakutumichila jwa ncheni? Nkwaula kwapi? Ni inyama yose yi ili ya acheni?’ <verse eid="GEN 32:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 32:18" />Mwasalile, ‘Yose yi ili i che Yakubu jwakutumichila jwenu, yeleyi ili ntulilo wenu alakwe achimwene jwangu che Esau. Asyene che Yakubu akukuya panyuma.’ ” <verse eid="GEN 32:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 32:19" />Ŵaalajisye ilaila kwa jwakutumichila jwa mpingo waaŵili ni waatatu ni ŵane wose ŵakukuya achasalilaga, “Chimwasalile che Esau gagogo pachinsimane nao. <verse eid="GEN 32:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 32:20" />Kupunda yeleyo chimwasalile, ‘Jwakutumichila jwenu che Yakubu akukuya panyuma.’ ” Che Yakubu ŵaatumile ajanje yele pakuŵa ŵaganisyaga, “Panepa chinaatondoye pakwapa ntulilo unongwesye mmbujo, ni pachisimane nawo pane chanechelele.” <verse eid="GEN 32:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 32:21" />Nipele ŵalongwesye mitulilo jawo, nambo asyene chilo cho ŵagonile palapala pachigono.<verse eid="GEN 32:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yakubu akulimbana nchinjo ni mundu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 32:22" />Chilo chilachila che Yakubu ŵajimwiche ni kwajigala achiŵankwakwe ŵaŵili, pamo ni ŵakutumichila ŵakwe ŵaŵili ni ŵanache ŵakwe likumi ni jumo, ŵajombweche lusulo lwa Yaboki. <verse eid="GEN 32:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 32:23" />Paŵamasile kwajombosya peesi kasulo aŵala uŵaliji pamo nao ni indu yao yose iŵakwete, <verse eid="GEN 32:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 32:24" />Che Yakubu ŵasigalile jika. Nipele mundu jumo jwaiche ni kulimbana nao nchinjo mpaka kwachele. <verse eid="GEN 32:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 32:25" />Mundu jula paŵaiweni kuti ngakukombola kwapunda che Yakubu, ŵankwaiye che Yakubu pa mauli, nipele ŵatiningwiche pa mauli po paŵaliji nkumenyana nchiinjo. <verse eid="GEN 32:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 32:26" />Mundu jula ni ŵatite, “Muuneche nyaule pakuŵa kutandite kucha.” Nambo che Yakubu ŵajanjile “Ngangunneka njaule mpaka mmwejo muumbe upile.”<verse eid="GEN 32:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 32:27" />Mundu jula ŵausisye, “Liina lyenu ŵani?” Ŵajanjile, “Liina lyangu che Yakubu.” <verse eid="GEN 32:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 32:28" />Mundu jula ni ŵatite, “Liina lyenu ngaliŵa sooni che Yakubu nambo Isilaeli, pakuŵa nlimbene nchinjo ni Akunnungu ni ŵandu, nomwe mwapundile.” <verse eid="GEN 32:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 32:29" />Che Yakubu ŵausisye achitiji, “Choonde muusalile liina lyenu.” Nambo jwelejo ŵajanjile, “Kwachichi nkuusya liina lyangu?” Nipele ŵampele upile che Yakubu. <verse eid="GEN 32:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 32:30" />Nipele che Yakubu ŵapaŵilasile peuto pala Penueli achitiji, “Monegene ni Akunnungu meeso ni meeso nambo nganimwa.” <verse eid="GEN 32:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 32:31" />Lyuŵa lyaliji likopweche che Yakubu paŵatyosile Penueli, nombejo ŵaliji nkutimbajila ligongo ŵatiningwiche mauli. <verse eid="GEN 32:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 32:32" />Kwayele mpaka lelo jino Ŵaisilaeli ngakulya ntasi wa mauli pakuŵa mundu jula ŵankwaiye che Yakubu pa ntasi wa pamauli.<verse eid="GEN 32:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="GEN 33" />
  <para style="s">Che Yakubu akusimana ni che Esau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 33:1" />Che Yakubu ŵaweni che Esau achiikaga ni ŵandu ŵakwe mia nne. Kwayele ŵaasapulenye ŵanache ŵakwe, ŵane ku che Lea, ni ŵane ku che Laheli ni ŵane kwa aŵala achakongwe ŵaŵili ŵakutumichila ŵaŵaŵelechele che Yakubu ŵanache. <verse eid="GEN 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 33:2" />Ŵalongwesye che Silipa ni che Biliha achakongwe ŵakutumichila ŵakwe ni ŵanache ŵao, ŵakuiye che Lea ni ŵanache ŵakwe, kumbesi ŵakuiye che Laheli ni che Yusufu mwanagwe. <verse eid="GEN 33:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 33:3" />Che Yakubu nsyene ŵalongolele ni ŵajawile alinkwakotamila mpaka paasi mala saba mpaka paŵaŵandichile nkulugwe.<verse eid="GEN 33:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 33:4" />Nipele, che Esau ŵautuchile kukwachingamila che Yakubu, ni ŵakumbatile, ni wose ŵanaŵaŵili ŵalisile. <verse eid="GEN 33:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 33:5" />Che Esau paŵalolite ni kwawona achimmasyeto ŵala ni ŵanache ŵausisye, “Ana nlongene ni ŵani?” Che Yakubu ŵajanjile, “Ŵeleŵa ali ŵaanache ŵambele Akunnungu kwa upile wao, une jwamasengo jwenu.”<verse eid="GEN 33:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 33:6" />Nipele achakongwe ŵakutumichila ŵala pamo ni ŵanache ŵao, ŵaŵandichile ni ŵaatindiŵalile che Esau. <verse eid="GEN 33:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 33:7" />Kanyuma ŵaiche che Lea ni ŵanache ŵakwe ŵatindiŵele. Kumbesi ŵaiche che Laheli ni Yusufu ni nombewo ŵatindiŵele iyoyo.<verse eid="GEN 33:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 33:8" />Che Esau ŵausisye, “Ana mpingo wa ilango isimene nayo malumbo gakwe chichi?” Che Yakubu ŵajanjile, “Nampelechele alakwe ntuukawo kuti nkunde ni kumbochela”. <verse eid="GEN 33:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 33:9" />Nambo che Esau ŵatite, “Mpwanga ngwete ilango yejinji. Nsigale ni ilango yenu mwasyene.” <verse eid="GEN 33:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 33:10" />Che Yakubu ŵatite, “Ngwamba! Iŵaga nkundile kumbochela, nipele, ngunchondelela choonde mpochele ntuuka ungumpa. Pakuŵa kujiwona ngope jenu ili mpela kujiwona ngope ja Akunnungu, kwa intite pakumbochela kwa magasa gaŵili. <verse eid="GEN 33:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 33:11" />Nipele, choonde muukunde ntuuka unampelechele pakuŵa Akunnungu aandendele indu yambone, ni une ngwete ipanje yejinji.” Che Yakubu ŵanyenjile che Esau mpaka ŵakundile kupochela ntuuka ula.<verse eid="GEN 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 33:12" />Che Esau ŵatite, “Ayaga, tujendelechele ni ulendo wetu, une chinongolele.” <verse eid="GEN 33:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 33:13" />Nambo che Yakubu ŵaasalile, “Alakwe nkwimanyilila kuti ŵanache ŵa ali ŵamwana, nikuti ikuŵajilwa naigose ngondolo yangu ni ng'ombe yaikonjesya. Naisakulaga mwa kwautusya kwa lyuŵa limo yose tiimale kuwa. <verse eid="GEN 33:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 33:14" />Nipele, ngunchondelela nlongolele, ni une chinguye mbolembole mpela yaakuti kwenda ŵanache ni ilango yangu, mpaka patutunsimane ku Seili ko.”<verse eid="GEN 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 33:15" />Che Esau ŵatite, “Mmbaya nanlechele ŵamasengo ŵangu ŵaane.” Nambo che Yakubu ŵausisye, “Kwana ligongo chi lya kutenda yeleyo? Alakwe ikwanile kuti mumbochele yambone.” <verse eid="GEN 33:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 33:16" />Nipele, che Esau ŵatandite ulendo wa kuuja ku Seili. <verse eid="GEN 33:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 33:17" />Nambo che Yakubu ŵajawile ku Sukoti, ni kutaŵa nyuumba jao ni machinga ga ilango yakwe. Kwayele liuto lyo lyaŵilanjikwe Sukoti.<verse eid="GEN 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 33:18" />Pa ulendo wakwe wakuuja kutyochela ku Padani Alamu, che Yakubu ŵaiche uchenene ku musi wa Shekemu wauli mu chilambo cha Kanaani. Ni kutaŵa chigono chakwe kulolegana ni musi wo. <verse eid="GEN 33:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 33:19" />Malo go ŵasumile kutyochela kwa iŵelesi i che Hamoli, atati wao che Shekemu, kwa ipande mia moja ya feza. <verse eid="GEN 33:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 33:20" />Pelepo ŵataŵile chilisa ni kupaŵilanga lina lyakwe, El Elohe Isilaeli, malumbo gakwe Akunnungu ali Akunnungu jwa Isilaeli.<verse eid="GEN 33:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="GEN 34" />
  <para style="s">Che Shekemu akunkamulila che Dina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 34:1" />Lyuŵa limo che Dina mwali ju che Yakubu juŵaŵeleche ni che Lea, ŵapite kukwajimajimila achakongwe ŵampepe ŵa chilambo chila. <verse eid="GEN 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 34:2" />Nipele che Shekemu mwanache ju che Hamoli jwa lukosyo lwa Ŵahifi, mwenye jwa chilambo chila paŵamweni che Dina ŵankamwile ni kwakamulila. <verse eid="GEN 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 34:3" />Che Shekemu ŵanonyelwe nnope ni mwali jo, ŵannonyele nipele ŵatandite kwapembeka. <verse eid="GEN 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 34:4" />Che Shekemu ŵapite kukwasalila che Hamoli atatigwe kuti, “Choonde atati mundomelele mwali ju kuti aŵe ŵankwangu.”<verse eid="GEN 34:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 34:5" />Ndaŵi jijojo che Yakubu ŵapikene kuti mwali jwawo che Dina akamulilwe ni che Shekemu. Nambo pakuŵa achachanda ŵakwe ŵaliji kukuchinga, ŵamyalele mpaka paŵausile. <verse eid="GEN 34:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 34:6" />Nipele che Hamoli atatigwe che Shekemu ŵajawile ku che Yakubu kuti akunguluche nawo, <verse eid="GEN 34:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 34:7" />ni katema kakoko achachanda ŵa che Yakubu ŵaliji aninkuuja kutyochela kukuchinga. Paŵapikene ngani jo achachanda wo ŵasongoneche kwannope ni kuchimwa, pakuŵa che Shekemu ŵatendele chindu changalumbana ŵandu ŵa Isilaeli pakunkamulila mwali ju che Yakubu pakuŵa chindu cho chaliji kuŵagula.<verse eid="GEN 34:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 34:8" />Nambo che Hamoli ŵaasalile, “Mwanangu che Shekemu akunnonyela kwannope mwali jwenu. Choonde munkunde kuti anlombe. <verse eid="GEN 34:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 34:9" />Tujilane kuti ŵandu ŵetu alombele kukwenu ni ŵandu ŵa kukwenu alombele kukwetu. <verse eid="GEN 34:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 34:10" />Kwayele chintame pamo noweji mu chilambo chetu. Tinkombole kutama palipose mu chilambo muno ni kusumisya malonda genu ni kukola ipanje.” <verse eid="GEN 34:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 34:11" />Iyoyopeyo, che Shekemu ŵasalile atatigwe che Dina ni achapwakwe, “Choonde muungunde noneji chinjimpa chilichose chachinsale. <verse eid="GEN 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 34:12" />Muusalile malipilo ga ulombela ni ntulilo, iiche nawo, namose chiŵe chekulungwa chinampe, kuti nombele mwali ju.”<verse eid="GEN 34:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 34:13" />Nipele, pakuŵa che Dina alumbu jwawo ŵaliji akamulilwe, achachanda ŵa che Yakubu ŵala ŵajanjile kwa kwalambusya che Shekemu pamo ni che Hamoli atatigwe. <verse eid="GEN 34:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 34:14" />Ŵaasalile, “Ngatukukombola kunlombekasya alumbu ŵetu kwa mundu jwangaumbala. Kutenda yeleyo chiiŵe soni kukwetu. <verse eid="GEN 34:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 34:15" />Chitukunde iŵaga chinkunde kwaumbasya achalume ŵenu wose mpela itukuti uwe. <verse eid="GEN 34:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 34:16" />Pelepo ni pachitukunde kuti achiŵali ŵetu alombekwe ni ŵanyamwe ni achiŵali ŵenu alombekwe ni uwe, chitutame pamo ni ŵanyamwe ni kutaŵa ulongo. <verse eid="GEN 34:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 34:17" />Nambo naga ngankukunda kuumbala, chitunjigale mwali jwetu ni kwaula nawo.”<verse eid="GEN 34:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 34:18" />Yeleyo yaanonyele che Hamoli ni nchanda jwao che Shekemu. <verse eid="GEN 34:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 34:19" />Jwanchanda jula jwaliji jwakuchimbichikwa kwapunda ŵandu wose ŵapannango pala, ni nganakaŵa kuchitenda chiŵasalilwe chila, pakuŵa ŵannonyele mwali ju che Yakobo.<verse eid="GEN 34:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 34:20" />Nipele che Hamoli ni che Shekemu mwanagwe, ŵapite kwauli nnango wa musi papakutendekwa nkungulu kukukunguluka ni achalume ŵa musi ula. <verse eid="GEN 34:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 34:21" />Ŵatite, “Ŵandu ŵa ali achambusanga ŵetu twakunde kuti atame pachilambo pa ni kusumisya malonda, pakuŵa tukwete chilambo chekulungwa chakutukwana uweji ni ŵanyawo. Chitulombele kukwao ni ŵanyawo chalombele kukwetu. <verse eid="GEN 34:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 34:22" />Nambo ŵele ŵandu tachikunda kutama ni uŵeji ni kuŵa ulongo umo, iŵaga chitummumbasye kila jwannume pasikati jetu nti yakuti pakuumbasya ŵanyawo. <verse eid="GEN 34:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 34:23" />Ana ngankuimanyilila kuti ilango yao ni ipanje yakwete chiiŵe yetuwe? Nipele tukunde atame mu chilambo chetu.” <verse eid="GEN 34:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 34:24" />Achalume achinsyene musi wose ŵaŵasongangene pa nnango wa musi ula ŵajilene ni che Hamoli ni che Shekemu. Nipele kila jwannume jwa musi ula ŵaumbele.<verse eid="GEN 34:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 34:25" />Pagapitile moŵa gatatu pakumala kuumbala ali nkuwuwula kwa kupeteka, ŵanache ŵaŵili ŵa che Yakubu, yaani che Simoni ni che Lawi, achachimwene ŵao che Dina ŵajigele mapanga gao, ni kwaula kukwajimilila chisisimuchile achalume wose ŵa pamusi ula. <verse eid="GEN 34:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 34:26" />Ŵauleje ni mapanga che Hamoli ni mwanagwe che Shekemu, ŵanjigele che Dina kutyochela mu nyuumba ji che Shekemu ni kwaula. <verse eid="GEN 34:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 34:27" />Ŵanache ŵane ŵa che Yakobo ŵajawile ku musi ni kujigala kila chindu chiŵachisachile ligongo alumbwao ŵaatendele yangalumbana. <verse eid="GEN 34:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 34:28" />Ŵajigele ngondolo, mbusi pamo ni ng'ombe, ni mbunda ni yose iyaliji mu musi ula ni ya mmigunda. <verse eid="GEN 34:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 34:29" />Ŵajigele ipanje yose ya ŵandu ŵa musi ula pamo ni achakongwe ni ŵanache, ni yose iyaliji mmajumba.<verse eid="GEN 34:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 34:30" />Che Yakubu ŵaasalile che Simeoni ni che Lawi, “Ŵanyamwe munyichisye kulaga kwa kundenda njimwe ni ŵandu ŵa chilambo chi cha Ŵakanaani ni Ŵapelisi, ungutama nawo mu chilambo chi. Uŵeji nganitutupa, iŵaga akuŵilangana kuti atupute, chatujonanje.” <verse eid="GEN 34:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 34:31" />Nambo ŵanyawo ŵajanjile, “Ngatukukombola kwalechelela apanganyichiswe alumbu ŵetu nti jwachigwagwa?”<verse eid="GEN 34:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="GEN 35" />
  <para style="s">Che Yakubu akuujila ku Beseli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 35:1" />Akunnungu ŵaasalile che Yakubu, “Njaule ku Beseli nkatame kweleko. Nkaandaŵile chilisa kweleko, une ndili Akunnungu junankopochele katema kamwatisile achimwene wenu che Esau.” <verse eid="GEN 35:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 35:2" />Nipele, che Yakubu ŵaasalile alongo ajao ni ŵandu ŵa munyuumba jao, “Ntyosye minungu jenu jachilendo jinkwete, nkaliswejesye ni kuwala nguo sine.” <verse eid="GEN 35:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 35:3" />Nipele, tutujaule ku Beseli kuti ngaataŵile chilisa Akunnungu, juŵangamwisye katema kakulaga, ni ŵaliji pamo ni une mose munajendaga. <verse eid="GEN 35:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 35:4" />Kwayele, ŵapele che Yakubu inyago yose ya minungu ja chilendo iŵakwete pamo ni ipuli iŵawete mmaŵiŵi mwawo, ni che Yakubu ŵaisilile kuusi chitela cha mwaloni chachili chiŵandi ni ku Shekemu.<verse eid="GEN 35:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 35:5" />Che Yakubu ni achiŵanagwe paŵaliji mu ulendo, Akunnungu ŵaatasile lipamba lyekulungwa achinsyene misi jose jajiŵandikene ni ngapagwa juŵalinjile kwakuya. <verse eid="GEN 35:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 35:6" />Nipele che Yakubu ŵakuiche ku Lusu musi waukumanyika sano nti Beseli, mu chilambo cha Kanaani, pamo ni ŵandu uŵaliji nawo. <verse eid="GEN 35:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 35:7" />Pelepo ŵataŵile chilisa ni kupaŵilanga Eli Beseli, ligongo pelepo ni paŵalilosisye Akunnungu kukwao paŵaliji aninkwatila achimwene wao. <verse eid="GEN 35:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 35:8" />Che Debola juŵannelite che Lebeka, ŵajasiche, ni kusikwa kuusi chitela cha mwaloni chachili kulujenda kwa Beseli. Kwayele ŵauŵilasile musi ula Aloni Bakuti malumbo gakwe “Mwaloni wakutendela malilo.”<verse eid="GEN 35:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 35:9" />Paŵausile kutyochela ku Padan-Alamu, Akunnungu ŵankopochele sooni ni kwapa upile. <verse eid="GEN 35:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 35:10" />Akunnungu ŵansalile, “Liina lyenu lili che Yakubu, nambo ngammilanjikwa sooni lina lyo, chimmilanjikwe che Isilaeli.” Akunnungu ŵammilasile che Isilaeli. <verse eid="GEN 35:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 35:11" />Akunnungu ŵansalile che Yakubu, “Une ndili Akunnungu jundi ni ukombole wose, nkole ŵanache achajinji, kwa mmwe chikutyochele chilambo ni ilambo ni mamwenye. <verse eid="GEN 35:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 35:12" />Chilambo chinaapele che Ibulahimu ni che Isaka, chinampe mmwe ni iŵelesi yenu.” <verse eid="GEN 35:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 35:13" />Pakumala kukunguluka ni che Yakubu, Akunnungu ŵannesile ni kwaula. <verse eid="GEN 35:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 35:14" />Che Yakubu ŵajimiche liganga lya chikumbuchisyo apala paŵakungulwiche ni Akunnungu, ni ŵalitesile liŵe lya Ambuje Akunnungu kwakwitila mbopesi ja chakungwa ni mauta pachanya pakwe. <verse eid="GEN 35:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 35:15" />Che Yakubu ŵapaŵilasile pelepo paŵakungulwiche ni Akunnungu liina lyakwe Beseli.<verse eid="GEN 35:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chiwa chi che Laheli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 35:16" />Che Yakubu ni nnango wao wose ŵatyosile ku Beseli. Paŵaliji mwakutalichila kanandi akanaŵe kwika ku Efulata, che Laheli ŵakamwilwe ni chilungusi channope. <verse eid="GEN 35:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 35:17" />Paŵalwalilaga aninkuŵeleka jwakuŵelesya ŵansalile, “Nkajogopa, nkwete mwanache jwine jwannume.” <verse eid="GEN 35:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 35:18" />Che Laheli paŵajasikaga ŵammilasile mwanagwe, “A Benoni,” malumbo gakwe kusongoneka. Nambo atatigwe ŵaŵilasile a Benjamini. <verse eid="GEN 35:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 35:19" />Nipele che Laheli ŵajasiche ni kusikwa mumbali mwa litala lya kwaula ku Efulata yaani ku Beselehemu. <verse eid="GEN 35:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 35:20" />Che Yakubu ŵalujimiche luchanamila lwa lukumbuchisyo pa lilembe lyo lwaluli mpaka lelojino. <verse eid="GEN 35:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 35:21" />Che Isilaeli ŵajendelechele ni ulendo wao ni kuŵika chigono pakumala kupita lusonga lwa Edeli.<verse eid="GEN 35:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 35:22" />Katema che Yakubu paŵatamaga mu chilambo cho, che Lubeni mwanagwe, ŵagonile ni che Biliha ŵankwakwe ŵane ŵa atatigwe, ni che Yakubu ŵapilikene ngani jo.<verse eid="GEN 35:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ŵanache ŵa che Yakubu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 2:1-2">1 Indu ya katema 2:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 35:23" />Ŵanache ŵachilume ŵa che Lea ŵalinji che Lubeni, jwakwitiwo ju che Yakobo, che Simeoni, che Lawi, che Yuda, che Isakali ni che Sabuloni. <verse eid="GEN 35:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 35:24" />Ŵanache ŵachilume ŵa che Laheli ŵaliji che Yusufu ni che Benjamini. <verse eid="GEN 35:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 35:25" />Ŵanache ŵaŵapagwile ni che Biliha jwankongwe jwakutumichila ju che Laheli, ŵalinji che Dani ni che Naftali. <verse eid="GEN 35:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 35:26" />Ŵanache ŵachilume ŵaŵapagwile ni che Silipa jwankongwe jwakutumichila ju che Lea, ŵaliji che Gadi ni che Asheli. Ŵelewo ŵalinji ŵanache achalume ŵa che Yakubu uŵaŵeleche paŵaliji ku Padani Alamu.<verse eid="GEN 35:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chiwa chi che Isaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 35:27" />Che Yakubu ŵausile kumangwao kwa atatigwe che Isaka, ku Mamle chiŵandi ni ku Kiliati Alba yaani ku Hebuloni, kuŵatamaga che Iblahamu ni che Isaka nti achalendo. <verse eid="GEN 35:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 35:28" />Che Isaka ŵaliji ni yaka mia moja na semanini. <verse eid="GEN 35:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 35:29" />Nipele che Isaka ŵajasiche ali achekulwipe nnope. Ŵanache ŵakwe che Esau ni che Yakubu ŵaasichile atati ŵao.<verse eid="GEN 35:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="GEN 36" />
  <para style="s">Iŵelesi u che Yakobo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 1:43-54">1 Indu ya katema 1:43-54</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 36:1" />Ŵeleŵa ali iŵelesi i che Esau, yaani che Edomu. <verse eid="GEN 36:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 36:2" />Che Esau ŵalombele achakongwe wa Chikanaani: Che Ada mwali ju che Eloni Mhiti, Oholibama mwali ju che Anah, juŵaliji chisukulu chachikongwe chi che Sibeoni Mhifi, <verse eid="GEN 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 36:3" />ni che Basemati mwali ju che Ishumaeli, nnumbugwe che Nebayoti. <verse eid="GEN 36:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 36:4" />Che Ada ŵaaŵelechele che Esau Elifasi nombe che Basemati ŵaaŵelechele che Leueli, <verse eid="GEN 36:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 36:5" />nombe che oholibama ŵaaŵelechele che Yeushi, ni che Yalamu ni che Kola. Ŵelewo ni ŵanache ŵachilume wa che Esau ŵaŵapagwile paŵatamaga ku Kanaani.<verse eid="GEN 36:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 36:6" />Nipele che Esau ŵaajigele achiŵankwakwe ni ŵanache achalume ni achakongwe ni ŵandu ŵa pannango ŵakwe, ni ilango yakwe ni indu iŵapatile ku Kanaani, ni kusamila kwiine kwa kutalichila ni mpwakwe che Yakubu. <verse eid="GEN 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 36:7" />Ŵatesile yeleyo pakuŵa ŵaliji ni indu yejinji kwati nganakombola kutama pamo sooni ligongo, ni ligongo ŵakwete ilango yejinji, kwayele chilambo chiŵatamaga chila nti achalendo nganichakwana. <verse eid="GEN 36:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 36:8" />Kwayele che Esau, yaani Edomu, ŵapite kutama ku Seili chilambo cha matumbi.<verse eid="GEN 36:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 36:9" />Ŵeleŵa ali iŵelesi i che Esau, atati ŵa Ŵaedomu, ku Seili chilambo cha matumbi. <verse eid="GEN 36:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 36:10" />Ŵanache achalume ŵa che Esau ŵaŵapagwile ni che Ada ŵankwakwe ni che Leuheli uŵapagwile ni che Basemati ŵankwawo ŵaane. <verse eid="GEN 36:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 36:11" />Ŵanache ŵa che Elifasi nsano; meena gao galiji che Temali ni che Omali ni che Sefo ni che Gatamu ni che Kenasi. <verse eid="GEN 36:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 36:12" />Che Elifasi ŵaliji ni kapolo mwali, liina lyakwe che Timina juŵammelechele mwanache liina lyao che Amaleki. Ŵeleŵa ali isukulu i che Ada wankwakwe che Esau. <verse eid="GEN 36:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 36:13" />Che Basemeti ŵankwakwe che Esau, ŵammeleche che Leueli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 36:13">Ŵanache ŵa che Leueli ali, che Nahati ni che Sela ni che Shama ni che Misa. Ŵelewo ali isukulu i che Basemati ŵankwakwe che Esau.<verse eid="GEN 36:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 36:14" />Che Oholibama ŵankwakwe che Esau mwali ju che Anah, mwali ju che Sibeoni, ŵammelechele ŵankwakwe ŵanache achalume ŵatatu, yaani che Yeushi ni che Yalamu ni che Kola.<verse eid="GEN 36:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 36:15" />Ŵeleŵa ali achakulu ŵa ngosyo sya iŵelesi i che Esau. Che Elifasi mwanache jwakwitiwo ju che Esau ŵaaŵeleche che Temani ni che Omali ni che Sefo pamo ni che Kenasi, <verse eid="GEN 36:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 36:16" />che Kola ni che Gatamu ni che Amaleki. Ŵelewo ni uŵaliji achakulu ŵa ŵandu uŵapagwile ni che Elifasi ku Edomu, aŵaŵa ali isukulu yachilume i che Ada.<verse eid="GEN 36:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 36:17" />Che Leueli mwanagwe che Esau ŵaaŵeleche che Nahati ni che Sela ni che Shama ni che Misa. Ŵelewo ali achakulu ŵa ngosyo sya iŵelesi i che Leueli ŵaŵatamaga ku Edomu. <verse eid="GEN 36:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 36:18" />Asi sili ngosyo sya paulongo u che Esau ni ŵankwakwe che Oholibama, mwali ju che Anah; che Yeushi ni che Yalamu ni che Kola. Kila mundu ŵaliji jwankulu jwa lukosyo lwakwe. <verse eid="GEN 36:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 36:19" />Ngosyo syose si sityochele mu iŵelesi i che Esau, nombewo ŵaliji achakulu ŵa ngosyo syawo.<verse eid="GEN 36:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lukosyo lu che Seili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 1:38-42">1 Indu ya katema 1:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 36:20" />Awuwu uli uŵelesi u che Seili Mholi, uŵatamaga mu chilambo chila; che Lotani ni che Shobali ni che Sibeoni ni che Anah, <verse eid="GEN 36:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 36:21" />ni che Dishoni ni che Eseli ni che Dishani. Ŵele ŵaliji achachekulu ŵa ngosyo. Mipingo jose jaŵilanjikwe kwa mena ga achachekulu ŵao.<verse eid="GEN 36:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 36:22" />Ŵanache achalume ŵa che Lotani ŵaliji che Holi ni che Hemani ni alumbu ŵao che Lotani liina lyao che Timina.<verse eid="GEN 36:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 36:23" />Ŵanache achalume ŵa che shobali ŵaliji che Alufani ni che Manahati ni che Ebali ni che Shefo ni che Onamu.<verse eid="GEN 36:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 36:24" />Ŵanache ŵa che Sibeoni ŵaliji che Aiya ni che Anah. Che Anah ni uŵaiŵeni iliŵa ya meesi ga mooto kwipululu, paŵaliji aninkuchinga mbunda sya atatigwe jwakuŵilanjikwa che Sibeoni. <verse eid="GEN 36:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 36:25" />Che Anah ŵakwete ŵanache ŵaŵili, jwannume liina lyakwe che Dishoni ni jwankongwe liina lyao che Oholibama. <verse eid="GEN 36:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 36:26" />Ŵanache achalume ŵa che Dishoni ali che Hemidani ni che Eshibani ni che Itilani ni che Kelani.<verse eid="GEN 36:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 36:27" />Ŵanache achalume ŵa che Eseli ŵaliji, che Bilihani ni che Saawani ni che Akani.<verse eid="GEN 36:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 36:28" />Ŵanache achalume ŵa che Dishani ŵaliji che Usi ni che Alani. <verse eid="GEN 36:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 36:29" />Ŵeleŵa ali achakulu ŵa Ŵaholi; che Lotani ni che Shobali ni che Sibeoni ni che Anah ni che Dishoni ni che Eseli pamo ni che Dishani. <verse eid="GEN 36:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 36:30" />Ŵelewo ŵaliji achakulu wa ngosyo sya Ŵaholi ku Seili chilambo cha matumbi.<verse eid="GEN 36:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mamwenye ga ku Edomu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 1:43-54">1 Indu ya katema 1:43-54</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 36:31" />Ŵanyaŵa ni mamwenye ŵaŵatawele ku Edomu akanaŵe mwenye jwajulijose kwatawala Ŵaisilaeli. <verse eid="GEN 36:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 36:32" />Che Bela mwanache jwannume ju che Beoli ŵaliji mwenye jwa ku Edomu. Liina lya musi wakwe lyaliji Dinihaba. <verse eid="GEN 36:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 36:33" />Che Bela paŵajasiche, che Yobabu mwanache jwao che Sela juŵatyochele ku Bosila ŵakamwile umwenye. <verse eid="GEN 36:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 36:34" />Ni che Yobabu nombe ŵajasiche ni che Hushamu jwa ku Temani ŵaliji mwenye. <verse eid="GEN 36:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 36:35" />Che Hushamu paŵajasiche, che Hadadi mwanache ju che Bedadi ŵakamwile umwenye. Che Hadadi paŵamenyene ngondo ni Ŵamidiani ŵapundile, mu chilambo cha Moabu kwati musi wakwe wekulu ŵaliji Aviti. <verse eid="GEN 36:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 36:36" />Nipele che Hadadi ŵajasiche, ni che Samila kutyochela ku Masileka, ŵakamwile umwenye. <verse eid="GEN 36:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 36:37" />Che Samila paŵajasiche, che Shauli kutyochela ku Lehoboti, wauli chiŵandi ni lusulo lwa Euflate, jwakamulile umwenye. <verse eid="GEN 36:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 36:38" />Nombe paŵajasiche che Shauli, che Baal Hanani mwanache ju che Akiboli jwakamulile umwenye. <verse eid="GEN 36:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 36:39" />Che Baal Hanani mwanache ju che Akiboli paŵajasiche, che Hadadi jwakamulile umwenye. Chilambo chakwe chaŵilanjikwe Pau, ni ŵankwakwe ŵaliji che Mehetabeli mwali ju che Matiledi, juŵaliji chisukulu chi che Mesahabu.<verse eid="GEN 36:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 36:40" />Achakulu ŵa ngosyo syasityochele ni uŵelesi u che Esau, ni kumanyika malinga ni ngosyo syao ni matame gao galiji, Timina ni Alifa ni Yeteti, <verse eid="GEN 36:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 36:41" />che Aholibama ni che Ela ni che Pinoni, <verse eid="GEN 36:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 36:42" />che Kenasi ni che temeni ni che Mibisali, <verse eid="GEN 36:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 36:43" />che Magidieli ni che Ilamu. Ŵele ni uŵaliji achakulu ŵa ngosyo sya Edomu malinga ni matame gao mu chilambo chiŵatamaga.<verse eid="GEN 36:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="GEN 37" />
  <para style="s">Sagamisi si che Yusufu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 37:1" />Che Yakubu ŵapundile kutama mu chilambo cha ku Kanaani, kuŵatamaga atati ŵao, <verse eid="GEN 37:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 37:2" />ni jeleji jili ngani ja nnango u che Yakubu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 37:2">Che Yusufu ali nchanda jwa yaka kumi na saba, ŵachingaga ngondolo ni mbusi pamo ni achakulugwe, ŵanache ŵa che Biliha ni che Silipa, achiŵankwakwe atati ŵao. Nombe che Yusufu ŵaasalilaga atatigwe indu yangalumbana yaatendaga achakulugwe.<verse eid="GEN 37:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 37:3" />Ligongo lya yele che Yakubu ŵaanonyele che Yusufu kupunda achiŵanagwe ŵane, pakuŵa ŵaliji mwanache jwa mu uchekulu. Nipele ŵantotele mwinjilo ŵa kusalala nnope. <verse eid="GEN 37:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 37:4" />Nambo achakulugwe paŵaiweni yakuti atati ŵao akunnonyela che Yusufu kupunda ŵelewo, ŵanchimile ni nganaŵechetaga nao kwa chitendeŵele.<verse eid="GEN 37:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 37:5" />Lyuŵa limo che Yusufu ŵasagamile, ni paŵasalile achakulugwe nkati sagamisi jo ŵapundile kwachima nnope. <verse eid="GEN 37:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 37:6" />Ŵaasalile, “Mpilikanile sagamisi jiisagamile, <verse eid="GEN 37:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 37:7" />twataŵaga ilingo ya magungulo kumigunda, chisisimuchile chilingo changu chajimi ni ilingo yenu yachisyungwile chilingo changu ni kuchikotamila.”<verse eid="GEN 37:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 37:8" />Achakulugwe ŵausisye, “Uli mmwe nkusaka ntutawale uwe? Ana, isyene mmwe nkusaka kututawala uwe?” Ŵapundile kwachima nnope ligongo lya sagamisi jakwe pamo ni aila iŵasalilaga. <verse eid="GEN 37:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 37:9" />Nipele che Yusufu ŵasagamile sagamisi jiine ni kwasalila achakulugwe, achitiji, “Mpilikane, sagamile sooni. Naliweni lyuŵa, ni lwesi, pamo ni ndondwa kumi na moja ikungotamila.” <verse eid="GEN 37:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 37:10" />Nambo paŵatanjilaga ŵanya atatigwe ni achakulugwe sagamisi jo, atatigwe ŵankalipile achitiji, “Sagamisi chi jele jinsagamile? Ana une ni achikulu ŵenu ni achakulu ŵenu chituiche kukunkotamila?” <verse eid="GEN 37:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 37:11" />Achakulugwe ŵakolele wiu, nambo atatigwe ŵajendelechele kuiganisya aila iŵaisasile che Yusufu.<verse eid="GEN 37:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yusufu akusumikwa ku Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 37:12" />Lyuŵa limo, achakulugwe che Yusufu ŵapite kukulisya ilango ya atati ŵao chiŵandi ni ku Shekemu. <verse eid="GEN 37:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 37:13" />Nipele che Yakubu ŵaasalile che Yusufu, “Achakulu ŵenu akulisya ilango chiŵandi ni ku Shekemu, njaule nkaalole.” Che Yusufu ŵajanjile, “Elo chinyaule.” <verse eid="GEN 37:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 37:14" />Kwayele che Yakubu ŵatite, “Njaule nkaalole achakulu ŵenu pamo ilango yao naga ali uchenene, nipele mumbelechele ngani jo.” Nipele ŵaatumile che Yusufu kutyochela ku lichemba lya ku Hebuloni. <verse eid="GEN 37:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 37:15" />Che Yusufu ŵakuiche ku Shekemu ni paŵaliji nkusyungulasyungula kwasosa achakulu ŵao, mundu jumo ŵansimene ni kwausya, “Nkusosa ichichi?” <verse eid="GEN 37:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 37:16" />Che Yusufu ŵajanjile, “Ngwasosa achakulu ŵangu. Nkukombola kusalila kwapi kwakulisisya ilango yao?” <verse eid="GEN 37:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 37:17" />Mundu jula ŵaajanjile, “Komboleka atyosile, pakuŵa naapikene achitiji akwaula ku Dosani.” Nipele che Yusufu ŵaakuiye achakulu ŵao ni kwasimana ali ku Dosani. <verse eid="GEN 37:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 37:18" />Nambo paŵammweni ali kwakutalichila, ni ngaanaŵe kwaŵandichila ŵalangene kwaulaga. <verse eid="GEN 37:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 37:19" />Ŵasalilene, “Nnole, ŵakusagamila akwika! <verse eid="GEN 37:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 37:20" />Ayaga tummulaje ni kwatutila mu lisimbo. Nipele tujileje kuti chinyama chachikali cha mwitinji chasumbile ni kummulaga. Pelepo tulole naga sagamisi syakwe chisiŵe sya usyene.” <verse eid="GEN 37:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 37:21" />Nambo che Leubeni paŵapikene yeleyo, ŵasachile kwawombola inaasimene yeleyo che Yusufu, ŵaasalile achapwakwe, “Choonde tukammulaga. <verse eid="GEN 37:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 37:22" />Muntumbuchisye mu lisimbo lya mwikonde mu, nambo ngasimummulaga.” Che Lubeni ŵatite yele kuti ŵaakulupusye mmakono mwao ni kummusya kwa atatigwe. <verse eid="GEN 37:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 37:23" />Che Yusufu paŵaichilile achakulu ŵao, ŵammusile mwinjilo ŵakusalala ula. <verse eid="GEN 37:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 37:24" />Nipele ŵankamwile ni kumponya mu lisimbo lyangali meesi.<verse eid="GEN 37:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 37:25" />Paŵatemi kulya, ŵauweni mpingo ŵa Ŵaishumaeli uwaliji mu ulendo kutyochela ku Gileadi kwaula ku Misili. Ngamia syao syatwichile ubani ni uvumba pamo ni mauta gagakuŵilanjikwa manemane. <verse eid="GEN 37:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 37:26" />Che Yuda ŵaasalile achapwakwe, “Ana chitupate faida chi tummulagaga mpwetu ni kuchisisa chiilu chakwe? <verse eid="GEN 37:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 37:27" />Mbaya tunsumisye kwa Ŵaishumaeli, tukammulaga pakuŵa tuli ulongo umo, ali jwamiasi jimo ni uwe.” Achapwakwe ŵakundile. <verse eid="GEN 37:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 37:28" />Ŵakusumisya malonda Ŵachimidiani paŵaiche pepala, achakulu ŵao che Yusufu ŵantyosisye che Yusufu mu lisimbo mula ni kunsumisya kwa Ŵaishimaeli kwa ntengo wa ipande ishilini ya madini ga feza. Ŵaishimaeli ŵanjawisye ku Misili.<verse eid="GEN 37:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 37:29" />Che Lubeni paŵausile kulola mu lisimbo lila pangaawona che Yusufu, ŵapapulenye yakuwala yakwe akuno achisupukaga. <verse eid="GEN 37:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 37:30" />Ŵaajaulile achapwakwe ni kwasalila, “Jwanchanda nganapagwa, sano chindende chichi?” <verse eid="GEN 37:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 37:31" />Nipele, ŵajisikite mbusi, ni kuujigala mwinjilo u che Yusufu ni kuchuya mu miasi ja mbusi jila. <verse eid="GEN 37:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 37:32" />Ŵaujigele mwinjilo ula ni kwajauchisya atati ŵao achitiji, “Tulokwete mwinjilo wu! Nnole kaje naga uli mwinjilo ŵa nchanda jwenu paane ngaŵa.” <verse eid="GEN 37:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 37:33" />Atati ŵao ŵaumanyilile mwinjilo ula, ŵatite, “Elo uli usyene! Chinyama chakalipa chaasumbile ni kummulaga. Isyene che Yusufu aulajikwe.” <verse eid="GEN 37:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 37:34" />Nipele che Yakubu ŵapapulenye yakuwala yao kwa kusupuka, ŵatakwile ligunia nchiunu ni kulila malilo ga mwanagwao moŵa gamajinji. <verse eid="GEN 37:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 37:35" />Ŵanache ŵao wose, achalume ni achakongwe ŵalinjile kwakamulisya ntima nambo nganakunda kwapembesya. Ŵatite, “Muuneche, chinyendelechele kwalilila mwanangu mpaka pachinyaule kwiuto kwa ŵandu ŵawile kwaali mwanangu.” Kwanti yeleyo Che Yakubu ŵapundile kwalilila che Yusufu.<verse eid="GEN 37:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 37:36" />Katema kakoko akula ku Misili, Ŵamidiani ŵansumisye che Yusufu ku che Potifa jumo jwa achakulu ŵa mwenye che Falao, juŵaliji nkulu jwa ŵangondo ŵakulindilila nyuumba ja mwenye.<verse eid="GEN 37:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="GEN 38" />
  <para style="s">Che Yuda ni che Tamali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 38:1" />Katema ko, che Yuda ŵalekangene ni achapwakwe ni kwaula kutama ni mundu jumo jwa ku Hadulami, liina lyakwe che Hila. <verse eid="GEN 38:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 38:2" />Kweleko che Yuda ŵasimene ni mwali jwa mundu jumo Mkanaani liina lyakwe che Shua. Ŵalombele, <verse eid="GEN 38:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 38:3" />mwali ŵakwete chiilu ni kuŵeleka mwanache jwannume, juŵammilasile che Eli. <verse eid="GEN 38:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 38:4" />Ŵakwete chiilu chiine ni kuligopola mwanache jwine jwannume ni kwapa liina che Onani. <verse eid="GEN 38:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 38:5" />Ŵajendelechele, ŵaŵeleche mwanache jwine jwannume ni kwaŵilanga che Shela. Katema paŵapagwile che Shela, che Yuda ŵaliji nkutama ku Kesibu.<verse eid="GEN 38:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 38:6" />Che Yuda ŵalombekasisye che Eli mwanache jwao jwa kwitiwo mwali liina lyakwe che Tamali. <verse eid="GEN 38:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 38:7" />Nambo che Eli, mwanache jwakwitiwo ju che Yuda ŵaliji ŵachigongomalo paujo pa Ambuje Akunnungu, kwayele Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaauleje. <verse eid="GEN 38:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 38:8" />Nipele, che Yuda ŵaasalile che Onani, “Akulu ŵenu ajasiche pangaleka mwanache, nipele njinjile majumba kuti mwaŵelechele ŵanache akulu ŵenu.” <verse eid="GEN 38:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 38:9" />Nambo che Onani ŵaimanyilile kuti ŵanache wo ngaaŵa ŵao. Nipele paŵagonaga ni ŵakongwe wo, ŵajitilaga paasi mbeju sya uŵelesi kuti akaaŵelechela mpwao ŵanache. <verse eid="GEN 38:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 38:10" />Chindu chila chaachimile Ambuje Akunnungu, nipele Ambuje Akunnungu ŵammuleje nombe che Onani. <verse eid="GEN 38:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 38:11" />Nipele che Yuda ŵaasalile che Tamali, akwegwao, “Mmuje nkatame kumusi kwa atati ŵenu, utame wa mundu jwawililwe ni ŵankwawo, mpaka pachakule mwanangu che Shela.” Ŵatite yeleyo ligongo ŵajogopaga kuti ni che Shela akajasika mpela achakulugwe. Kwayele che Tamali ŵapite kutama kwa atatigwe.<verse eid="GEN 38:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 38:12" />Pagamasile moŵa gamajinji, che Shua ŵankwawo che Yuda ŵajasiche. Pakumala malilo gala, che Yuda ŵatyosile ni ambusangagwe jwakuŵilanjikwa che Hila jwali Mwadulami, ŵaapite ku Timina kwa ŵaakukata manyunya ga ngondolo syakwe. <verse eid="GEN 38:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 38:13" />Che Tamali ŵapikene kuti akwegwao ali mwitala kwaula ku Timina kukusikata manyunya ga ngondolo syakwe. <verse eid="GEN 38:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 38:14" />Ŵausile nguo sya kuwala ŵawililwe ni achiŵankwawo ni kuliunichila shela kuti akamanyika, ŵatemi pa nnango wakwinjilila mmusi wa Enaimu, wauli pa litala lyalikwaula ku Timina. Ŵatesile yeleyo pakuŵa ŵaiweni kuti namuno che shela ŵaliji akusile waliji bado kupegwa kuti aŵe ŵankwawo.<verse eid="GEN 38:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 38:15" />Nipele che Yuda paŵasimene che Tamali pelepo, ŵaganisisye kuti ali jwankongwe jwachigwagwa, pakuŵa aliunichile kumeso. <verse eid="GEN 38:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 38:16" />Pelepo, pangaimanyilila kuti ŵelewo ŵaliji akwegwao, ŵajaulile paŵatemi mungulugulu litala, ni kwasalila, “Njise ngusaka ng'one ni mmwe.” Che Tamali ŵausisye, “Chimumbe ichichi naga chingunde?” <verse eid="GEN 38:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 38:17" />Che Yuda ŵajanjile, “Chinampe kandeembe ka mbusi ka mu lichinga lyangu.” Che Tamali ŵaasalile, “Mmiche poni kulosya kuti chimumbe kandeembe ka mbusi ko.” <verse eid="GEN 38:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 38:18" />Che Yuda ŵausisye, “Nkusaka nampe chindu chi nti poni?” Nombewo ŵajanjile, “Mumbe pete jo ni ngoji wakwe pamo ni lubokola lunkukamulila.” Kwayele ŵapele indu yose ni kugona nao, ni che Tamali ŵakwete chiilu. <verse eid="GEN 38:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 38:19" />Nipele che Tamali ŵausile ku nyuumba, ŵausile shela jila ni kutakula sooni nguo sya ŵandu ŵawililwe ni achiŵankwawo.<verse eid="GEN 38:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 38:20" />Nipele, che Yuda ŵantumile ambusangagwe jwakuŵilanjikwa che Hila jwali Mwadulami, ampelechele kandeembe ka mbusi jwankongwe jula kuti ŵauchisye indu iŵaiŵisile poni, nambo nganansimana jwankongwe jula. <verse eid="GEN 38:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 38:21" />Che Hila ŵausisye achalume ŵampepe ŵa ku Enaimu, “Alikwapi jwankongwe jwachigwagwa juŵaliji mungulugulu litala chiŵandi ni pelepa?” Ŵanjanjile, “Apano nganipaŵe ni jwankongwe jwachigwagwa.” <verse eid="GEN 38:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 38:22" />Nipele, ambusanga jula ŵausile ku che Yuda ni kwasalila, “Nganinaapata! Sooni achinsyene musi wo atite yakuti nganipaŵe ni jwankongwe jwachigwagwa jwalijose kweleko.” <verse eid="GEN 38:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 38:23" />Che Yuda ŵatite, “Munneche ajigale yele indu yo, naga ngaŵa yeleyo ŵandu chaatuseche. Mmwe mwasyene nantumile mumpelechele kandeembe ka mbusi nambo nganimunsimana.”<verse eid="GEN 38:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 38:24" />Pakumala miesi jitatu mundu jumo ŵansalile che Yuda, “Akwegwenu che Tamali aŵele jwachigwagwa ni akwete chitumbo!” Che Yuda ŵajanjile, “Muntyose paasa musi ni mummulaje kwa mooto!”<verse eid="GEN 38:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 38:25" />Paŵankoposyaga paasa musi, che Tamali ŵapeleche utenga kwa akwegwao achitiji, “Nsyene indu yi ni jwambele chitumbo chi. Kwayele nnole pete ni ngoji jakwe pamo ni lubokola lu, yaacheni.” <verse eid="GEN 38:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 38:26" />Che Yuda ŵaimanyilile indu ila, ŵatite, “Che Tamali akwete chigolochelo kumbunda une, nelepele kwalombekasya kwa che Shela mwanangu.” Kutandilila lyele lyuŵa che Yuda nganagona sooni ni che Tamali.<verse eid="GEN 38:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 38:27" />Katema ka kuligopola kwao che Tamali, yamanyiche kuti akwete maŵila. <verse eid="GEN 38:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 38:28" />Nipele, paŵaliji nkuligopola, mwanache jumo jwakopwesye nkono paasa, jwakuŵelesya ŵautaŵile uusi wechejeu achitiji, “Aju ni jwaandanda kupagwa.” <verse eid="GEN 38:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 38:29" />Nambo mwanache paŵauusisye nkono nkati, nkulugwe ŵapagwile katema kakoko. Jwakuŵelesya ŵatite, “Kwachichi nkopweche kwa machili?” Kwayele ŵawilanjikwe che Pelesi. <verse eid="GEN 38:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 38:30" />Kanyuma mpwao ŵapagwile ali ni uusi wechejeu ula munkono wakwe, ŵaŵilanjikwe che Sela.<verse eid="GEN 38:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="GEN 39" />
  <para style="s">Che Yusufu ni ŵankwakwe Potifa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 39:1" />Nipele, che Yusufu ŵanjawisye ku Misili, kweleko Potifa, juŵaliji jumo jwa achakulu ŵa ŵangondo ŵa Falao, ŵansumile kutyochela kwa Ŵaishumaeli. <verse eid="GEN 39:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 39:2" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaliji pamo ni che Yusufu, ŵantesile ajendelechele yambone mu indu yakwe. Ŵatamaga mu nyuumba ja mbujegwe Mmisili. <verse eid="GEN 39:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 39:3" />Potifa ŵaimanyilile kuti Ambuje Akunnungu akwakamusya che Yusufu ni kwakombolesya mu yose iŵaitendaga. <verse eid="GEN 39:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 39:4" />Nipele, che Yusufu ŵakundikwe paujo pa Potifa, ni kutendekwa jwakutumichila jwa nsyene Potifa, ni kwaŵika aŵe jwakwimilila nyuumba jao ni indu yose yali nayo che Potifa. <verse eid="GEN 39:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 39:5" />Kutandilila katema Potifa paŵammisile che Yusufu aŵe jwakwimilila nyuumba jakwe ni indu yose yakwete, Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaapele upile Potifa Mmisili jula ni nyuumba jao ligongo li che Yusufu. Ŵaipele upile indu yose ya panyuumba ni ya kumigunda. <verse eid="GEN 39:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 39:6" />Potifa ŵaiŵisile indu yose mmakono ga che Yusufu. Nsyene ŵaliji nkulichenjeusya ni yakulya iŵalyaga pe. Che Yusufu ŵaliji jwanchanda jwakutindigala ni jwakusalala.<verse eid="GEN 39:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 39:7" />Nipele pakupita moŵa gampepe, ŵankwakwe Potifa ŵammilile mata che Yusufu ni kunsalila, “Ngone ni une.” <verse eid="GEN 39:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 39:8" />Che Yusufu ŵakanile ni kunsalila, “Mpilikane! Achimwene jwangu ngaakulichenjeusya ni chindu chachilichose pamusi pa, yose ambele kwimilila une. <verse eid="GEN 39:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 39:9" />Pa musi pa ngapagwa ŵaali ni ulamusi kupunda undi nao une. Achimwene jwangu nganaasiŵilila chindu chachilichose ikaŵe mmwe pe, pakuŵa ndi ŵankwakwe. Sambano ngukombola chinauli kuutenda ugongomalo wanti yele ni kwaleŵela Akunnungu?” <verse eid="GEN 39:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 39:10" />Namose jwankongwe jula jwapundile kwanyenga che Yusufu moŵa gose, nambo che Yusufu nganiŵasejelela atamuno kugona nao.<verse eid="GEN 39:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 39:11" />Lyuŵa limo, Yusufu ŵajinjile munkati kukupanganya masengo gawo ni ŵakutumichila ŵane nganapagwa mu nyuumba mula. <verse eid="GEN 39:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 39:12" />Nipele, ŵankwakwe che Potifa ŵakamwile nguo ja che Yusufu ni kunsalila, “Kungone ni une.” Nambo che Yusufu ŵaalechele nguo jila mmakono mwa jwankongwe jula, ni kuutuchila paasa. <verse eid="GEN 39:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 39:13" />Jwankongwe jula paŵaiweni kuti che Yusufu alesile nguo jakwe mmakono mwao ni kuutuchila paasa, <verse eid="GEN 39:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 39:14" />ŵaaŵilasile ŵakutumichila ŵane ŵala ni kwasalila, “Munnole! Muebulania jwatujigalile ŵankwangu akutujalusya. Ajinjile munkati mu, asachileje kungamulila, nambo nagumisile. <verse eid="GEN 39:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 39:15" />Paŵapikene ngugumila, ŵalesile nguo jakwe, ni kuutuchila paasa.”<verse eid="GEN 39:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 39:16" />Nipele, jwankongwe jula ŵagosile nguo jila mpaka paŵausile ŵankwakwe. <verse eid="GEN 39:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 39:17" />Ŵaasalile ngani jila achitiji, “Jwakutumichila jwa Chiebulania jumujigalile ŵajinjile kuchuumba chetu kuti anyalusye! <verse eid="GEN 39:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 39:18" />Nambo paŵapikene njigumilaga, ŵalesile nguo jakwe ni kuutuchila paasa.” <verse eid="GEN 39:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 39:19" />Potifa paŵapikene maloŵe gaaŵechete ŵankwakwe kuti, jwakutumichila jwakwe atesile yeleyo yaachimile kwannope. <verse eid="GEN 39:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 39:20" />Potifa ŵanjigele che Yusufu ni kwaŵika mu nyuumba ja kutaŵila ŵandu ŵaŵanneŵele mwenye. Che Yusufu paŵaliji munyumba ja kutaŵilwa mula, <verse eid="GEN 39:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 39:21" />Nambo namose mu nyuumba jakutaŵilwa ŵandu mo, Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaliji pamo ni che Yusufu, ni kwatenda akundikwe paujo pa jwankulu jwa nyuumba ja kutaŵila. <verse eid="GEN 39:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 39:22" />Kwayele jwankulu jula ŵammisile che Yusufu aŵe nkulu jwa wose ŵataŵikwe mwemula ni kila chindu chichatendekwaga mwemula nganichitendekwa pangali che Yusufu kusala. <verse eid="GEN 39:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 39:23" />Jwankulu jwa nyuumba jakutaŵilwa ŵandu nganalichenjeusya sooni ni chilichose chachili mu ulamusi u che Yusufu, pakuŵa Ambuje ŵaliji pamo ni che Yusufu ni kwalongosya yose iŵaitendaga.<verse eid="GEN 39:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="GEN 40" />
  <para style="s">Che Yusufu akusagamukula sagamisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 40:1" />Pakumala moŵa gampepe, ŵakutumichila achakulu ŵaŵili ŵa mwenye jwa ku Misili, jumo jwankulu jwa ŵakugosa yakung'wa, jwine jwankulu jwa ŵakuteleka mikate ŵanneŵele mwenye jwa ku Misili. <verse eid="GEN 40:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 40:2" />Falao ŵaatumbilile ŵakutumichila achakulu ŵaŵili ŵala. <verse eid="GEN 40:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 40:3" />Ŵaataŵile mu nyuumba jakutaŵilwa ŵandu jajili mu nyuumba ja jwankulu jwa ŵangondo ŵa Falao, akula kuŵataŵikwe che Yusufu. <verse eid="GEN 40:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 40:4" />Jwankulu jwa ŵangondo ŵansagwile che Yusufu ŵaatumichile ŵakutumichila achakulu ŵaŵili ŵala, nombejo ŵaapanganyichisye masengo moŵa gose gaŵataŵikwe.<verse eid="GEN 40:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 40:5" />Lyuŵa limpepe ndaŵi ja chilo jwakugosa yakung'wa jwankulu ni jwakuteleka mikate jwankulu jwa mwenye jwa ku Misili, ŵasagamile sagamisi mu nyuumba ja kutaŵilwa mo, ni sagamisi syo syapisyangene. <verse eid="GEN 40:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 40:6" />Kundaŵi jakwe ŵaiche che Yusufu ni ŵaasimene ali apwelenje mitima. <verse eid="GEN 40:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 40:7" />Che Yusufu ŵaausisye, “Iŵele uli lelo nkuwoneka ŵakusupuka?” <verse eid="GEN 40:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 40:8" />Ŵajanjile, “Uwe tusupwiche pakuŵa tusagamile ni ngapagwa ŵaakukombola kusagamukula itusagamile.” Nipele che Yusufu ŵaasalilenje “Uli ngankumanyilila kuti kusagamukula sagamisi gali masengo ga Akunnungu? Muusalile insagamile.”<verse eid="GEN 40:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 40:9" />Nipele jwakugosa yakung'wa jwankulu jula ŵatandite kusala sagamisi jakwe, ŵatite “Pa sagamisi jangu nauweni msabibu mmbujo mwangu. <verse eid="GEN 40:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 40:10" />Msabibu wo nyambi sitatu, papopo pachatandite kusipuka masamba, wakopweche uluŵa ni isagwa yakwe yakopwesye sabibu syejiwu <verse eid="GEN 40:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 40:11" />Mmakono mwangu naliji ni chikombe cha Falao nipele nasijigele sabibu naminyile mu chikombe cho ni kwapa Falao.” <verse eid="GEN 40:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 40:12" />Che Yusufu ni ŵaasalile kuti, “Aji ni sagamukulo ja sagamisi jo, nyambi sitatu syo gelego moŵa gatatu. <verse eid="GEN 40:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 40:13" />Pakumala moŵa gatatu ga, Falao chankoposye mu nyuumba ja kutaŵilwa ŵandu ni kummuchisya pa ulamusi wenu. Chinkombole sooni kwapa Falao chikombe mmakono mwakwe mpela imwatendaga kuundanda. <verse eid="GEN 40:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 40:14" />Nambo indu pachiinjendele yambone choonde nkaandiŵalila, nkasale yankati une kwa Falao, panepa chindyoche mu chitaŵiko mu. <verse eid="GEN 40:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 40:15" />Ligongo najigalikwe kwa machili kutyochela ku chilambo cha Ŵaebulania, ni apano pa Misili nganineŵa chilichose chakundendekasya ndaŵikwe.”<verse eid="GEN 40:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 40:16" />Jwakuteleka mikate jwankulu jula paŵajiweni kuti sagamukulo jila jambone, ŵansalile che Yusufu, “Ni une nasagamile! Mu sagamisi jangu natwichile itundu itatu yaili ni mikate. <verse eid="GEN 40:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 40:17" />Pa chitundu cha pachanya mwaliji ni yakulya yakupisyangana yeteleche kwaligongo lya Falao, nambo ijuni yalyaga mu chitundu mo ndili ndwichile.” <verse eid="GEN 40:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 40:18" />Che Yusufu ŵaasalile, “Achi ni chigopolelo cha sagamisi jenu, itundu itatu ila gali moŵa gatatu. <verse eid="GEN 40:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 40:19" />Pakumala moŵa gatatu ga, Falao chankoposye mu nyuumba ja kutaŵilwa, chaukate ntwe wenu ni kunkoleka pa chitela, ijuni chiichilya minou ja chiilu chenu.”<verse eid="GEN 40:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 40:20" />Palyuŵa lyaatatu, lyele lyuŵa lyo lyaliji lyuŵa lyakukumbuchila kupagwa kwa Falao, Falao ŵakulumisye yakulya ichalye ŵakutumichila ŵakwe wose. Ŵaakopwesye mu nyuumba jakutaŵilwa ŵandu, jwankulu jwa ŵakugosa yakung'wa ni jwankulu jwa ŵakuteleka mikate, ŵaajimiche paujo pa ŵakutumichila ŵakwe ŵakulu. <verse eid="GEN 40:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 40:21" />Nipele ŵammuchisye pa masengo gakwe jwakugosa yakung'wa jwankulu kuti ŵaape Falao chikombe. <verse eid="GEN 40:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 40:22" />Nambo jwakuteleka mikate jwankulu jula ŵankoleche pa chitela mpela iŵatite kusalilwa mchigopolelo cha sagamisi jila. <verse eid="GEN 40:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 40:23" />Namose yeleyo jwakugosa yakung'wa jwankulu jula nganankumbuchila che Yusufu.<verse eid="GEN 40:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 40" />
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="GEN 41" />
  <para style="s">Che Yusufu akusagamukula sagamisi sya Falao</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 41:1" />Payapitile yaka iŵili, Falao ŵasagamile; Ali ajimi mungulugulu lusulo lwalukuŵilanjikwa Naili. <verse eid="GEN 41:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 41:2" />Ŵasiweni ng'ombe saba syakusalala ni kunakana silinkutyochela mu lusulo ni kulya manyasi <verse eid="GEN 41:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 41:3" />Nipele, syakopweche ng'ombe sine saba syakulepetala ni kuganda kutyochela mu lusulo mula, syaajimi pambali pa ng'ombe syakwimbala sila mungulugulu lusulo. <verse eid="GEN 41:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 41:4" />Nipele ng'ombe syakulepetala ni kuganda sila, syasilile asila ngo'mbe sine saba syakusalala ni kwimbala, papopo Falao ŵajimwiche. <verse eid="GEN 41:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 41:5" />Ali agonile sooni, ŵasagamile kaaŵili, ŵagaweni masache saba ga magungulo gambone ni gamakulungwa gakutumbuka mu mpesi umo. <verse eid="GEN 41:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 41:6" />Pakumala yeleyo masache gane saba gatumbwiche, gakunyilila ni gajumwile kwa mbungo ja mwipululu jajili ni ntukuta. <verse eid="GEN 41:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 41:7" />Masache saba gakunyilila gamisile masache gamakulungwa gagagumbele mbeju. Nipele Falao ŵajimwiche mu lugono ni ŵamanyilile kuti jaliji sagamisi. <verse eid="GEN 41:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 41:8" />Pakwachele Falao ŵaliji ni lipamba nnope, ŵaaŵilasile ŵaisango wose ŵa ku Misili, ni ŵalunda, ŵaasalile sagamisi syakwe, nambo ngapagwa mundu juŵakombwele kusagamukula sagamisi sila.<verse eid="GEN 41:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 41:9" />Nipele, jwakugosa yakung'wa jwankulu jula, ŵansalile Falao, “Lelo ngumbuchile ileŵo yangu. <verse eid="GEN 41:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 41:10" />Katema kala pamwatutumbilile uwe achikapolo ŵenu, une ni jwakuteleka mikate jwankulu mwatutaŵile mu nyuumba ja jwankulu jwa ŵakulindilila. <verse eid="GEN 41:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 41:11" />Chilo chimo twasagamile, sagamisi syakupisyangana, kila mundu jakwejakwe. <verse eid="GEN 41:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 41:12" />Nipele jwanchanda jwa Chieblania juŵaliji pamo ni uwe, ŵaliji jwakutumichila jwa jwankulu jwa mpingo wa ŵakulindilila jwataŵikwe pamo ni uwe, twansalile sagamisi syetu, nombejo jwatugopolele kila mundu yatite kusagamila. <verse eid="GEN 41:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 41:13" />Ni yaliji imo mpela iŵatite kusagamukula; une ŵamuchisye pa masengo gangu, nombe jwakuteleka mikate jwankulu jula ŵaulajikwe kwa kwakoleka pachitela.”<verse eid="GEN 41:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 41:14" />Nipele, Falao ŵalajisisye kuti che Yusufu aiche, ŵankopwesye mu nyuumba jakutaŵilwa ŵandu kwachitema, paŵamasile kumyola umbo ni kuwala nguo sine ŵaiche paujo pa Falao. <verse eid="GEN 41:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 41:15" />Nipele Falao ŵansalile che Yusufu, “Une sagamile, nambo ngapagwa mundu jwakukombola kugopolela malumbo gakwe. Mbilikene kuti mwasalilwaga sagamisi nkukombola kugopolela malumbo gakwe.” <verse eid="GEN 41:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 41:16" />Che Yusufu ŵajanjile, “Une ngangukombola, nambo Akunnungu chansagamukulile malumbo gakwe.” <verse eid="GEN 41:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 41:17" />Pelepo Falao ŵansalile che Yusufu, “Nasagamile ndili nyimi mungulugulu lusulo lwa Naili, <verse eid="GEN 41:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 41:18" />nasiweni ng'ombe saba syakusalala ni syakwimbala, silinkukopoka mu lusulo syaiche kulya manyasi. <verse eid="GEN 41:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 41:19" />Kanyuma syakuiye ng'ombe sine saba syakulepetala ni syakunyilila ni syakugaanda kwannope, mbaamba nganinasiwone ng'ombe syakusakala mpela syesila pa chilambo cha Misili. <verse eid="GEN 41:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 41:20" />Nipele ng'ombe syakugaanda sila syasilile syakwimbala sila. <verse eid="GEN 41:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 41:21" />Pasyamasile kusilya, ng'ombe sila nganisimanyika kuti syalile sya kwimbala, syaliji chiŵela syakuganda mpela kuundanda, pele najimwiche. <verse eid="GEN 41:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 41:22" />Sooni nasagamile sagamisi jine, nagaweni masache saba gamakulungwa gagagumbele mbeju gali gatumbwiche mu mpesi umo. <verse eid="GEN 41:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 41:23" />Pelepo gakuiye masache pe gane saba ni gakunyilila ni gagajumwile ni mbungo ja mwipululu jajili ni ntukuta. <verse eid="GEN 41:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 41:24" />Masache gakunyilila gala gamisile masache gagali ni mbeju syejinji. Naasalile ŵandu ŵaakutenda masingawombwe nambo ngapagwa jwasagamukulile.”<verse eid="GEN 41:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 41:25" />Nipele che Yusufu ŵansalile Falao, “Sagamisi syenu syose siŵili chigopolo chakwe chili chimo. Akunnungu ammunukulile alakwe Falao ichaipanganye pangakaŵa. <verse eid="GEN 41:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 41:26" />Ng'ombe saba syakusalala malumbo gakwe gali yaka saba, masache saba gagali ni mbeju syejinji malumbo gakwe yaka saba, sagamisi syanasiŵili syo mate gakwe gamo. <verse eid="GEN 41:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 41:27" />Asila ng'ombe saba syakulepetala ni syakuganda sisyakopochele kanyuma ili yaaka saba ya sala, iyoyo peyo masache saba gangali chindu ni gagajumwile ni mbungo ja mwipululu jajili ni ntukuta, ili yaaka saba ya sala. <verse eid="GEN 41:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 41:28" />Mpela aila inansalile mwenye: Akunnungu annosisye indu ichaipanganye pangakaŵa. <verse eid="GEN 41:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 41:29" />Chiiŵe yaka saba ya ŵandu ŵa chilambo cha Misili kwikuta. <verse eid="GEN 41:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 41:30" />Nambo kanyuma chiiche yaka saba ine ya sala, kwikuta kula ŵandu chachikuliŵalila. Sala chijijonanje chilambo chose cha Misili. <verse eid="GEN 41:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 41:31" />Kwikuta ko chikuliŵalikwe ligongo sala chijipunde nnope. <verse eid="GEN 41:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 41:32" />Sagamisi syenu siujile kaŵili, mwakulandana kunnosya kuti, Akunnungu aamwiwe, nombewo chachipanganye chelecho pangakaŵa.<verse eid="GEN 41:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 41:33" />“Kwayele chiiŵe ukoto Falao, munsagule mundu jwali ni umanyilisi ni jwaluunda munkamulisisye masengo ga kuchijimilila chilambo cha ku Misili. <verse eid="GEN 41:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 41:34" />Sooni Falao mwasagule ŵakwimilila ŵane ŵa pachilambo pepa, mwasalile akumbikanye magungulo kanandi ga pachilambo cha ku Misili katema kakaka ka yaka saba ya kwikuta. <verse eid="GEN 41:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 41:35" />Mwalajisye ŵakwimilila wo akumbikanye magungulo gose mu yaka saba ga magungulo gamajinji gaŵe mu umwenye wenu alakwe Falao, gaŵe mbiko mmisi jose, ni ŵanyawo agose magungulo go. <verse eid="GEN 41:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 41:36" />Yakulya yo chiŵe mbiko ja kulilolechesya kwaligongo lya chilambo, chiligwe katema ka yaka saba ya sala yaikwika kuti ŵandu akawa ni sala.”<verse eid="GEN 41:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yusufu akupata ukulu mu chilambo cha Misili.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 41:37" />Liloŵe li che Yusufu lyaoneche kuŵa lyambone paujo pa Falao ni achakulu ŵakwe. <verse eid="GEN 41:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 41:38" />Nipele Falao ŵausisye achikatumetume ŵakwe, “Chitumpate kwapi mundu mpela aju jwali ni mbumu jwa Akunnungu?” <verse eid="GEN 41:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 41:39" />Falao ŵansalile che Yusufu, “Pakuŵa Akunnungu ammunukulile aga gose, ngapagwa mundu jwali ni umanyilisi ni luunda mpela mmwe. <verse eid="GEN 41:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 41:40" />Chimme mundu jwankulu muchilambo changu, ŵandu ŵangu wose chagajitichisye malajisyo genu, nambo mu umwenye une chime jwankulu kumpunda mmwe. <verse eid="GEN 41:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 41:41" />Nipele ngunsagula mme jwankulu jwa chilambo chose cha Misili.” <verse eid="GEN 41:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 41:42" />Falao ŵaausile pete mu chala chakwe jajili ni chimanyisyo ni kwawasya che Yusufu, sooni ŵammwasisye yakuwala yeswela mbee ni nkufu wa sahabu pa lukosi pakwe. <verse eid="GEN 41:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 41:43" />Ŵankwesisye mu mutuka jakwe jaaŵili jachimwenye jajikukwekwelemya ni chinyama chachikuŵilanjikwa falasi ni ŵakulindilila ŵalongolele mmbujo mu che Yusufu achinyanyisyaga kuti, “Ntupisye mwitala!” Yele ni iŵaitesile che Falao pakwaŵika che Yusufu aŵe jwankulu muchilambo cha ku Misili. <verse eid="GEN 41:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 41:44" />Falao ŵansalile che Yusufu, “Uneji Falao, nguti pangali liloŵe lyenu ngasapagwa mundu jwalijose juchapanganye chindu chilichose pa Misili.” <verse eid="GEN 41:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 41:45" />Falao ŵaapele che Yusufu lina lya ku Misili, Safenath Panea. Ŵaalombekasisye Asenati mwali jwa che Potifela jwambopesi jwa musi wa ku Oni. Nipele che Yusufu ŵajimajimile mu chilambo chose cha ku Misili.<verse eid="GEN 41:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 41:46" />Che Yusufu ŵaliji ni yaaka selasini paŵatandite kuntumichila Falao, ŵatyosile mu nyuumba ja Falao ni kwaula kwimajima mu chilambo chose cha ku Misili. <verse eid="GEN 41:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 41:47" />Ni yaliji, aila yaka saba ya kwikuta migunda jose ja ku Misili jaliji ni magungulo gamajinji nnope. <verse eid="GEN 41:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 41:48" />Che Yusufu ŵakumbikenye yakulya yose iŵagungwile pa katema ka aila yaka saba, ni kugosa mbiko mu misi ja ku Misili. Pa musi uliwose ŵaŵisile mbiko ja yakulya kutyochela mu migunda jajiŵandikene ni musi wo. <verse eid="GEN 41:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 41:49" />Che Yusufu ŵagosile magungulo gamajinji nnope, gangapimika mpela nsanga wa mu bahali.<verse eid="GEN 41:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 41:50" />Ikanaŵe kutanda yaka ya sala, Asenati mwali jwa che Potifela, jwambopesi jwa musi wa Oni, ŵaaŵelechele che Yusufu ŵanache ŵaŵili ŵachilume. <verse eid="GEN 41:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 41:51" />Mwanagwe jwa kwitiwo ŵammilasile Manase, malumbo gakwe “Akunnungu andiŵesye kulaga kwangu ni achalongo ŵa atati ŵangu.” <verse eid="GEN 41:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 41:52" />Mwanache jwaŵili ŵammmilasile che Eflaimu, malumbo gakwe “Akunnungu ambele ŵanache mu chilambo chinalasile.”<verse eid="GEN 41:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 41:53" />Yaka saba ya ŵandu ŵa ku Misili kwikuta ila yamasile. <verse eid="GEN 41:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 41:54" />Yatandite yaka saba ya sala mpela iŵatite kusala che Yusufu kuundanda. Ilambo ine yose yaliji ni sala, nambo ku Misili kwaliji ni yakulya. <verse eid="GEN 41:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 41:55" />Ŵandu ŵa ku Misili paŵatandite kujiona sala ŵaalilile che Falao ŵape chakulya. Nombejo ŵajanjile kuti, “Mwajaulile che Yusufu, chilichose chichansalile, ntendanje.” <verse eid="GEN 41:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="GEN 41:56" />Sala jekulungwa jajenele mu chilambo chose cha ku Misili, kwayele che Yusufu ŵasiugwile ngokwe syose ni kwasumichisya yakulya ŵandu ŵa ku Misili, sala japundile kuŵa jekulungwa nnope mu chilambo chose cha ku Misili. <verse eid="GEN 41:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="GEN 41:57" />Kupunda yeleyo, ŵandu ŵa ilambo yejinji ŵaiche ku Misili ku che Yusufu kukusuma yakulya pakuŵa sala jaliji jekulungwa pa ilambo yose.<verse eid="GEN 41:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 41" />
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="GEN 42" />
  <para style="s">Achalongo achinjakwe che Yusufu akwaula ku Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 42:1" />Katema che Yakubu kaŵapilikene kuti, ku Misili kwana yakulya yejinji, ŵaasalile achiŵanagwe, “Uli nteminji ngoliloo?” <verse eid="GEN 42:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 42:2" />Ŵajendelechele kwasalila, “Mbilikene ku Misili kwana yakulya yejinji. Ntuluchile kweleko nkasume yakulya kuti tukawa sala.” <verse eid="GEN 42:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 42:3" />Kwayele achapwakwe kumi ŵa che Yusufu ŵatuluchile ku Misili kukusuma yakulya. <verse eid="GEN 42:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 42:4" />Nambo che Yakubu nganiŵalechelela che Benjamini mpwakwe che Yusufu, kuti ajaule pamo ni ŵanyawo ligongo ŵajogwepe chichaapata yangalumbana. <verse eid="GEN 42:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 42:5" />Nipele ŵanache ŵa che Yakubu ŵaliji nkutule umo ni ŵandu ŵaŵajawile ku Misili kukusuma yakulya, pakuŵa sala jekulungwa jajenele mpaka ku Kanaani.<verse eid="GEN 42:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 42:6" />Kele katema ko che Yusufu ŵaliji jwankulu jwa chilambo chose cha ku Misili, ni juŵasumisyaga yakulya. Achalongo achinjakwe paŵaiche ni kummona che Yusufu ŵatindiŵele ni kwakotamila. <verse eid="GEN 42:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 42:7" />Papopo che Yusufu paŵaweni achalongo achinjakwe ŵatesile mpela ngakwamanyilila, ŵaŵechete nao kwa maloŵe ga kukalipa, ŵasalile, “Nkutyochela kwapi ŵanyamwe?” Ŵaajanjile, “Tutyochele ku chilambo cha ku Kanaani, tuiche kukusuma yakulya.” <verse eid="GEN 42:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 42:8" />Che Yusufu ŵaamanyilile achalongo achinjakwe, nambo ŵanyawo nganammanyilila. <verse eid="GEN 42:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 42:9" />Nipele Che Yusufu ŵasikumbuchile sagamisi siŵasagamile syankati achalongo achinjakwe, ŵaasalile kuti, “Ŵanyamwe nli ŵakuuchilichisya, nnyiche kukuuchilichisya kuti mmanyilile iŵaga chilambo chetu changali machili ga ngondo kuti ntujimuchile.” <verse eid="GEN 42:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 42:10" />Ŵanya ŵala ŵaajanjile, “Ngaŵa yele achimwene, uwe achikapolo ŵenu tuiche kukusuma yakulya. <verse eid="GEN 42:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 42:11" />Uwe wose ŵanache ŵa mundu jumo, atati ŵetu ali ŵamo. Uwe tuli ŵakukulupilichika, nganituika kukuuchilichisya ya ngondo.”<verse eid="GEN 42:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 42:12" />Che Yusufu ŵaajanjile, “Unami! Nnyichenje kukuuchilichisya nnole iŵaga nganitukola machili.”<verse eid="GEN 42:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 42:13" />Ŵaasalile “Uwe achikapolo ŵenu tuli kumi na mbili ŵanache ŵa mundu jumo jwa ku Kanaani. Mpwetu asigele kumusi ni atati, mpwetu jwine ŵajasiche.”<verse eid="GEN 42:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 42:14" />Nambo che Yusufu ŵajanjile, “Mpela indite pakunsalila, ŵanyamwe nnyiche kukuuchilichisya pe. <verse eid="GEN 42:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 42:15" />Chinantende yeleyi, ngulumbilila kwa liina lyao Falao ngantyokanga apano mpaka aiche mpwenu jwannandi jo. <verse eid="GEN 42:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 42:16" />Munnajisye jumo ajaule akanjigale mpwenu jo, ŵane chinantaŵe munyuumba ja kutaŵilwa ŵandu. Pele chiimanyiche yaili isyene. Iŵaga ngaŵa yele, ngulumbilila kwa liina lyao Falao, nnyiiche kukuuchilichisya pe.” <verse eid="GEN 42:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 42:17" />Nipele ŵaaugalile munyuumba ja kutaŵilwa ŵandu kwa moŵa gatatu.<verse eid="GEN 42:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 42:18" />Pa lyuŵa lyaatatu che Yusufu ŵaasalile ŵandu ŵala kuti, “Pakuŵa nne ngwajogopa Akunnungu, ntende yele chinkole umi. <verse eid="GEN 42:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 42:19" />Iŵaga ŵanyamwe nli ŵakukulupilichika, jumo jwenu asigale muchitaŵiko, ni ŵane ajigale yakulya ŵaapelechele achalongo ŵenu ŵaakusaukanga ni sala. <verse eid="GEN 42:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 42:20" />Mpwenu jo nkanjise nao kukwangu pele chiimanyiche kuti maloŵe genu gala galiji gasyene, ngulumbila ngammwa.” Ŵanya ŵala ŵajitichisye ni kupanganya yeila. <verse eid="GEN 42:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 42:21" />Nipele ŵasalilene achinsyene pe, “Isyene pelepa tukusauka ligongo twanneŵele mpwetu, twammweni alinkulilasika mu ntima mwakwe nambo uwe nganituntendela chanasa namuno ali ŵaatuchondelele kuti alamye umi wakwe, ni pelepa tukulaga kwa ligongo lyakwe.”<verse eid="GEN 42:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 42:22" />Che Lubeni ŵaajanjile, “Uli nganinansalilanga kuti kasimuntendela yangalumbana jwanchanda ju? Nambo nganingakamula maloŵe gangu, sambano nnole tukwamukwa kwaligongo lyakummulaga.” <verse eid="GEN 42:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 42:23" />Ŵanyawo nganaimanya kuti che Yusufu akumanyilila yaakuŵecheta ila, pakuŵa paliji ni mundu jwa kusagamukula chiŵecheto. <verse eid="GEN 42:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 42:24" />Che Yusufu ŵalisapwile ni kwaula pachisyepela ni kutanda kulila, nipele ŵausile ni kukunguluka nao sooni, nipele ŵankamwile che Simeoni ni kuntaŵa magwedegwede paujo pa wose.<verse eid="GEN 42:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Achalongo ŵa che Yusufu akuuja ku Kanaani.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 42:25" />Che Yusufu ŵalajisye kuti magunia ga ŵandu ŵala gagumbasikwe yakulya, ni kila mundu ŵaauchisye mbiya siŵatyosisye, ŵaaŵichile mmagunia pemo, ŵaape sooni chakulya cha masulufu gao. <verse eid="GEN 42:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 42:26" />Ŵaitwichile mbunda misigo jao ja magungulo ni wajawilenje. <verse eid="GEN 42:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 42:27" />Paŵaiche paakugona achalendo, mundu jumo pasikati jawo ŵaugwile ligunia lyakwe kuti apakombole kujilisya mbunda jakwe, nambo ŵasimosile paŵasiweni mbiya syakwe sila sili kukang'wa kwa ligunia lyakwe. <verse eid="GEN 42:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 42:28" />Nipele ŵaasalile achapwakwe achitiji, “Mbiya syangu amuchisye asi sili pakang'wa pa ligunia lyangu.” Paŵapilikene maloŵe gala ŵapwelenje mitima. Ŵagambile kulolegana pe alinkutetemela ni kuusyana, “Ana chindu chachi achino chatutendele Akunnungu?”<verse eid="GEN 42:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 42:29" />Paŵaiche kuchilambo cha Kanaani kwa atati ŵao che Yakubu, ŵaatanjile yose iyatendekwe mu ulendo wao, ŵatite, <verse eid="GEN 42:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 42:30" />“Jwankulu jwa chilambo chila ŵatuŵechetele kwa ching'ang'a ni ŵatuweni nti ŵandu ŵatujawile kukuuchilichisya chilambo chao. <verse eid="GEN 42:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 42:31" />Nambo twansalile kuti, ‘Uweji tuli ŵandu ŵa kukulupilichika, nganituŵa ŵakuuchilichisya.’ <verse eid="GEN 42:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 42:32" />Twajendelechele kwasalila kuti, ‘Muchipago chetu tuli kumi na mbili atati ŵetu ŵamo, jumo jwetu ŵajasiche ni jwine jwannandi ali kumusi kuchilambo cha ku Kanaani pamo ni atati ŵetu.’ <verse eid="GEN 42:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 42:33" />Mundu jula, ali jwankulu jwa chilambo, ŵatusalile, ‘Chininje ni chinaimanyilile kuti mwanyamwe nndi ŵandu ŵakukulupilichika. Mpwenu jumo munneche kukwangu, ŵane nkajigale chakulya, mwapelechele achalongo ŵenu ŵaali ni sala. <verse eid="GEN 42:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 42:34" />Nipele munnyichenawo kukwangu mpwenu jwali jwannondi, pelepo ni pachimanyilile kuti mwanyamwe ngaŵa ŵandu ŵa kuuchilichisya chilambo chetu nambo nlinji ŵakukulupilichika. Iŵaga chintende yeleyo chinannechelesye mpwenu jo, nombe mwanyamwe chintende malonda palipose mchilambo muno.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 42:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 42:35" />Katema paŵakusulaga yakulya mmagunia gao, ŵasimosile paŵaiweni kuti ŵauchisye kila mundu nsaku wakwe wa mbiya mu ligunia lyakwe. Paŵaiweni yeleyo wose pamo ni atati ŵao ŵajogwepe kwannope. <verse eid="GEN 42:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 42:36" />Atati ŵao jwakuŵilanjikwa che Yakubu ŵaasalile, “Nkuusumula achiŵanangu! Che Yusufu nganapagwa ni che Simeoni nganapagwa, sambano nkusaka kwajigala che Benjamini. Yoseyo iimbatile une!”<verse eid="GEN 42:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 42:37" />Pele che Lubeni ŵaasalile atatigwe, “Munleche che Benjamini nnyala mwangu none chinangose ni chinjausya kukwenu, iŵaga ngangummusya che Benjamini mwaulaje achiŵanangu ŵaŵili.” <verse eid="GEN 42:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 42:38" />Nambo atatigwe ŵajanjile, “Mwanangu ngaajaula ulendo umo ni mwanyamwe, nkulugwe ajasiche, nombejo asigele jikape, none njekulwipe jwana uli muntwe too! Iŵaga nchanda jo chiinsimane yangalumbana mu ulendo mo, chimwe ligongo lya kusupuka.”<verse eid="GEN 42:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 42" />
  <chapter number="43" style="c" sid="GEN 43" />
  <para style="s">Che Benjamini akwaula ku Misili ni achapwakwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 43:1" />Mu chilambo cha Kanaani sala jajendelechele kuŵa jekulungwa kwannope. <verse eid="GEN 43:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 43:2" />Pachamasile chakulya chiŵachisumile ku Misili kula, che Yakubu ŵaasalile achiŵanagwe, “Njaule sooni ku Misili, nkatusumile yakulya kanandi.”<verse eid="GEN 43:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 43:3" />Nambo che Yuda ŵaasalile atatigwe ŵala kuti, “Mundu jula ŵatujamwiche kwa ching'ang'a achitiji, ‘Ngasinampochela sooni iŵaga ngannyika ni mpwenu jwannandi.’ <verse eid="GEN 43:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 43:4" />Iŵaga nkukunda kuti mpwetu ajaule pamo ni uwe, tutujaule kunsumila yakulya. <verse eid="GEN 43:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 43:5" />Nambo iŵaga ngankunda ajaule ni uwe, noweji ngatutuluka kwaula kweleko, pakuŵa mundu jula ŵatusalile, ‘Ngasinampochela sooni iwaga ngannyika ni mpwenu jwannandi.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 43:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 43:6" />Che Yakubu ŵausisye, “Kwachichi munyinjisye nkusauka kwanti nyi pakunsalila mundu jo kuti nkwete mpwenu jwine?”<verse eid="GEN 43:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 43:7" />Ŵanyawo ŵanjanjile, “Mundu jo ŵatuuchilichisye kwannope ngani syetu ni sya achalongo achinjetu, ŵatite, ‘Uli atati wenu ali chiwela ŵajumi? Uli nkwete mpwenu jwine?’ Kwayele twanjanjile malinga ni iŵatite kutuusya. Tukaimanyilile chinauli kuti chatusalile, ‘Munnyichenawo mpwenu jwannandi pelepa?’ ”<verse eid="GEN 43:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 43:8" />Che Yuda ŵaasalile che Yakubu atatigwe, “Mumbe une nchanda ju kuti tukakaŵa kwaula, kuti mmwe atati ni uwe ni ŵanache ŵetu tukawa ni sala. <verse eid="GEN 43:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 43:9" />Une nansyene chime poni jawo, ŵalakwe mudai une. Iŵaga une ngangummusya kukwenu ni mmwe kwawona kwa meeso genu, chime jwalaumika paujo penu mu umi wangu wose. <verse eid="GEN 43:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 43:10" />Ngatukakaŵe, sambano tukaliji tuli tujawile ni kuuja kaŵili.”<verse eid="GEN 43:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 43:11" />Nipele che Yakubu atati ŵao ŵaasalile, “Iŵaga yeleyo ni yaikusachilwa kuŵa, ayaga, ntendeje yeleyo. Patinjaule njigalanje isogosi yambone nnope ya mchilambo muno mmagunia genu, nkampe ntuuka mundu jo. Munjigalile mauta ga ukwesu kanandi ni uchi kanandi ni ubani ni manemane ni kungumanga ni ngangaula. <verse eid="GEN 43:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 43:12" />Njigalanje mbiya syejinji pakuŵa chinsiusye asila mbiya sisyasimanikwe mmagunia mwenu sila, panepa syaŵichikwe mmagunia mo pangaŵanichisya. <verse eid="GEN 43:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 43:13" />Munjigale mpwenu ju ntyochanje njaule kwa mundu jo. <verse eid="GEN 43:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 43:14" />Akunnungu jwaukombole wose antendele chanasa paujo pa mundu jo kuti akannechelele mpwenu jula ni che Benjamini. Kwangu une iŵaga kuli kuwililwa ni achiŵanangu, ayaga, nambi tindende uli!”<verse eid="GEN 43:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 43:15" />Nipele, ŵandu ŵala ŵajigele mituka jila ni mbiya syasijinji, ŵanjigele sooni che Benjamini. Ni watandite ulendo mwanja ku Misili. Paŵaiche, wajawile ni kwima paujo pa che Yusufu. <verse eid="GEN 43:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 43:16" />Che Yusufu pawammweni che Benjamini ali pamo nawo, ŵansalile jwakwimilila nyuumba jakwe “Mwajausye ŵandu ŵa ku nyuumba kwangu, nkachisikite chinyama, nkachilinganye chakulya pakuŵa chalye ni une muusi uno.” <verse eid="GEN 43:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 43:17" />Jwakwimilila jula ŵatesile mpela iŵasalilwe ni che Yusufu, ŵaajawisye ŵandu ŵala ku nyuumba ji che Yusufu.<verse eid="GEN 43:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 43:18" />Ŵandu ŵala paŵaiweni kuti ŵaajawisye ku nyuumba ji che Yusufu ŵajogwepe, ni ŵaliji nkuganisya kuti, “Atuichisye akuno ligongo lya mbiya siŵasiuchisye mmisaku jetu pa ulendo waandanda ula. Akusaka kutuguluchila ni kutupunda, asijigale mbunda syetu ni kututenda achikapolo ŵakwe.” <verse eid="GEN 43:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 43:19" />Kwayele ŵansejelele jwakwimilila nyuumba ji che Yusufu jula, ŵakungulwiche nao ali pannango wa nyuumba. <verse eid="GEN 43:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 43:20" />Ŵatite, “Achimwene, choonde, uweji twaiche pelepa kaandanda kukusuma yakulya. <verse eid="GEN 43:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 43:21" />Nambo patwaiche pakugona achalendo mwitala mo, twaugwile magunia getu, ni twasimonjile kusimana mbiya sya kila jumo jwetu kukang'wa kwa ligunia lyakwe. Sambano tujigele mbiya syo kuusya. <verse eid="GEN 43:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 43:22" />Sooni tuiche ni mbiya sine syakuti tusume yakulya. Ngatukummanyilila juŵaŵisile mbiya syo mmagunia mwetu.”<verse eid="GEN 43:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 43:23" />Jwakwimilila jula ŵaasalile, “Yambone, nkajogopa. Akunnungu jwenu, Akunnungu jwa atati ŵenu ni juŵaŵisile mbiya mmagunia mwenu. Uneji napochele mbiya syenu.” Jwakwimilila jula ŵankopwesye che Simeoni ni kunnyika nawo paŵaliji ŵanyawo.<verse eid="GEN 43:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 43:24" />Jwakwimilila jula ŵaajinjisye ŵandu ŵala mu nyuumba ji che Yusufu, ŵaapele mesi ga kulikunda mmakongolo ni kusilisya mbunda syao. <verse eid="GEN 43:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 43:25" />Ni ŵanyawo ŵaŵisile chile mituuka jao kuti ŵaape che Yusufu pataiche, pakuŵa ŵapilikene kuti chalye pamo nawo. <verse eid="GEN 43:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 43:26" />Che Yusufu paŵaiche pamusi, achalongo achinjakwe wala wampele ajila mituuka jiŵaliji nawo, ni ŵantindiŵalile ni kwajinamila. <verse eid="GEN 43:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 43:27" />Che Yusufu ŵaakomasisye, nipele ŵausisye kuti, “Ana atati ŵenu ŵamwasalile kuti achekulwipe ŵala, ali uli? Ana ali ŵajumi?”<verse eid="GEN 43:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 43:28" />Ŵanjanjile, “Jwakutumichila jwenu atati ŵetu ali chiwela ŵajumi ni sooni akwendelechela chenene.” Nipele ŵantindiŵalile ni kwajinamila kwa kwachimbichisya.<verse eid="GEN 43:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 43:29" />Che Yusufu paŵammweni che Benjamini mpwakwe, mpwakwe jwa lutumbo lumo, ŵausisye, “Ana ajuju ni mpwenu jwambesi jumwasalile ngani syakwe jula. Akunnungu ampe upile mwanangu.” <verse eid="GEN 43:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 43:30" />Che Yusufu watyosile kwachitema ligongo ŵasakaga kulila pakuŵa muntima mwakwe ŵannajilaga mpwakwe jula, ni ŵajinjile mu chuumba mwakwe ni kulila mwelemo. <verse eid="GEN 43:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 43:31" />Paŵamasile kulila ŵapukwite misosi ni kukopoka paasa, ŵalilimbisye ntima ni kulajisya aichenacho chakulya. <verse eid="GEN 43:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 43:32" />Che Yusufu ŵaaŵichile pajikape, ni achalongo achinjakwe ŵala ŵaaŵichile achinsyenepe ni Ŵamisili ŵaŵalyaga pamo nawo ŵaaŵichile achinsyenepe pakuŵa Ŵamisili ngaakulya pamo ni Ŵaebulania, ligongo kwa Ŵamisili yaliji uchimwa kulya ni Ŵaebulania. <verse eid="GEN 43:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 43:33" />Achalongo ŵakwe che Yusufu ŵala ŵatemi paujo pa che Yusufu malinga ni iŵatite pakupagwa, kutandilila jwakwitiwo mpaka jwa mbesi. Achalongo ŵala paŵalolite iŵatite pakwatamika, ŵasimonjile ni ŵagambaga kulolegana. <verse eid="GEN 43:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 43:34" />Yakulya iŵalyaga yajigalikwaga kutyochela pa mesa ji che Yusufu ni kwajauchisya, nambo che Benjamini ŵampele kasano kwapunda ŵanawose ŵane. Nipele ŵalile ni kung'wa pamo ni che Yusufu ni kusangalala.<verse eid="GEN 43:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 43" />
  <chapter number="44" style="c" sid="GEN 44" />
  <para style="s">Chikombe chikusoŵa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 44:1" />Nipele che Yusufu ŵampele malajisyo jwakwimilila nyuumba jakwe jula kuti, “Ngumbasye magunia ga ŵandu ŵa yakulya ichakombole kutwichila, mmiche ni mbiya ja kila mundu ku kang'wa kwa ligunia lyakwe. <verse eid="GEN 44:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 44:2" />Mmiche chikombe changu, chachikolochekwe kwa madini ga feza, ku kang'wa kwa ligunia lya mpwao jwannandi pamo ni mbiya jakwe.” Jwakwimilila jula ŵatesile mpela muŵasalilwe ni che Yusufu. <verse eid="GEN 44:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 44:3" />Kuninkucha, ŵandu ŵala ŵaalesile kuti aujile kumangwawo pamo ni mbunda syao. <verse eid="GEN 44:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 44:4" />Ali ajeesile kwakutalichila kanondi kutyochela pa musi, che Yusufu ŵansalile jwakwimilila nyuumba jakwe, “Njanguye, mwakuye ŵandu ŵala, ni patinkaasimane, nkaausye kuti, ‘Uli, nkuntendela yangalumbana mundu jwati antendele yambone? <verse eid="GEN 44:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 44:5" />Kwachichi njiiŵile chikombe chaakung'welela achimwene jwangu! Chelecho chili chikombe chaakulondolela. Ntesile indu yakusakala kwannope!’ ”<verse eid="GEN 44:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 44:6" />Jwakwimilila jula paŵaasimene ŵandu ŵala ŵaatanjile maloŵe gaŵasalilwe ni che Yusufu gala. <verse eid="GEN 44:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 44:7" />Ŵanyawo ŵanjanjile “Achimwene, kwachichi nkuŵecheta maloŵe ganti yeleyo? Uwe ŵakutumichila ŵenu ngakombola kutenda chindu chanti yeleyo! <verse eid="GEN 44:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 44:8" />Nkumbuchile, achimwene, mbiya sitwasisimene ku kang'wa kwa magunia getu twasijigele kuusya kutyochela ku Kanaani. Ikukomboleka chinauli sooni uwe tujiŵe feza pane sahabu mu nyuumba ja achimwene jwenu? <verse eid="GEN 44:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 44:9" />Iŵaga apali jwakusimanikwa ni chikombe cho, aulajikwe, ni uwe ŵane chituŵe achikapolo ŵenu.”<verse eid="GEN 44:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 44:10" />Jwakwimilila jula ŵajanjile, “Yambone, iŵeje mpela intite pakuŵecheta. Julijose juchasimanikwe ni chikombe cho chaŵe kapolo jwangu, nambo ŵane wosepe chinnechelelwe njaulangane.” <verse eid="GEN 44:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 44:11" />Jwalijose ŵachelengaga kutuluchisya ligunia lyakwe paasi ni kuugula. <verse eid="GEN 44:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 44:12" />Jwakwimilila jula ŵagalolesya mmagunia gala kutandilila ligunia lya jwankulungwa jwao kumalichisya kwa jwannandi nnope. Chikombe chila ŵachisimene mu ligunia li che Benjamini. <verse eid="GEN 44:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 44:13" />Achalongo wala ŵapapwile yakuwala yao kulosya kuti akusupuka, kila mundu ŵantwichile mbunda jakwe msigo wakwe, ni kuujila ku musi.<verse eid="GEN 44:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 44:14" />Che Yuda ni achapwakwe paŵaiche ku nyuumba ji che Yusufu, che Yusufu ŵaliji nganatyoche pamusi, ni ŵantindiŵalile ni kwajinamila kwakwachimbichisya. <verse eid="GEN 44:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 44:15" />Che Yusufu ŵausisye, “Kwachichi ntesile yeleyi? Ngankumanyilila kuti mundu mpela une ngukombola kumanyilila indu kwa kulondola?”<verse eid="GEN 44:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 44:16" />Che Yuda ŵajanjile, “Ana tutuŵechete ichichi kwa alakwe achimwene? Ana tuŵechete ichichi kulosya kuti nganitukola chileŵo? Pangali chakuŵecheta sooni kuti tulichenjele. Akunnungu alosisye ileŵo yetu uweji ŵakutumichila ŵenu. Sambano uweji wose tuli achikapolo ŵenu, uweji pamo ni ajula jwasimanikwe ni chikombe chenu.” <verse eid="GEN 44:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 44:17" />Nambo che Yusufu ŵatite, “Ngwamba! Une ngatenda yeleyo! Mundu jwasimanikwe ni chikombe cho ni jutaŵe kapolo jwangu. Mwanya ŵane njaule kwa atati ŵenu mu chitendewele.”<verse eid="GEN 44:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yuda akunchenjela che Benjamini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 44:18" />Pelepo che Yuda ŵansejelele che Yusufu ni kunsalila, “Choonde achimwene, nkunde une jwakutumichila jwenu nalichenjele paujo penu, choonde nkaandumbilila, pakuŵa alakwe nkwete ulamusi mpela mwaŵelele che Falao asyene. <verse eid="GEN 44:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 44:19" />Alakwe achimwene mwatuwusisye nchitiji, ‘Nkwete atati pane mpwenu jwine?’ <verse eid="GEN 44:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 44:20" />Ni uweji twanjanjile, ‘Tukwete atati ŵetu nambo achekulwipe, ni sooni tukwete mpwetu jwannandi, mwanache jwa kuuchekulu wao atati wetu. Nkulugwe jwa mpwetu jo ŵawile, sooni jwalakwe pejo ni jwasigele mwiŵele lya achikulugwe, ni kuti sooni atati ŵetu akunnonyela kwannope.’ <verse eid="GEN 44:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 44:21" />Achimwene mwatusalile uwe ŵakutumichila ŵenu kuti tunnyichenawo mpwetu jo kuti munnole. <verse eid="GEN 44:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 44:22" />Ni uweji twansalile achimwene kuti nchanda jo ngaakombola kwaleka jika atatigwe, ligongo atendaga yeleyo atatigwe chachiwa. <verse eid="GEN 44:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 44:23" />Nambo alakwe achimwene mwatusalile, ‘Ngasinampochela sooni iŵaga ngannyika ni mpwenu jwannandi jo.’<verse eid="GEN 44:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 44:24" />“Patuusile kwa kapolo jwenu, atati ŵetu, twansalile imwatite kutusalila. <verse eid="GEN 44:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 44:25" />Nipele atati wetu pawatusalile tuujile akuno kukusuma yakulya ine, <verse eid="GEN 44:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 44:26" />uwe twansalile, ‘Ngatujaula, nambo iwaga mpwetu jwannandi akwaula nowe tutujaule, ligongo mundu jula ngasatupochela iŵaga mpwetu jwannandi ngaajaula pamo ni uwe.’ <verse eid="GEN 44:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 44:27" />Kapolo jwenu, atati ŵetu ŵatusalile, ‘Nkumanyilila kuti ŵankwangu che Laheli ŵaamelechele ŵanache achalume ŵaŵili pe. <verse eid="GEN 44:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 44:28" />Jumo ŵapotele, ni une natite, kusyene akamwilwe ni inyama chachikali pakuŵa nganinammona sooni kutandilila lyuŵa liŵatyosile. <verse eid="GEN 44:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 44:29" />Iŵaga nkunjigala ajuju nombe yansimanaga yangalumba, ni kuti une muuchekulu wu tinjiwa kwa usupuche.’<verse eid="GEN 44:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 44:30" />“Nipele sambano iŵaga nguujila kwa atati ŵangu jwakutumichila jwenu pangali nchanda ju, jwakunnonyela nnope, <verse eid="GEN 44:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 44:31" />pachakaiwone kuti nchanda ju nganaŵa pamo ni uwe, chawe, kwayele uwe ŵakutumichila ŵenu chitwaulaje atati ŵetu kwa usupuche <verse eid="GEN 44:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 44:32" />Une kapolo jwenu naliŵisile poni kwa atati ŵangu ligongo lya nchanda ju. Naasalile atati ŵangu wo kuti, ‘Iŵaga ngangummusya nchanda ju kukwenu chime jwalaumika paujo penu atati ŵangu mu umi wangu wose.’ <verse eid="GEN 44:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 44:33" />Nipele, sambano alakwe achimwene ngunchondelela, nkunde kuti une sigale kunokuno, me kapolo jwenu pamalo pa nchanda ju, munneche nchanda ju auje pamo ni achakulugwe. <verse eid="GEN 44:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 44:34" />Chingombole chinauli kwaula kwa atati wangu pangali nchanda ju? Uneji ngangukombola kupililila kwiwona yangalumbana ichinsimane atati wangu.”<verse eid="GEN 44:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 44" />
  <chapter number="45" style="c" sid="GEN 45" />
  <para style="s">Che Yusufu akulimanyukusya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 45:1" />Pelepo che Yusufu ŵalepele kulisiŵila paujo pa ŵandu uŵalongene nao, ŵanyanyisye achitiji “Ŵandu wose ajaule paasa.” Nipele che Yusufu ŵalimanyukwisye kwa achakulu ŵakwe pangapagwa ŵandu ŵane. <verse eid="GEN 45:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 45:2" />Nambo ŵalisile mwakupikanika mwakuti ŵandu ŵa ku Misili ŵampilikene, ni ŵandu ŵa mu nyuumba ja Falao ŵalipilikene nombe. <verse eid="GEN 45:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 45:3" />Che Yusufu ŵaasalile achakulu wakwe, “Une ndili che Yusufu, atati ŵangu ali jwanjumi?” Nambo achakulu ŵakwe ŵagambile jasaa paujo pao ni kulepela kwajanga pakuŵa ŵakamwilwe ni lipamba. <verse eid="GEN 45:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 45:4" />Nipele che Yusufu ŵaasalile achakulu ŵakwe, “Choonde mumandichile.” Paŵaŵandichile ŵaasalile, “Uneji ndili mpwenu che Yusufu umwasumisye ku Misili. <verse eid="GEN 45:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 45:5" />Nambo sambano nkajogopa atamuno kuŵechetana mwachinsyene kwa kuusumisya. Usyene, Akunnungu ambeleche akuno nannongolele kuti ngombole kuukulupusya umi wenu. <verse eid="GEN 45:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 45:6" />Achino chili chaka chaaŵili cha sala pachilambo pa ni kwana sala yaka yiine nsano yaikwika, ichiiŵe pangali yakupanda namose kugungula. <verse eid="GEN 45:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 45:7" />Akunnungu ambeleche akuno nannongolele kuti naugose umi wenu nsigalile ŵajumi pa chilambo chi ni kummombola kwa chiŵombosyo chekulungwa. <verse eid="GEN 45:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 45:8" />Kwayele ngaŵa ŵanyamwe umumbeleche une akuno, nambo Akunnungu ambeleche akuno. Andesile kuŵa atati kwa Falao, ni jwakwimilila jwankulu jwa nyuumba jao, ni jwakutawala chilambo choose cha Misili.<verse eid="GEN 45:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 45:9" />“Nipele, njanguye, njaulanje kwa atati nkaasalile, che Yusufu nchanda jwenu akuti, ‘Akunnungu andesile me jwankulu jwa chilambo chose cha Misili. Nipele nkakaŵa kwika akuno kundi une. <verse eid="GEN 45:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 45:10" />Chintame ku chilambo cha ku Gosheni mwakuŵandikana ni une, mmwe ni ŵanache ŵenu ni isukulu yenu pamo ni ilango yenu ni ipanje yose inkwete. <verse eid="GEN 45:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 45:11" />Pachinchiŵa ku Gosheni, chinangose mmwe, ni achalongo ŵenu pamo ni ilango yenu kuti nkawa ni sala pakuŵa isigalile yaka nsano ya sala jannope.’ ”<verse eid="GEN 45:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 45:12" />Nipele che Yusufu ŵatite, “Sambano ŵanyamwe mwachinsyene nnyiweni kwa meeso genu, namose mpwanga che Benjamini aiweni kwa meeso gakwe kuti ndili une che Yusufu jungukunguluka ni ŵanyamwe. <verse eid="GEN 45:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 45:13" />Nkaasalile atati ŵangu nkati ulamusi undinao akuno ku Misili, ni yose innyiŵeni. Nipele njanguye nkaiche nao akuno.”<verse eid="GEN 45:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 45:14" />Nipele che Yusufu ŵakumbatile che Benjamini apwao, ni kutanda kulila. Nombe nawo che Benjamini ŵalisile ali akumbatilene. <verse eid="GEN 45:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 45:15" />Ŵaakumbatile achalongo ŵakwe wose akuno achililaga. Pakumala yeleyo, achalongo ŵakwe ŵatandite kukunguluka nawo.<verse eid="GEN 45:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Falao akunnalika che Yakubu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 45:16" />Ngani jila pajapikaniche ku nyuumba ja Falao kuti achapwakwe che Yusufu aikangene, Falao ni ŵakutumichila ŵakwe ŵasangalele. <verse eid="GEN 45:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 45:17" />Kwayele, Falao ŵaasalile che Yusufu, “Nkaasalile achapwenu, apachile misigo pa inyama yao, ni kuuja ku Kanaani, <verse eid="GEN 45:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 45:18" />akaajigale atati ŵao ni achalongo ŵao ni kwaikanao apano. Uneji chinaape liuto lyambone lyakutama pa Misili, kuchatame ni kulya chilichose chachichipatikane ni kusangalala. <verse eid="GEN 45:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 45:19" />Sooni mwaasalile, ajigale mutuka syakwekwelemya ni inyama kutyochela ku Misili kuti akaajigalanje ŵanache ŵao pamo ni achiŵankwawo ni atati ŵenu. <verse eid="GEN 45:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 45:20" />Mwasalile akaganisisya nkati ipanje yao, pakuŵa liuto lyambone kupunda gose ga pa Misili chiliŵe lyao.”<verse eid="GEN 45:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 45:21" />Ŵanache ŵa che Yakubu ŵatesile mpela yatite pakulajiswa. Che Yusufu ŵapele mutuka ni yakulya ya mwitala, malinga ni iŵalajisye Falao. <verse eid="GEN 45:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 45:22" />Kila jumo jwao ŵampele mwinjilo wine, nambo che Benjamini ŵapele ipande mia tatu ya madini ga feza ni minjilo jine nsano. <verse eid="GEN 45:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 45:23" />Sooni ŵaapelechele atatigwe aji mituuka ji kwaligongo lya ulendo wakwe: Mbunda likumi syasijigele indu yambone ya Misili, ni mikolo ja mbunda kumi sisyajigele yakulya, mikate ni indu ine. <verse eid="GEN 45:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 45:24" />Nipele, che Yusufu ŵalangene ni achapwakwe, ni alinkutyoka ŵaasalile, “Nkakangana mwitala.”<verse eid="GEN 45:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 45:25" />Pelepo ŵatyosile ku Misili ni kwaula kumusi kwa atati ŵao yaani che Yakubu, ku chilambo cha Kanaani. <verse eid="GEN 45:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 45:26" />Ŵaasalile atati ŵao, “Che Yusufu ali jwanjumi! Ali jwankulu jwa chilambo chose cha Misili!” Che Yakubu ŵagambile jasaa, nganakombola kugakulupilila maloŵe gao. <verse eid="GEN 45:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 45:27" />Nambo paŵaatanjile yanayose iŵalajisye che Yusufu, ni paŵasiweni mutuka siŵapeleche che Yusufu kukwajigala, ntima u che Yakubu wakwete machili sooni. <verse eid="GEN 45:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 45:28" />Ŵatite, “Sambano ntima wangu utulele, mwanangu che Yusufu ali jwanjumi. Chinyaule ngaalole nganime kuwa.”<verse eid="GEN 45:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 45" />
  <chapter number="46" style="c" sid="GEN 46" />
  <para style="s">Che Yakubu akwaula ku Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 46:1" />Kwayele, che Yakubu ŵatandite ulendo ali ajigele yosepe yakwete. Paŵaiche ku Belisheba ŵapeleche mbopesi kwa Akunnungu ŵa che Isaka atatigwe. <verse eid="GEN 46:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 46:2" />Akunnungu ŵakungulwiche ni che Yakubu mu yakwiwona chilo, ŵammilasile, “Che Yakubu, che Yakubu!” Che Yakubu ŵajanjile, “Une ndili apano.” <verse eid="GEN 46:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 46:3" />Akunnungu ŵansalile, “Uneji ndili Akunnungu, Akunnungu jwa atati ŵenu, nkajogopa kwaula ku Misili, pakuŵa kweleko tinantende mme chilambo chachikulungwa. <verse eid="GEN 46:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 46:4" />Uneji chinyaule ni mmwe ku Misili, ni une tinankwesye sooni kummusya ku Kanaani. Makono ga che Yusufu ni gatigagausye meeso genu pa lyuwa lya chiwa chenu.”<verse eid="GEN 46:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 46:5" />Nipele che Yakubu ŵatyosile ku Belisheba. Achiŵanagwe ŵanjigele atati ŵao ni ŵanache ŵao ni achiŵankwawo mu mutuka syakwekwelemya ni inyama siŵasiichenasyo che Falao kwajigala. <verse eid="GEN 46:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 46:6" />Ŵajigele ilango yao ni ipanje yao yose iŵapatile ku Kanaani, ni kwaula ku Misili. Che Yakubu ŵaajigele iŵelesi yakwe wose: <verse eid="GEN 46:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 46:7" />Achiŵanagwe ŵachilume ni achiŵanagwe achakongwe ni isukulu yao yachilume ni yachikongwe, wosepe ŵaajigele mpaka ku Misili.<verse eid="GEN 46:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 46:8" />Gelega gali meena ga ŵanache ŵa che Yakubu ŵaŵajawile nawo ku Misili, che Lubeni litiwo lyakwe, <verse eid="GEN 46:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 46:9" />achiŵanagwe che Lubeni ali che Henoki ni che Palu ni che Hesiloni ni che Kalimi. <verse eid="GEN 46:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 46:10" />Achiŵanagwe che Simeoni ali che Yamueli ni che Yamini ni che Ohadi ni che Yakini ni che Sohali ni che Shauli mwanache jwa jwankongwe Mkanaani. <verse eid="GEN 46:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 46:11" />Achiŵanagwe che Lawi ali che Gelishoni ni che Kohasi ni che Melali. <verse eid="GEN 46:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 46:12" />Achiŵanagwe che Yuda ali che Eli ni che Onani ni che Shela ni che Pelesi ni che Sela, nambo che Eli ni che Onani ŵawilile ku Kanaani. Achiŵanagwe che Pelesi ŵaliji che Hesiloni ni che Hamuli. <verse eid="GEN 46:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 46:13" />Achiŵanagwe che Isakali ali, che Tola ni che Puwa ni che Yashubu ni che Shimloni. <verse eid="GEN 46:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 46:14" />Achiŵanagwe che Sebuloni ali, che Seledi ni che Eloni ni che Yaleeli. <verse eid="GEN 46:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 46:15" />Ŵeleŵa ali ŵanache ŵachilume, ŵati che Lea ŵaŵeleche ni che Yakubu ali ku Padani Alamu pamo ni che Dina mwanagwe jwachikongwe. Kwayele, ŵanache pamo ni isukulu yao ŵaaliji, selasini ni ŵatatu.<verse eid="GEN 46:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 46:16" />Ni ŵanache ŵa che Gadi ali, che Sefoni ni che Hagi, che Shuni ni che Esiboni, che Eli, pamo ni che Alodi ni che Aleli. <verse eid="GEN 46:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 46:17" />Achiŵanagwe che Asheli ali, che Imina ni che Ishifa, ni che Ishifi ni che Belia ni che Sela alumbu ŵao. Ŵanache ŵa che Belia ali, che Hebeli ni che Malikieli. <verse eid="GEN 46:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 46:18" />Ŵelewo kumi na sita ali ŵanache ni isukulu ya che Yakubu ni che Silipa, jwakutumichila jwati che Labani ŵampele mwali jwao che Lea.<verse eid="GEN 46:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 46:19" />Che Laheli ŵaaŵelechele che Yakubu ŵanache ŵaŵili, che Yusufu ni che Benjamini. <verse eid="GEN 46:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 46:20" />Che Yusufu ŵakwete ŵanache ŵaŵili ku Misili, che Manase ni che Eflahimu, ŵaŵaŵelechele kwa mwali ju che Potifela, juŵaliji jwambopesi jwa ku Heliopolisi. <verse eid="GEN 46:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 46:21" />Ŵanache ŵa che Benjamini ŵaliji, che Bela ni che Bekeli ni che Ashibeli ni che Gela, ni che Naamani ni che Ehi ni che Loshi, ni che Mupimu pamo ni che Hupimu ni che Alidi. <verse eid="GEN 46:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 46:22" />Ŵele kumi na nne ŵaliji uŵelesi u che Yakubu ni ŵankwawo che Raheli.<verse eid="GEN 46:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 46:23" />Mwanache ju che Dani jwaliji che Hushimu. <verse eid="GEN 46:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 46:24" />Ŵanache ŵa che Nafutali ŵaliji, che Yaseeli ni, che Guni ni che Yeseli pamo ni che Shilemu. <verse eid="GEN 46:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 46:25" />Ŵele saba ali uŵelesi u che Yakubu ni ŵankwawo che Biliha, jwakutumichila jwankongwe ju che Labani jwati ŵampele che Laheli.<verse eid="GEN 46:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 46:26" />Uŵelesi u che Yakubu uŵapite nao ku Misili ŵaliji ŵandu sitini na sita paangaŵalanjila achakwegwao. <verse eid="GEN 46:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 46:27" />Pamo ni ŵanache ŵaŵili ŵa che Yusufu ŵaŵapagwile ku Misili, wose kwa pamo ŵaliji sabini.<verse eid="GEN 46:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yakubu ni nnango ŵao kwele ku Misili ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 46:28" />Che Yakubu ŵanlongwesye che Yuda ku che Yusufu kukwaŵenda asimane nao ku Gosheni, ni che Yakubu ni nnango wakwe paŵaiche kweleko, <verse eid="GEN 46:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 46:29" />che Yusufu ŵakwesile mu mutuka jao jajikukwekwelemwa ni falasi, ŵapite ku Gosheni kwachingamila atatigwe. Paŵasimene ni atatigwe, ŵankumbatile ni kulila kwa katema kakaleu. <verse eid="GEN 46:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 46:30" />Che Yakubu ŵansalile che Yusufu, “Sambano ndili chile kuwa, ligongo nammweni kwa meeso gangu, ngumanyilila kuti ndi jwanjumi.” <verse eid="GEN 46:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 46:31" />Che Yusufu ŵaasalile achapwakwe ni achalongo ŵa atati ŵao, “Ngwaula kukwasalila Falao kuti, achalongo ŵangu wose pamo ni atati ŵangu uŵatamaga ku Kanaani aikangene kukwangu. <verse eid="GEN 46:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 46:32" />Chinjaasalila kuti ŵanyamwe wose nkulanga ni nkuichinga ilango yenu. Nnyikangene ni ilango yenu pamo ni chilichose chinkwete. <verse eid="GEN 46:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 46:33" />Nipele Falao pachachimmilanga ni kummusya masengo gankugapanganya, <verse eid="GEN 46:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 46:34" />nkaajanje yambone kuti mwanya ŵakutumichila ŵao nli ŵakulanga ilango kutandilila ku uchanda ŵenu mpaka lelo, nti iŵaliji achachekulu ŵetu. Nkajanje yeleyo kuti annechelele ntame mu chilambo cha ku Gosheni.” Che Yusufu ŵaasalile yeleyo pakuŵa ŵandu ŵa ku Misili ngakwasaka ŵakuchinga wose.<verse eid="GEN 46:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 46" />
  <chapter number="47" style="c" sid="GEN 47" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 47:1" />Nipele che Yusufu ŵajawile kwa Falao kukwasalila, “Atati ŵangu ni achalongo achinjangu aiche akuno kutyochela ku Kanaani ali ni ngondolo syao ni mbusi ni ng'ombe ni indu yao yose yakwete. Sambano jino alinji ku Gosheni.” <verse eid="GEN 47:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 47:2" />Ŵaajigele achakulugwe nsano ni ŵajilenao kwa Falao. <verse eid="GEN 47:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 47:3" />Falao ŵaausisye achalongo ŵala kuti, “Ana masengo genu gali chichi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 47:3">Ni ŵajanjile kuti, “Masengo ga uwe ŵakutumichila ŵenu gali kuchinga ilango mpela muwaŵelele achachekulu ŵetu.” <verse eid="GEN 47:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 47:4" />Ŵansalile sooni Falao kuti, “Tuiche kutama nti achalendo mu chilambo mu, pakuŵa ku Kanaani ko kwana sala jekulungwa ni ngapagwa manyasi sooni kwa ilango yetu pakuŵa gajuumwile. Kwayele achimwene, tukummenda uwe ŵakutumichila ŵenu ntukunde tukatame ku Gosheni.” <verse eid="GEN 47:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 47:5" />Falao ŵansalile che Yusufu, “Atati ŵenu ni achalongo achinjenu annyichilile mmwe, <verse eid="GEN 47:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 47:6" />ni chilambo cha Misili chili paasi penu, mwatamiche atati ŵenu ni achalongo achinjenu malo gambone nnope ga chilambo chi. Mwaleche atamanje ku Gosheni. Iŵaga nkwamanyilila ŵandu ŵaakumanyilila kugosa ni kuchinga ilango pasikati jao, mwaŵiche ajimilile ilango yangu.”<verse eid="GEN 47:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 47:7" />Nipele che Yusufu ŵanjigele che Yakubu atatigwe kukwika kukwamanyukusya kwa Falao, ni che Yakubu wampele upile Falao. <verse eid="GEN 47:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 47:8" />Falao wammusisye che Yakubu, “Ana nkwete yaka ilingwa?” <verse eid="GEN 47:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 47:9" />Che Yakubu ŵanjanjile, “Yaka ya umi wangu nkwendajenda kwangu akuno ni akunokuno ili yaka mia moja na selasini. Yaka yo ili yangatupa ni igumbele masausyo, sooni nganilandana kose ni yaka yatemi achambuje ŵangu nti ŵakwendajenda akuno ni akunokuno.” <verse eid="GEN 47:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 47:10" />Nipele che Yakubu wampele che Falao upile wakulangana ni kutyoka. <verse eid="GEN 47:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 47:11" />Che Yusufu waatamiche atatigwe ni achalongo achinjakwe pa malo gambone ku Misili ko, ŵaaŵisile pa malo ga Ramesesi mpela Falao iŵatite kulajisya. <verse eid="GEN 47:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 47:12" />Che Yusufu waliji nkwapa yakulya atatigwe ni achakulugwe achinjakwe ni wose wa mu nyuumba ja atatigwe mwakuŵajilana ni winji wa ŵandu ŵakwakulupilila.<verse eid="GEN 47:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sala jakulungwa nnope ku Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 47:13" />Nganichipagwa chakulya mu chilambo mose pakuŵa sala jo jaliji jekulungwa nnope. Nipele ŵandu ŵa ku Misili ni ku Kanaani ŵagandile nnope ni sala jo. <verse eid="GEN 47:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 47:14" />Che Yusufu ŵasongangenye mbia syosye sisyapatikanaga pakusumisya yakulya ku Misili ni ku Kanaani, ŵasijawisye ku nyuumba ja chimwenye ja Falao. <verse eid="GEN 47:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 47:15" />Ŵandu wose ŵa ku Misili ni ku Kanaani paŵamasile mbiya syao syose, Ŵamisili wose ŵannyichilile che Yusufu ni kunsalila, “Ntupe yakulya. Kwachichi tujasiche nli nkutulolechesya? Mbia syetu simasile!” <verse eid="GEN 47:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 47:16" />Che Yusufu ŵaasalile, “Iŵaga mbia syenu simasile nnyichenawo ilango yenu, ni une tinampe yakulya pakutindanya ni ilango yenu.” <verse eid="GEN 47:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 47:17" />Nipele ŵandu ŵaichenawo ilango yao ku che Yusufu, nombejo ŵaapele chakulya pakutindanya ni falasi, ni ngondolo ni mbusi ni ng'ombe ni mbunda syao. Pa chaka cho che Yusufu ŵaliji nkwapa ŵandu chakulya pakutindanya ni ilango yao.<verse eid="GEN 47:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 47:18" />Pachamasile chaka chila, ŵandu ŵannyichilile kaaŵili kunsalila, “Achimwene, uwe ngatusisa yakuti mbia syetu simasile ni kuti ilango yetu ili yenu. Sambano nganitukola chine chachisigalile chati tumpe ikawe uwe twachinsyene ni migunda jetu. <verse eid="GEN 47:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 47:19" />Kwachichi tujasiche nli nkutulolechesya ni migunda jetu jijonasiche? Ntusume uwe pamo ni migunda jetu pakutindanya ni yakulya. Uweji pamo ni migunda jetu tutuŵe achikapolo ŵa Falao. Ntupeje chakulya kuti tukajasika ni sooni ntupeje mbeju kwaligongo lya migunda jetu.”<verse eid="GEN 47:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 47:20" />Kwayele che Yusufu ŵachisumile chilambo chose cha ku Misili chiŵe cha Falao. Ŵamisili ŵasumisye migunda jao ligongo sala jo jaliji jakogoya. Kwayele chilambo chose chaliji chakwe Falao, <verse eid="GEN 47:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 47:21" />ni che Yusufu ŵaatesile ŵandu kuŵa achikapolo mu mbande syose sya ku Misili. <verse eid="GEN 47:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 47:22" />Lisi lyanganasuma che Yusufu lilyaliji lisi lya Ŵambopesi, ligongo ŵambopesi waliji nkupegwa yakulya ni Falao. Lyeleli ni ligongo nganasumisya lisi lyao. <verse eid="GEN 47:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 47:23" />Che Yusufu ŵaasalile ŵandu ŵala, “Mumbilikanile, lelo nansumile ŵanyamwe pamo ni migunda jenu jose, kuŵa ya Falao. Ngumpa mbeju aji nkapande mmigunda jo. <verse eid="GEN 47:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 47:24" />Nambo pa ndaŵi jagowola tinchigaŵanya magowolo maunjili nsano gagakulandana. Liunjili limo timpeleche kwa Falao ni maunjili gancheche gagakusigalila, chinchigosa kwaligongo lya mbeju ni yakulya kwaligongo lyenu ni ŵanache ŵenu ni ŵandu ŵa mu nyuumba jenu.” <verse eid="GEN 47:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 47:25" />Wandu ŵala ŵajanjile, “Muukulupwisye umi wetu. Pakuŵa ntutendele yambone, nowe wakwe tutuŵe achikapolo ŵa Falao.” <verse eid="GEN 47:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 47:26" />Nipele che Yusufu ŵaŵisile lilamulo lyalikuti kila mundu jwa mu chilambo cha Misili ampelechele Falao mwenye jwa ku Misili liunjili limo mmaunjili nsano ga magowolo gakwe. Lyele lilamulo lyo lili chiŵela mpaka lelo jino. Lisi lya ŵambopesi pe lyaliji lyangasumikwa kuwa lyakwe Falao.<verse eid="GEN 47:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malango gambesi ga che Yakubu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 47:27" />Nipele Ŵaisilaeli ŵatemi ku Gosheni chilambo cha ku Misili. Ŵapatile ipanje yejinji kweleko ni kuŵeleka ŵanache achajinji. <verse eid="GEN 47:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 47:28" />Che Yakubu ŵatemi ku Misili yaka kumi na saba.Yaka ya umi wakwe wose yaliji yaka mia moja alobaini na saba.<verse eid="GEN 47:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 47:29" />Pakaŵandichile katema ka chiwa chakwe, che Yakubu ŵammilasile che Yusufu mwanagwe ni kunsalila, “Iŵaga mmwe mungundile, mmiche mkono wenu paasi pa iiga yangu, ni nlumbile kuti chimme jwambone kukwangu ni chinchiindendela aila ingunsalila sambano: Ngunchondelela ngasimusika akuno ku chilambo cha Misili, <verse eid="GEN 47:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 47:30" />nambo nkaasiche pamo ni achambuje ŵangu, munyigale mundyosye mu chilambo cha Misili chi, nkaasiche ku malembe gao.” Che Yusufu ŵajanjile, “Tinjitenda mpela insasile.” <verse eid="GEN 47:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 47:31" />Che Yakubu ŵansalile, “Nnumbile kuti chintende yeleyo.” Che Yusufu ŵalumbilile, nipele che Yakubu wajineme pa nsamilo wakwe ni kwapopelela Akunnungu.<verse eid="GEN 47:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 47" />
  <chapter number="48" style="c" sid="GEN 48" />
  <para style="s">Che Yakubu akwapa upile ŵanache ŵa che Yusufu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 48:1" />Pakumala yeleyo, che Yusufu ŵasalilwe kuti atati ŵao akulwala. Ŵaajigele achiŵanagwe ŵaŵili achalume, che Manase ni che Efulaimu, ŵajawile nao kwalola atatigwe. <verse eid="GEN 48:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 48:2" />Che Yakubu paŵapilikene kuti che Yusufu mwanagwe aiche kukwalola, ŵalilimbisye kwimuka ni kutama pachindanda pepo. <verse eid="GEN 48:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 48:3" />Che Yakubu ŵansalile che Yusufu kuti “Akunnungu jwaukombole wose ŵangopochele panaliji akula ku Lusu, kuchilambo cha Kanaani ŵambele upile. <verse eid="GEN 48:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 48:4" />Ŵasalile kuti, ‘Tinaichuluye iŵelesi yenu mwakuti tachiŵa ŵandu ŵajinji, none tinantesye mme ambuje jwa ŵandu ŵajinji. Lisi li tinaape iŵelesi yenu kuti paŵe pao moŵa gose pangali mbesi.’ ” <verse eid="GEN 48:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 48:5" />Che Yakubu ŵajendelechele kuŵecheta achitiji, “Ŵanache ŵenu ŵaŵili, che Efulaimu ni che Manase ŵaŵapagwile apano pa Misili ngunaŵe kwika, ali ŵangu mwaŵelele che Lubeni ni che Simeoni. <verse eid="GEN 48:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 48:6" />Iŵaga tinkole sooni ŵanache ŵane, tachiŵa ŵenu. Ni chilambo chitakapegwe kuŵa chao chiityochele ni meena ga che Efulaimu ni che Manase. <verse eid="GEN 48:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 48:7" />Ngutenda yelei ligongo li che Raheli achikulu ŵenu. Panaliji nkutyoka ku Padani ŵawilile mu chilambo cha Kanaani, tuli tuŵandichile kwika ku Efulate ŵanechele kusupuka. Ni naasichile pelepo mungulugulu litala lyakwaula ku Efulate.” Efulate sambano pakumanyika kwa liina lya Beselehemu.<verse eid="GEN 48:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 48:8" />Che Yakubu paŵaweni ŵanache ŵa che Yusufu ŵausisye, “Ŵeleŵa ali ŵanache ŵaacheni?”<verse eid="GEN 48:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 48:9" />Che Yusufu ŵajanjile atatigwe kuti, “Ŵanyaŵa ali achiŵanangu ŵaambele Akunnungu akuno.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 48:9">Che Yakubu ni ŵatite “Mwaichisye kukwangu naape upile.” <verse eid="GEN 48:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 48:10" />Che Yakubu ŵaliji achekulwipe kwannope kwakuti nganakombolaga kulola yambone. Che Yusufu ŵaaŵandichisye ŵanache ŵao ŵala ni atatigwe, ni che Yakubu ŵaakumbatile. <verse eid="GEN 48:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 48:11" />Che Yakubu ŵansalile che Yusufu, “Nganing'anichisyaga kuti tinjimmona sooni, nambo Akunnungu ambele upile kuti nawone ni ŵanache ŵenu nombe.” <verse eid="GEN 48:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 48:12" />Che Yusufu ŵatyosisye ŵanache ŵala pa malungo ga atatigwe pala, nsyene ŵatindiŵele ni kwakotamila mpaka paasi.<verse eid="GEN 48:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 48:13" />Che Yusufu ŵaajigele sooni ŵanache ŵala, che Efulaimu ŵammisile ku nkono wanchiji wa che Yakubu ni che Manase ŵammisile kunkono wakwe wanlyo. <verse eid="GEN 48:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 48:14" />Nambo che Yakubu ŵapindikenye makono gao, nkono wanlyo ŵaŵisile pantwe pa che Efulaimu juŵaliji jwannandi ni nkono wao wanchiji ŵaŵisile pantwe pa che Manase juŵaliji mwanache jwakwitiwo. <verse eid="GEN 48:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 48:15" />Nipele che Yakubu ŵampele upile che Yusufu achitiji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:15">“Akunnungu juŵantumichilaga achatati ŵangu, che Ibulahimu ni che Isaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:15">Akunnungu juŵanongwesye mu umi wangu wose mpaka lelojino, ampe upile,<verse eid="GEN 48:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 48:16" />ni katumetume jwa kwinani juŵangulupwisye une ku yakusakala yosepe, ŵaape upile achachanda ŵa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:16">Meena ga achambuje ŵangu che Ibulahimu ni che Isaka tigajendelechele kulonjela moŵa gose pangali mbesi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 48:16">Akolanje ŵanache achajinji ni isukulu yakwe pachilambo pano.”<verse eid="GEN 48:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 48:17" />Che Yusufu nganiyanonyela paŵaiweni atatigwe aŵisile nkono wao wakunlyo pantwe pa che Efulaimu. Kwayele ŵaukamwile nkono wa atatigwe autyosye pantwe pa che Efulaimu kuti auŵiche pantwe pa che Manase. <verse eid="GEN 48:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 48:18" />Che Yusufu ŵansalile atatigwe, “Ngaŵa yeleyo atati! Mwanache jwakwitiwo ni aju, mmicheje nkono wenu wakunlyo pantwe pakwe.”<verse eid="GEN 48:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 48:19" />Nambo atatigwe ŵakanile achitiji, “Ngumanyilila mwanangu, ngumanyilila. Che Manase nombejo tachiŵa chilambo chekulungwa ni chachikumanyika. Namose yeleyo mpwao ju tachiŵa jwankulu nnope kumpunda nkulugwe, ni uŵelesi wao tachiŵa ŵandu ŵa ilambo yejinji.”<verse eid="GEN 48:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 48:20" />Che Yakubu ŵaapele upile ŵanache ŵala pa lyuwa lilyolyo, ŵatite, “Ŵaisilaeli tachigakolanga meena genu pakusaka kwapa ŵandu upile, taachisala, ‘Akunnungu antendele ukoto mpela che Efulaimu ni che Manase.’” Pakuŵecheta yeleyo che Yakubu ŵammisile che Efulaimu mbujo mwa che Manase.<verse eid="GEN 48:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 48:21" />Pelepo che Yakubu ŵansalile che Yusufu, “Uneji mandichile kuwa nambo Akunnungu tachiŵa pamo ni ŵanyamwe. Nombewo tachimmusya ku chilambo cha achambuje ŵenu. <verse eid="GEN 48:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 48:22" />Tinampe mmwe ngaŵa achakulu ŵenu, chilambo cha Shekemu, chilambo chachili ni chajila chinasumwile kwa Ŵaamoli ni lipanga lyangu ni ukunje wangu.”<verse eid="GEN 48:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 48" />
  <chapter number="49" style="c" sid="GEN 49" />
  <para style="s">Che Yakubu akwapa upile achiŵanagwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 49:1" />Che Yakubu ŵaaŵilasile achiŵanagwe ni kwasalila, “Nsongangane pamo nansalile ichiinsimane pa moŵa gagakwika.<verse eid="GEN 49:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 49:2" />Nsongangane mpilikanile mwanya ŵanache ŵa che Yakubu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:2">Mumbilikanile une Isilaeli atati ŵenu.<verse eid="GEN 49:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 49:3" />Ugwe che Lubeni, mwanache jwangu jwakwitiwo, nli machili gangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:3">ni nammeleche ndili jwanchanda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:3">Mwa ŵanache ŵangu wose mmwejo mwapundile kwa luchimbichimbi ni kwa machili.<verse eid="GEN 49:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 49:4" />Mmwe nli mpela chikumbameesi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:4">Nambo ngamma sooni mundu jwakuchimbichikwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:4">Ligongo nganinjogopa kukwela pachindanda changu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:4">Mwapasakesye peuto pagona une atati ŵenu.<verse eid="GEN 49:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 49:5" />Che Simeoni ni che Lawi ali achalongo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:5">Indu yao yakumenyanila pangondo akuitumia kwa kutendelela indu ya ukaatili.<verse eid="GEN 49:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 49:6" />Uneji ngaangamulana nawo paakuŵecheta yantemela yao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:6">Ngaangamulana nawo pansongangano wao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:6">Ligongo ŵaauleje wandu mwa chikali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:6">Ni kwa usache wao ŵaakatile mitasi ng'ombe.<verse eid="GEN 49:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 49:7" />Ngukulwesya kutumbila kwao pakuŵa kuli kwakogoya nnope,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:7">Sooni nguchilwesya chikali chao changali chanasa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:7">Tinjapwilinganya mu chilambo chose chi che Yakubu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:7">Tinjamwasanya mu chilambo chose cha ku Isilaeli.<verse eid="GEN 49:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 49:8" />Mwe che Yuda, achalongo achinjenu tachinlapa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:8">Ŵammagongo ŵenu tinchapunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:8">Ni achalongo achinjenu tachintindiŵalila.<verse eid="GEN 49:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 49:9" />Che Yuda ali nti lisimba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:9">lyalikuuja kutyochela kukusakula</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:9">Che Yuda ali nti lisimba likulijongola ni kugona paasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:9">Nti lisimba lyankolo, nduni jwakukombola kulijimusya?<verse eid="GEN 49:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 49:10" />Che Yuda chaŵe mwenye moŵa gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:10">Ni iŵelesi wakwe chiutawale moŵa gose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:10">Tachitenda yeleyo mpaka pataiche nsyene umwenye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:10">Jwele jwati ŵandu wose ŵa ilambo chachinjitichisya.<verse eid="GEN 49:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 49:11" />Tachijitaŵilila mbunda jakwe pachitela cha msabibu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:11">Nombe mwanambunda jwakwe pachitela chambone cha msabibu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:11">Yakuwala yakwe akuchapa mu divai ni miinjilo jakwe mu divai jechejeu.<verse eid="GEN 49:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 49:12" />Meeso gakwe tigaŵe gakuchejela ligongo lya kung'wa nnope divai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:12">Ni meeno gakwe gamaswela kugapunda maŵele.<verse eid="GEN 49:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 49:13" />Che Sabuloni tachiwa mungulugulu bahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:13">Yombo ya mubahali taachijimika mwelemo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:13">Mpika wa chilambo chakwe chiuŵe mumbali mwa Sidoni.<verse eid="GEN 49:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 49:14" />Che Isakali ali mpela mbunda jamachili</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:14">Jwagonile pasikati ja misigo jakwe.<verse eid="GEN 49:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 49:15" />Ŵapaweni peuto pakupumulila kuti pali pambone</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:15">ni kuti sooni chilambo cho chili chambone.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:15">Ŵajineme kutwichila nsigo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:15">Ŵaliji kapolo jwakupanganya masengo gakwakanganichisya.<verse eid="GEN 49:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 49:16" />Che Dani tachiŵa jwakulamula jwa ŵandu ŵakwe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:16">tachiŵa jumo jwa ngosyo syose sya ku Isilaeli.<verse eid="GEN 49:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 49:17" />Che Dani tachiŵa mpela lijoka mwitala</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:17">lijoka lya sumu mungulugulu litala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:17">Lyalikuluma indende ya falasi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:17">ni jwakukwela falasi akugwa lugali.<verse eid="GEN 49:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 49:18" />Alakwe Ambuje Akunnungu ngulindilila chikulupusyo chenu.<verse eid="GEN 49:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 49:19" />Che Gadi taguluchilwe ni ŵachiswamba</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:19">nambo ŵelewo tachakuya chapanyuma ni kwaputa.<verse eid="GEN 49:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 49:20" />Che Asheli tachilya yakulya yambone</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:20">Tachisogosya yakulya yakuŵajilwa kuligwa ni mamwenye.<verse eid="GEN 49:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 49:21" />Che Nafutali ali mpela ngolombwe jajilechelelwe kwendanjenda</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:21">Jajikuŵeleka ŵanache ŵakusalala.<verse eid="GEN 49:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 49:22" />Che Yusufu ali mpela msabibu waukusogola isogosi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:22">Chitela chachikusogola mungulugulu uliŵa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:22">Nyambi syakwe sitambasukulile mu likumba.<verse eid="GEN 49:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 49:23" />Ŵandu ŵakwete mikunje ni mipamba ŵamputile kwa mipamba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:23">Ŵamponyele mipamba ni kunsausya kakajinji.<verse eid="GEN 49:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 49:24" />Nambo ukunje wakwe uli chilimbile</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:24">Makono gao gatajikwe machili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:24">kwa ukombole wa jwali ni machili, Akunnungu jwa che Yakubu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:24">Kwa liina lya jwakuchinga, ŵelewo lwala lwa Isilaeli.<verse eid="GEN 49:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 49:25" />Elo, Akunnungu ŵa atati jwenu ni juchankamuchisye</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:25">Akunnungu jwali ni machili ni jutachimpa upile</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:25">Jutachimpa upile pakumpa ula kutyochela kwinani</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:25">Ni upile kutyochela mmeesi gakwendesya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:25">Ni upile wakukola ng'ombe syesijinji ni ŵanache.<verse eid="GEN 49:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 49:26" />Upile kutyochela kwa atati ŵenu uli wa machili</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:26">kuupunda upile wa matumbi ga chiikala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:26">chiuŵe wambone kupunda indu yambone yaikutyochela mmatumbi go.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:26">Upile wosepe uŵe pantwe wa che Yusufu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:26">pachanya pa usyo wa jwelejo juŵalekangene ni achalongo achinjakwe.<verse eid="GEN 49:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 49:27" />Che Benjamini ali mpela lisogo lyakogoya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GEN 49:27">Kundaŵi likuulaga ŵammagongo ŵakwe ni ligulo likwagaŵila ŵane yasumwile.”<verse eid="GEN 49:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 49:28" />Syelesi sili ngosyo kumi na mbili sya ŵandu ŵa ku Isilaeli, ni yeleyi ni iŵaŵechete che Yakubu atati ŵao kwa ŵanyawo, pa lyuŵa liŵampaga upile. Jwalijose ŵampele upile ŵaukummajila.<verse eid="GEN 49:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chiwa chi che Yakubu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 49:29" />Pelepo che Yakubu ŵaasalile achiŵanagwe, “Une mandichile kuwa, nkaasiche kwagonile achatati ŵangu mu mbugu jijili mungunda u che Efuloni jwa lukosyo lwa Ŵahiti, <verse eid="GEN 49:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 49:30" />Akula ku Makipela kungopochelo lyuŵa kwa musi wa Mamule mu chilambo cha Kanaani. Che Ibulahimu ŵasumile mbugu ni ngunda wo kutyochela ku che Efuloni jwa lukosyo lwa Ŵahiti kuti paŵe pakwe pakusichila. <verse eid="GEN 49:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 49:31" />Kweleko ni muŵansichile che Ibulahimu ni che Sala ŵankwawo, kukoko ni kuŵansichile che Isaka ni che Lebeka ŵankwawo, sooni kukoko ni kunaasichile che Lea ŵankwangu. <verse eid="GEN 49:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 49:32" />Ngunda pamo ni mbugu jijili mungunda yasumikwe kutyochela kwa Ŵahiti.” <verse eid="GEN 49:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 49:33" />Che Yakubu paŵamasile kuŵecheta yeleyo yose ŵagonile sooni pachindanda pala. Pelepo ŵapumwile mbumu ja mbesi ni kwasika.<verse eid="GEN 49:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 49" />
  <chapter number="50" style="c" sid="GEN 50" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 50:1" />Pelepo che Yusufu ŵaligwisisye pa ntembo wa atatigwe, ŵankumbatile ni kulila. <verse eid="GEN 50:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 50:2" />Ŵaalajisye ŵamitela ŵaŵaliji nkwatumichila kuti autaje ntembo wa atatigwe ntela kuti ukaola. <verse eid="GEN 50:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 50:3" />Masengo go gatendekwe kwa moŵa alobaini pakuŵa gelego ni moŵa gagasachilwe kutaga ntela kuti ntembo ukaola. Ŵamisili nombewo ŵalisile malilo ga che Yakubu kwa moŵa sabini.<verse eid="GEN 50:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 50:4" />Pagamasile moŵa gakulila malilo gala, che Yusufu ŵaasalile ŵakutumichila ŵa Falao achitiji, “Iŵaga mungundile, choonde ngummenda nkakunguluche ni Falao pamalo pangu, mwasalile kuti atati ŵangu ŵanumbisye achitiji, <verse eid="GEN 50:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 50:5" />‘Uneji mandichile kuwa, nkaasiche mwilembe linalisepele mu chilambo cha Kanaani.’ Sambano ngwaŵenda angunde nyaule ngaasiche atati ŵangu, ni uneji tingauje.” <verse eid="GEN 50:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 50:6" />Falao ŵatite, “Njaule nkaasiche atati ŵenu mpela iŵatite kunnumbisya.” <verse eid="GEN 50:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 50:7" />Pelepo che Yusufu ŵajawile kukwasika atatigwe. Ŵakutumichila wose ŵa Falao ni achakulu ŵa pankungulu pamo ni ŵandu ŵaakumanyika ŵa mchilambo chose cha Misili ŵampechesye che Yusufu. <verse eid="GEN 50:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 50:8" />Ŵalongene nombe ŵandu wose ŵa mu nyuumba jao, achalongo achinjakwe wose pamo ni ŵandu wose ŵa mu nyuumba ja atatigwe, ku Gosheni ko, ŵasigalile ŵanache pe pamo ni ilango yao. <verse eid="GEN 50:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 50:9" />Achalume ŵakwendesya mutuka ni ŵakwela falasi nombe ŵampechesye, ni ŵaliji mpingo wekulungwa nnope.<verse eid="GEN 50:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 50:10" />Paŵaichenje peuto pakuputukulila yakulya ku Atandi komboka lusulo lwa Yolodani ŵalisile malilo kwannope, nombe che Yusufu ŵalisile malilo ga atatigwe pelepo kwa moŵa saba. <verse eid="GEN 50:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 50:11" />Ŵandu ŵa ku Kanaani paŵaweni ŵandu wo ali nkulila malilo ku Atandi ko, ŵatite “Kulila kwa malilo kwa ŵandu ŵa ku Misili ku kuli kwakukulungwa.” Peuto pala paŵilanjikwe Abeli Misilaimu, ni pelepo pali peesi lusulo lwa Yolodani.<verse eid="GEN 50:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 50:12" />Nipele achiŵanagwe che Yakubu ŵatesile yosepe mpela atati ŵao iŵatite pakwalajisya. <verse eid="GEN 50:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 50:13" />Ŵagajigele malilo gala mpaka chilambo cha ku Kanaani, ŵansichile mu mbugu jajili mu ngunda ku Makipela, kungopochelo lyuŵa kwa musi wa Mamule. Welewo uli ngunda uŵasumile che Ibulahimu ku che Efuloni jwa lukosyo lwa Ŵahiti kuti paŵe pakwe pakusichila. <verse eid="GEN 50:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 50:14" />Che Yusufu paŵamasile kusika malilo ga atatigwe, ŵausile ku Misili pamo ni achalongo achinjakwe ni ŵandu wose ŵaŵapechesye malilo.<verse eid="GEN 50:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Yusufu akwalechelesya achakulugwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 50:15" />Achakulugwe che Yusufu paŵaiweni kuti atati ŵao awile, ŵatite, “Ana chiiŵe uli iŵaga che Yusufu chatuchime uweji ni kutuuchisya yangalumbana yose itwantendele?” <verse eid="GEN 50:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 50:16" />Ni wanjauchisye utenga achitiji, “Atati ŵetu akanajasiche ŵatusalile kuti, <verse eid="GEN 50:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 50:17" />‘Mwasalile che Yusufu kuti choonde ngummenda mwalechelesye achakulugwenu ileŵo yao ni igongomalo yose iŵantendele alakwe.’ Sambano choonde ntulechelesye ugongomalo utwantendele uwe ŵakutumichila wa Akunnungu ŵa Atati ŵenu.” Che Yusufu paŵapilikene yeleyo ŵatandite kulila. <verse eid="GEN 50:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 50:18" />Achakulugwe che Yusufu ŵaiche ŵatindiŵele ni kukotama mpaka paasi ni kuti, “Uwe tuli achikapolo ŵenu.” <verse eid="GEN 50:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 50:19" />Nambo che Yusufu ŵaasalile, “Nkajogopanga! Ana uneji ndili pamalo pa Akunnungu? <verse eid="GEN 50:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 50:20" />Ŵanyamwe mwasachile kumbanganyichisya indu yakusakala nambo Akunnungu ŵasachile indu yambone. Ŵasachile kuti ŵandu ŵajinji aŵeje ŵajumi nti yaitite lelo. <verse eid="GEN 50:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 50:21" />Sambano nkajogopanga, tinampe yakulya mwanya pamo ni ŵanache ŵenu.” Nipele ŵaatulesye ntima ni kukunguluka nawo yambone.<verse eid="GEN 50:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chiwa chi che Yusufu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 50:22" />Che Yusufu ŵatemi ku Misili pamo ni ŵandu wose ŵaŵaiche ni atatigwe, ŵatemi yaka mia moja ni likumi. <verse eid="GEN 50:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 50:23" />Che Yusufu ŵatemi yaka yejinji mpaka ŵaweni ŵanache ŵa che Efulaimu ni isukulu yanchiuja. Pa lyuŵa liŵapagwile ŵanache che Makili mwanache ju che Manase, che Yusufu ŵaapochele ŵanache wo nti achiŵanagwe.<verse eid="GEN 50:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 50:24" />Che Yusufu ŵaasalile achalongo achinjakwe wala kuti, “Uneji mandichile kuwa, nambo kusyene Akunnungu tachinkamusyanga ni kunjigalanga kuntyosya mu chilambo chi kunjausya mu chilambo chiŵannumbilile che Ibulahimu ni che Isaka ni che Yakubu kuti tachaapa.” <verse eid="GEN 50:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 50:25" />Che Yusufu ŵaalumbisye Ŵaisilaeli achitiji, “Nlumbile kuti lyele lyuŵa Akunnungu patachinlongosya ku chele chilambo cho, tinchijigala chiilu changu kutyochela akuno.”<verse eid="GEN 50:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 50:26" />Nipele, che Yusufu ŵawile ku misili kula ali ni yaka mia moja ni likumi. Ŵachipachile chiilu chakwe ntela kuti chikaola, ŵachiŵisile mu lisanduku ku Misili kula.<verse eid="GEN 50:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 50" />
</usx>